hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman bin al-Mughirah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali bin Rabi'ah al-Asadi ko Asma — ya Abu Asma — al-Fazari se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko farmate hue suna: Jab bhi main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se koi hadees sunta, to Allah Ta'ala mujhe us se utna nafa pahunchata jitna woh chahta ke mujhe nafa pahunche Hazrat Ali ne kaha: Aur mujhe Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hadees bayan ki — aur Abu Bakr ne sach kaha — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda aisa nahin jo koi gunah kare, phir wuzu kare aur do rak'at namaz padhe, phir Allah se bakhshish mange, magar Allah use muaf kar deta hai phir Aap ne yeh aayat tilawat ki: {Aur jo log buraiyan karen ya apni janon par zulm karen to Allah ko yaad karke apne gunahon ki atiya mangte hain} aayat ke anta tak, aur doosri aayat: {Aur jo bura kare ya apni jaan par zulm kare} aayat ke anta tak"
"2","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin al-Mughirah se, Ali bin Rabi'ah se, Asma bin al-Hakam al-Fazari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko farmate hue suna: Jab bhi main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees sunta, to Allah mujhe utna nafa deta jitna woh chahta ke mujhe nafa pahunche, aur jab koi aur mujhe hadees bayan karta to main us se qasam leta ke Us ne Aap se suna hai, phir us ki sach karta aur mujhe Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hadees bayan ki — aur Abu Bakr ne sach kaha — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya... Phir Shu'bah ki hadees jaisi baat zikr ki"
"3","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Ubaid bin as-Sabbaq ne mujhe khabar di ke Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Yamama walon ke qatl ke baad mujhe bulwaya, aur Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) un ke paas the unhon ne kaha: Yeh shakhs mere paas aaya aur mujhe khabar di ke is jagah — ya'ni Yamama ke din — mein Quran ke qariyon mein qatl bahut badh gaya hai, aur mujhe dar hai ke doosri jaghon mein bhi qariyon mein qatl badh jaega aur Quran jata rahega, aur Main ne rae qayam ki hai ke tum use jama karo Main ne un se — ya'ni Umar se — kaha: Ham aisa kaam kaise karen jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nahin kiya? Umar ne mujh se kaha: Allah ki qasam, yeh bhalai hai Umar mujhe musalsal samjhate rahe yahan tak ke Allah ne mera seena usi cheez ke liye ho diya jis ke liye un ka seena khola tha, aur main un se sahmat ho gaya aur tum aqalmand aadmi ho, tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye Wahy likha karte the, liye ham tum par shak nahin karte; lehaza use jama karo"
"4","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Tauba al-Anbari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu as-Sawwar al-Anbari ko Abu Barzah se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tha jabke woh ek aadmi ko dhamka rahe the aur us se sakhti kar rahe the, to main ne kaha: Kya main us ki gardan na maar dun? Abu Bakr ne kaha: Yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke baad kisi ke liye nahin hai"
"5","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Khumair ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sulaim bin Amir ko Awsat al-Bajali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khutba dete hue suna Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka zikr kiya aur roye, phir kaha — ya'ni Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya —: Sach ko thamne rakho, kyunke woh neki ki taraf le jati hai, aur donon jannat mein hain aur jhoot se bacho, kyunke woh burayi ki taraf le jata hai, aur donon aag mein hain aur Allah se yaqeen aur afiyat mango, kyunke logon ko yaqeen ke baad afiyat se behtar kuch nahin diya gaya — ya unhon ne kaha: Mu'afi —. aur ek-doosre se hasad na karo, ek-doosre se nafrat na karo, ek-doosre se miskeen na todna, ek-doosre se munh na phero, aur Allah ke bando bhai-bhai kar Hazrat"
"6","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Yahya bin Talha bin Ubaidullah se, unhon ne kaha: Isa bin Talha ne mujhe khabar di, Ummul-Mu'minin Hazrat A'ishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) jab bhi Uhud ke din ka zikr karte samne, phir kehte: Woh sab Talha ka din tha phir woh bayan karne lage, unhon ne kaha: Uhud ke din main sab pahle laut wala tha, aur Main ne ek aadmi ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ladte hue dekha jo Aap hifazat kar raha tha — mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Aap hifazat kar raha tha —. unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kaash yeh Talha ho, kyunke jo mujh se choot gaya so choot gaya Main ne apne dil mein kaha: Kaash woh meri qaum ka aadmi ho, yeh mujhe zyada pasandeeda hai mere aur Mashriq ki taraf ke darmiyan ek aadmi tha jise main nahin pahchanta tha, aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke us se zyada qareeb tha, lekin woh tez se chal raha tha jis tarah main nahin chal sakta tha, aur dekha to woh Abu Ubaidah bin al-Jarrah the ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunche aur Aapka samne wala dant toot gaya tha, Aapka chehra zakhmi tha, aur topiyan (mighafara) ke do challe Aap rukhsaron mein dhansa gae the Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne sathi ki durust karo, ya'ni Talha, jise khoon beh raha tha, lekin Unhon ne Aap baat par dhyaana nahin diya main Aap chehre se woh nikaalane gaya, lekin Abu Ubaidah ne kaha: Main tum ko apne haq ki qasam deta hun, mujhe chhod do to Main ne unhen chhod diya Unhon ne apne hath se unhen pakaranaa qasam na samjha taake Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko takleef na ho, liye Unhon ne apne munh se unhen dabocaa aur ek dhundli nikal liya, aur challe ke sath un ka samne wala dant gir gaya main waisa hi karne gaya jaisa Unhon ne kiya tha, lekin unhon ne kaha: Main tum ko apne haq ki qasam deta hun, mujhe chhod do unhon ne kaha: Phir Unhon ne pehli martaba jaisa kiya waisa hi kiya aur doosra samne wala dant bhi challe ke sath gir gaya is tarah Abu Ubaidah aankhon ke girne ke baavajuuda sab khubsurat logon mein se ho gaye Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki durust ki, phir ham un gaddhon mein se ek mein Talha ke paas aae, aur dekha ke unhen kuch sattar — ya kam ya zyada — bhaale, teer aur talwar ke zakhm lage the, aur un ki ungli kat gayi thi, to Ham ne un ki durust ki"
"7","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sadqa bin Musa aur Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Farqad se, Murrah se, Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jannat ke darwaze par dastak dene wala sab pehla woh banda hai Jis ne Allah ke haq aur apne maalikon ke haq ada kiye"
"8","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sadqa bin Musa aur Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Farqad se, Murrah se, Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na Dhokebaz jannat mein dakhil hoga na khayanat karne chhae"
"9","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Asim as-Saqafi ko kehte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Hazrat Abu Bakr as-Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe koi aisi cheez farmayen jo main subah aur Sham karun Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah, posheeda aur zahir ke janne wale, aasmanon aur zameen ke paida karne wale, har cheez ke Rabb aur Badshah, main gawahi deta hun ke Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin, main apni nafs ki burayi se aur shaitan ki burayi aur us ke shirk se Teri panah mangta hun Ise subah, Sham aur jab leto kaho"
"10","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salim bin Abdullah ko apne walid se riwayat karte hue suna, ke Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se umrah ki ijazat mangi, to Aap ne unhen ijazat di aur un se kaha: Aey mere bhai, apni dua mein hamen bhi shamil karna — ya — apni dua mein hamen na bhuulanaa."
"11","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Salim se, un ke walid se, ke Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jo ham karte hain — Kya yeh koi nai baat hai ya pahle se tayashudaa? Aap ne farmaya: Pahle se tayashudaa. amal karo, Aey Khattab ke bete, kyunke har ek ke liye Wahy aasan kiya gaya hai jo khushanasiibon mein se hoga woh khushanasiibon ke amal karega, aur jo badanasiibon mein se hoga woh badanasiibon ke amal karega"
"12","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, jo Zubair ke gharane ke kaarindaa the, Salim se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo in bazaron mein se kisi bazaar mein dakhil ho aur kahe: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, woh akela hai, us ka koi Shareek nahin, usi ki badshahat hai aur usi ki tareef hai, woh zinda karta hai aur maut deta hai, aur woh zinda hai jo kabhi nahin marega, usi ke hath mein bhalai hai, aur woh har cheez par qadir hai — Allah Ta'ala us ke liye das laakha nekiyan likhegaa, us se das laakha buraaiyaan mitaaegaa, aur us ke liye jannat mein ek mahal banata"
"13","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi aadmi aisa nahin jo kisi museebat ko dekhe aur kahe: Sab tareef Allah ke liye hai Jis ne mujhe us se mahfooz rakha jis mein tumhein mubtala kiya aur mujhe apni bahut-si makhlooq par bade fazeelat di — magar woh museebat use nahin pahuncegii, chahe woh koi bhi ho"
"14","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, ek aadmi se, Ibn Umar se, Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko chamde ke mouzon par masah karte dekha"
"15","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se, Ibn Umar se, Umar bin al-Khattab se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maiyyat ko us ki qabr mein us par nauha karne ki wajah se azab diya jata hai"
"16","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Hakam as-Sulami ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se nabeez ke bare mein poocha, aur Unhon ne Umar se riwayat kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mitti ke gharon, tuunbiyon aur raala lepe bartanon se mana farmaya"
"17","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin dinar ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main raat mein junubi ho jata hun, main Kya karun? Aap ne farmaya: Apni sharmgah dho, wuzu karo, phir so jao"
"18","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sakhr bin Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Umar se, ke Umar ne Utarid at-Tamimi ka ek Habarah shagaaf jubba dekha dekha Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh jubba khareed lein aur Jume ke din aur wafd ke aane par pehna Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ise Wahy pehenta hai jis ka aakhirat mein koi hissa nahin baad mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aise hi jubbe jane gae aur Aap ne ek Umar ko bheja Umar Aap paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aaj Aap ne mujhe ek jubba bheja halanke Aap ne Utarid ke jubbe ke bare mein jo kaha tha woh kaha tha Aap ne farmaya: Ise apne faayade ke liye bech do ya apni aurton ko pahna do"
"19","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juwairiyah bin Asma ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae jabke woh apne baap ki qasam kha rahe the Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen pukara: Allah Ta'ala tumhen apne baap-baapon ki qasam khane se mana karta hai; jo qasam khae woh Allah ki qasam khae ya khamosh rahe"
"20","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah, Hisham aur Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Yunus bin Jubair se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha Jis ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq di unhon ne kaha: Kya tum Ibn Umar ko jante ho? Unhon ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq di thi, aur Umar ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Woh use wapas le le"
"21","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Matar al-Warraq se, Abdullah bin Buraidah al-Aslami se, Yahya bin Ya'mur se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne mujhe bayan kiya ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the jab ek aadmi do safed suthare kapde pahne, khubsurat soorat mein aaya, aur kaha: Kya main Aap qareeb aa sakta hun, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Qareeb Donon woh qareeb aata raha yahan tak ke us ka ghutanaa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ghutne se lag gaya phir us ne kaha: Kya main Aap se poochte sakta hun? Aap ne farmaya: Poocho us ne kaha: Mujhe Islam ke bare mein bataaie. Aap ne farmaya: Is baat ki gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin aur main Allah ka Rasulullah hun, namaz qayam karna, zakat dena, Baitullah ka Hajj aur Ramazan ke roze. us ne kaha: Agar main aisa karun to Kya main Musalman hun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han us aadmi ne Aap se kaha: Aap ne sach kaha hamen us ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yeh kehne par ta'ajjub hua: Aap ne sach kaha, jaise woh Aap se zyada janta ho phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe iman ke bare mein bataaie. Aap ne farmaya: Iman yeh hai ke Allah, us ke farishton, us ki kitabon, us ke Rasoolon, maut ke baad dobara zinda hone, jannat aur jahannam par iman lao, aur taqdeer ke maroof aur bure par iman aao us ne kaha: Agar main aisa karun to Kya main mu'min hun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han us ne kaha: Aap ne sach kaha phir us ne kaha: Mujhe farmayen ihasaana Kya hai Aap ne farmaya: Allah se is tarah daro jaise tum use dekh rahe ho, kyunke agar tum use nahin dekhte to woh tumhen dekhta hai us ne kaha: Aap ne sach kaha phir us ne kaha: Mujhe qayamat ke bare mein bataaie. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke bare mein poocha gaya hai woh poochne wale se zyada nahin jaanta woh paanch hain jinhein Allah ke siwa koi nahin janta: {Beshak Allah ke paas qayamat ka ilm hai aur woh baarish utarta hai} aayat ke anta tak us aadmi ne kaha: Aap ne sach kaha"
"22","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud Ibn Abi al-furaata ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Buraidah se, Abu al-Aswad Woh-dualii se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath baitha, aur unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi aadmi aisa nahin jo mare aur teen log us ke haq mein bhalai ki gawahi den magar jannat us ke liye wajib ho jati hai main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur do? Aap ne farmaya: Aur do aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek ke bare mein nahin poocha gaya"
"23","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaid bin Hunain se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath aae yahan tak ke marra az-zaharaana pahunche Umar main mein hajat ke liye dakhil hue aur main un ke intezar mein baitha raha yahan tak ke woh bahar aaye main ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, main ek saal se Aap se ek hadees ke bare mein poochunga chahta tha lekin Aap haibat ne mujhe roka unhon ne kaha: Aisa na karo; jab tum jano ke mujhe ilm hai to mujh se poocho unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main Aap se do aurton ki hadees ke bare mein poochta hun unhon ne kaha: Haan, Hafsah aur aayashaa. Jahiliyat mein ham aurton ko samajhte nahin the na unhen apne kaamon mein shamil karte the jab Allah Ta'ala Islam laya aur Allah ne unhen wahan rakha jahan rakha aur unhen ek haq diya baghair is ke ke woh hamare kaamon mein dakhil hon, ek din jab main baitha kisi kaam mein laga tha to meri biwi ne mujh se aisi-aisi baat kahi main ne kaha: Tumhara is se Kya wasta? Tum hamare kaamon mein kab dakhil huin? Us ne kaha: Aey Khattab ke bete, koi tum baat nahin kar sakta, lekin tumhari beti Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se baat karti hai yahan tak ke Aap ghadabnak rehte hain main ne kaha: Kya woh sach mein aisa karti hai? Us ne kaha: Han to main Hafsah ke paas gaya aur kaha: Aey Hafsah, Kya tum Allah se nahin daratiin? Tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se baat karti ho yahan tak ke Aap ghadabnak rehte hain tumhara bura ho, A'ishah ki khoobi aur Rasulullah ki un se muhabbat tumhen dhoke mein na kare phir main Umm Salamah ke paas bhi gaya aur un se bhi waisa hi kaha unhon ne kaha: Tum har cheez mein dakhil ho gae ho, Aey Khattab ke bete, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur un ki biwiyon ke darmiyan kiya mera ek Ansari sathi tha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas hazir hota jab main ghaib hota aur main hazir hota jab woh ghaib hota; woh mujhe khabar deta aur main use khabar deta ham par hamla karne ke lihaaza se hamen sab zyada dar ghassaanii Badshah ka tha jab Allah ne hamare liye muamla shaanta kiya, ek din jab main baitha tha to mera sathi rota hua aaya: Abu Hafs, Abu Hafs! Main ne kaha: Tumhara bura ho, Kya hua? Kya ghassaanii aa gaya? Us ne kaha: Nahin, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ko talaq de di hai main ne kaha: Hafsah ki naak mitti mein mile! Main ne apne joote pahne aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya; har ghar mein ronaa tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) upar ki kotharii mein the aur darwaze par ek habshii ghulam tha main ne kaha: Mere liye ijazat mango Us ne ijazat mangi aur Unhon ne mujhe andar aane diya Aap ek chataai par so rahe the aur Aap sar ke neeche chamde ka takiya tha jis mein reshaa bhara tha, aur kamai hui khalen lataka rahi thin Main ne unhen khabar jo Main ne Hafsah aur Umm Salamah se kaha tha Aap ne ek mahine tak apni biwiyon se door rehne ki qasam khayi thi; jab unatiisaviin raat aai to Aap un ke paas utar aaye"
"24","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Umar se (Raziyallahu anhum), unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri farma-carhaakara tareef na karo jaise Eisaiyon ne Isa bin Maryam ki farma-carhaakara tareef ki; main sirf ek banda hun, to kaho: Allah ka banda aur us ka farmaya"
"25","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid bin Jud'an se, Yusuf bin Mihran se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne Basrah ke mimbar par hamen khutba diya, unhon ne kaha: Aey logo, Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) hamare darmiyan khade hue aur kaha: Aey logo, rajm Allah ki muqarrar saza hai, to is se dhoka tak door na ho, kyunke yeh Allah ki Kitab aur tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat mein hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rajm kiya, Abu Bakr ne rajm kiya, aur Main ne rajm kiya"
"26","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud bin Abdullah al-avadii se, Humaid bin Abdur Rahman al-himyarii se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khanjara mara gaya to main sab pahle un ke paas pahunchi unhon ne kaha: Aey Abu Abbas, meri teen baat yaad rakho, kyunke mujhe dar hai log mujh tak na pahunchen: Main ne kalaalaa ke bare mein faisla nahin kiya, Main ne logon par koi khalifa muqarrar nahin kiya, aur mera har ghulam aazad hai un se kaha gaya: Khalifa muqarrar kar den unhon ne kaha: Main jo bhi karun, mujh se behtar ne woh kiya hai; agar main muqarrar karun to mujh se behtar ne muqarrar kiya, aur agar main logon ko un ke haal par chhodun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen chhoda tha main ne kaha: Jannat ki khushkhabri ho, Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin; Aap lamba waqt tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath rahe, phir aadil se saltanat ki aur amanat ada ki Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rahi tumhari jannat ki khushkhabri, to us Allah ki qasam jis ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, agar mere paas woh sab ho jo aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan hai to main muamle janne se pahle us se apni jaan ragad lun rahe Musalmanon ke mamle, to Allah ki qasam main chahta hun ke is se barabar-barabar nikal jaun, na mere par na mere haq mein raha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sohbat, to woh to woh hai"
"27","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin vaharaama se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Unhon ne tawaf kiya aur tez chalne (ramal) se bacho chaha, phir kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sirf mushrikon ko gussa dilane ke liye ramal kiya tha phir unhon ne kaha: Yeh aisi cheez hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ki aur mana nahin kiya, to Unhon ne ramal kiya"
"28","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makkah ke Jaafar bin Usman al-Qurashi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad bin Abbad bin Jaafar ko Hajar-Aswad ko bosa aur us par sajdah karte dekha, phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne tumhare chacha Ibn Abbas ko use bosa aur us par sajdah karte dekha Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab ko use bosa aur us par sajdah karte dekha, phir Umar ne kaha: Agar Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko use bosa na dekha hota to main use na cuumataa."
"29","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu al-Aliya ar-riyaahii se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Siqah logon ne mujhe gawahi di, mein Umar the, aur mein mujhe sab zyada pasand Umar the, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Asr ke baad suraj doobne tak namaz se aur Fajr ke baad suraj nikalne tak namaz se mana farmaya"
"30","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin mikharaaqa se, Shahr bin Haushab se, Uqbah bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Main masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the Umar ne mujh se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumhare aane se pahle farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhte hue mare, us se kaha jaega: Jannat ke aath darwazon mein se jis se chaho dakhil ho jao"
"31","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne al-Jabiyah mein hamen khutba diya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan khade hue jaise main tumhare darmiyan khada hun, aur farmaya: Mere sahaba ki izzat karo, phir un ke baad walon ki, phir un ke baad walon ki phir jhoot khul jaega yahan tak ke aadmi qasam khayega halanke us se qasam nahin mangi gayi, aur gawahi dega halanke us se gawahi nahin mangi gayi jo jannat ke darmiyan ki jagah chahe woh jama'at ko thamne rahe, kyunke shaitan akele ke sath hai aur do se door hai koi aadmi kisi aurat ke sath tanhai mein na rahe, kyunke mein teesra shaitan hota hai jo apni neki se khush ho aur apni burayi se ghamgin ho woh mu'min hai"
"32","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah al-Muzani se, unhon ne kaha: Main qahat dahii aur ghee ke zamane mein Madinah aaya, jab dehati buraqaana kapde bechne bhejte the Main ne ek aadmi ko nazar uthae logon ko dekhte dekha; Main ne use Ajnabiyon samjha, to main qareeb gaya aur salam kiya Us ne mera salam diya aur kaha: Kya tum is Shahr ke ho? Main ne kaha: Han main us ke sath baitha aur poocha: Tum kaha mein se ho? Us ne kaha: Hilal mein se, mera naam khamaasa hai — ya us ne kaha: Bani Salul mein se, mera naam khamaasa hai —. phir us ne kaha: Kya main tumhen ek qissa sunaauun jo Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab se dekha? Main ne kaha: Han us ne kaha: Jab ham un ke sath baithe the to ek aurat aai aur un ke samne baithe, us ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, mere shauhar ki burayi bahut hai aur us ki bhalai kam hai Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tumhara shauhar kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Abu Salamah unhon ne kaha: Us aadmi ko sohbat hasil hai aur woh sachcha hai phir Umar ne apne sath baithe ek aadmi se kaha: Kya aisa hi nahin hai? Us ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, ham unhen waisa hi jante hain jaisa Aap ne kaha Umar ne ek aadmi se kaha: Utho aur use bulao aurat khadi hui jab Unhon ne us ke shauhar ko bulwaya aur Umar ke peeche baithe gayi jald hi donon aae aur Umar ke samne baithe Umar ne kaha: Is bare mein Kya kehte ho jo mere peeche baithe hai? Us ne kaha: Yeh kaun hai, Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh tumhari biwi hai us ne kaha: Aur woh Kya kehti hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh da'wa karti hai ke tumhari bhalai kam hai aur tumhari burayi hai us ne kaha: Us ne jo kaha woh bura hai, Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin; woh apni aurton mein sab behtareen mein se hai, sab zyada kapde wali aur sab qailula wali, lekin us ka narr (ghoda) kamzor hai Umar ne kaha: Tum Kya kehti ho? Us ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha Umar dandaa lekar us ki taraf uthe aur use us se mara, phir kaha: Aey apni jaan ki dushman, Tu ne us ka maal khaya aur us ki javaanii khayi, phir us par jhoota bura kehti hai us ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, jaldi na karen; Allah ki qasam main is majlis mein phir kabhi nahin baithuungii. phir Unhon ne us ke liye teen kapdon ka hukm diya, unhon ne kaha: Jo Main ne tumhare sath kiya us ke badle lo, aur is azeem ki shikayat se bacho jaise main use kapdon ke sath uthatii dekh raha hun phir woh us ke shauhar ki taraf mude aur kaha: Jo Tum ne mujhe us ke sath karte dekha woh tumhen us se bura sulook karne par na ubhaare; jao us aadmi ne kaha: Main kabhi aisa na karunga phir Umar ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Meri ummat mein sab behtareen woh piirhii hai jis se main hun, phir doosri, phir tiisarii. phir aisi qaum paida hogi jin ki qasmen un ki gawahi se pahle hongi; woh baghair mange gawahi denge, un ke bazaron mein shora hoga khamaasa ne mujh se kaha: Kya tumhen dar hai yeh mein se hain? Phir khamaasa ne mujh se kaha: main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur unhen apne Islam ki khabar di, phir ek saal ghaib raha, phir aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jaise Aap mujhe pahchante nahin? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, farmaya main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jab se main Aap se juda hua Main ne roza nahin toraa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhen apne Aap ko azab dene ka hukm Kis ne diya? Mahine mein ek din roza rakho main ne kaha: Mujhe aur den Aap ne farmaya: Do din roza rakho, yahan tak ke Aap ne farmaya: Mahine mein teen din roza rakho"
"33","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jaafar bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit al-Bunani se, Abu Rafi' se, ke jab Umar ko khanjara mara gaya to Suhaib ne kaha: Hae mere bhai, hae mere aae Umar ne un se kaha: Khamosh, mere bhai, Khamosh Aey Suhaib, Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate nahin suna: Maiyyat ko us ki qabr mein us ke ghar walon ke rone ki wajah se azab diya jata hai"
"34","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Abdul-a'la se, Suwaid bin ghafalaa se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab ko Hajar-Aswad bosa aur kehte dekha: Main tumhen deta hun yeh jante hue ke tum ek pathar ho, lekin Main ne Abu al-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko tum lagaava rakhte dekha hai"
"35","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Khumair se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Habib bin Ubaid ko Jubair bin Nufair al-Hazrami se, bin as-simta se riwayat karte suna, ke Unhon ne Umar ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Zul-Zulhulaifah mein do rak'at namaz padhi"
"36","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Amr se, ek aadmi se, Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath logon ke ek guroh ke sath tha ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, qayamat ke din Allah ke han Aap ambiya aur cune logon ke baad sab achcha girana mard hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste mein apni jaan aur maal se jihad karne wala yahan tak ke Allah ki bulaahata use aae jabke woh apne ghode par ho us ki Langoat pakde hue us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Ek alag-thalaga aadmi jo apne Rabb ki achchi ibadat kare aur logon ko apni burayi se bachae us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, qayamat ke din Allah ke han sab bura girana mard hai? Aap ne farmaya: Mushrik ka us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Zalim hakim jo taqat ke baavajuuda haq se hate Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghaib ke darwaze band kiye aur farmaya: Mujh se poocho, aur jo bhi poochhoge main tumhen bataun Umar ne kaha: Ham Allah ke Rabb hone, Islam ke deen hone aur Aap Nabi hone par razi hain; jo hamare paas aaya hai woh hamen kafi hai unhon ne kaha: Phir woh mawafiq hue"
"37","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid aur Zuhair bin Muhammad at-Tamimi donon ne ham se bayan kiya, donon ne Yahya bin Sa'id al-Ansari se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim at-Taimi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Alqamah bin Waqqas al-Laisi ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aey logo, a'mal sirf niyaton se hain, aur har shakhs ke liye Wahy hai jis ki Us ne niyyat ki Jis ne Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki taraf hijrat ki, us ki hijrat Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki taraf hai Jis ne duniya ke faayade ya kisi aurat se ihsan ke liye hijrat ki, us ki hijrat usi ki taraf hai jis ke liye Us ne hijrat ki"
"38","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abdullah bin Buraidah se, Sulaiman bin ar-Rabi al-Adawi se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Umar se mile aur un se kaha: Abdullah bin Amr ne hamen aisi-aisi baat bayan ki Umar ne kaha: Abdullah bin Amr jo kehte hain use behtar jante hain — Unhon ne yeh teen martaba kaha —. phir ijtimaai taur par namaz ka elan hua, log jama hue, aur Umar ne unhen khutba diya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Meri ummat ka ek guroh haq par rahega yahan tak ke Allah Ta'ala ka hukm aa jae"
"39","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih bin Sulaiman al-hain ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zuhri ko kehte suna: Urwah bin az-Zubair ne mujhe khabar di, al-Miswar bin Makhramah al-Qurashi aur bin Abdul-qari se, ke Unhon ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Quran ki ek surat sikhaye jise Main ne yaad kar liya jab main masjid mein khada namaz padh raha tha, Hisham bin Hakim mere thaile mein namaz padh raha tha aur Us ne us surat ko us tarah se alag padha jis tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe sikhaye thi main namaz mein hi use pakarane wala tha, phir Main ne nafs ko roka yahan tak ke woh farigh hua Main ne us ka kapda pakda aur kaha: Tumhen yeh aayat Kis ne sikhaye? Us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe sikhai main ne kaha: Tum jhoot jhutlate ho; Unhon ne mujhe alag tarah sikhai main use khiincakara bahar laya jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe dekha to farmaya: Aey Umar, use chhod do Main ne us ka kapda chhoda aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne mujhe ek surat sikhaye lekin yeh alag tarah padhta hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padho, Aey hishaama. Us ne padha aur Aap ne farmaya: Isi tarah nazil hui phir mujh se kaha: padho, Aey Umar Main ne padha aur Aap ne farmaya: Isi tarah nazil hui Quran saat huruufa par nazil hua, to us mein se jo aasan ho padho"
"40","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne chand dekha; mere siwa kisi ne dekhne ka da'wa nahin kiya Main ne Umar se kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, Kya Aap use nahin dekhte? Main unhen dikhaataa raha, aur jab woh na dekh sake to unhon ne kaha: Main use apne bistar par lete dekhuungaa. phir Unhon ne hamen Badr ke bare mein khabar, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek din pahle hamen dushman ki maut ki jaghon ki khabar di: Kal falan ki maut ki jagah yeh hai, Allah; kal falan ki maut ki jagah yeh hai, inshaaallaaha. us zaat ki qasam Jis ne Aap haq ke sath bheja, woh un wasallam se na chuke aur Unhin par jhadi phir unhen kuen mein dal diya gaya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur farmaya: Aey falan bin falan, Kya Tum ne woh sach paya jo tumhare Rabb ne wa'da kiya tha? Main ne woh sach paya jo mere Rabb ne mujh se wa'da kiya tha main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya Aap bejaana jismon se baat karte hain? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum un se behtar nahin sunte, lekin woh mujhe jawab nahin de rakhta"
"41","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main chaar muamle mein apne Parwardigar se muaafiqa hua main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaash Aap maqam ke peeche namaz padhte, to yeh aayat nazil hui: {Aur Maqam-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah banao}. main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaash Aap apni biwiyon ko parda pilate, kyunke nek aur bure Aap paas aate hain, to Allah Ta'ala ne nazil kiya: {Jab tum un se kuch mango to pahunchne ke peeche se mango}. aur yeh aayat nazil hui: {Ham ne insan ko mitti ke khulaase se paida kiya} anta tak; jab woh nazil hui to main ne kaha: Barkat wala hai Allah, sab behtareen paida karne wala, phir nazil hua: {Barkat wala hai Allah, sab behtareen paida karne wala}. main Nabi ki biwiyon ke paas gaya aur un se kaha: ya to tum ba'z aao ya Allah tumhen tum behtar biwiyan dega, phir nazil hua: {Sakta hai us ka Rabb, agar woh tumhen talaq de} anta tak"
"42","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khanjara mara gaya to Hafsah ne un par nauha kiya Umar ne kaha: Kya Tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate nahin suna: Jis par nauha kiya jae use azab diya jata hai"
"43","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu zibyaana ko kehte suna: Main ne bin az-Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ko logon ko khutba dete suna, unhon ne kaha: Apni aurton ko resham na pehnao, kyunke Main ne Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein resham pahanegaa woh aakhirat mein use nahin pahanegaa."
"44","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakim bin Jubair se, Musa bin Talha se, bin al-hautaqiyyaa se, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ek khargosh laya gaya unhon ne kaha: Agar mujhe barhaane ya ghataane ka dar na hota to main tumhen dehati ka qissa sunaataa jab woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek khargosh laya tha Unhon ne zikr kiya ke Us ne us par khoon dekha, to Aap ne unhen khane ka hukm diya, aur dehati se kaha: Qareeb aao aur khao us ne kaha: Main rozedar hun Aap ne farmaya: Tum kaun-sa roza rakhte ho? Us ne kaha: Mahine ke shuru aur aakhir ka Aap ne farmaya: Agar roza rakho to ujalii raaton ka rakho: Terah, chaudah aur pandraha. lekin Ammar ko bulavaao. Unhon ne unhen bulwaya aur woh aaye Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek khargosh laya aur kaha: Main ne use khoon bahate dekha? Ammar ne kaha: Han"
"45","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Uqbah al-Hazrami se, Ata bin dinar al-Huzali se, Abu Yazid al-Khaulani se, ke Unhon ne Fuzalah bin Ubaid al-Ansari ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Shaheed chaar hain: Behtareen iman wala mu'min jo dushman se mile aur Allah se sachcha rahe, ladta rahe yahan tak ke qatl ho jae — woh jis ki taraf log nazar nahin — aur Unhon ne apna sar uthaya yahan tak ke un ke sar par, ya Umar ke sar par, topiyan giri — woh pehli jama'at mein hai behtareen iman wala mu'min aadmi jo dushman se milne par peeche jae jaise babuula ke kaante us ki khaal mein cubhen; ek beiraadaa teer use maar de — woh doosri jama'at mein hai mu'min aadmi Jis ne nek aur bure amal milae, dushman se mile aur Allah se sachcha rahe yahan tak ke qatl ho jae — woh teesri jama'at mein hai aur ek aadmi Jis ne apne upar zulm kiya, dushman se mile aur lade yahan tak ke qatl ho jae — woh chauthi jama'at mein hai"
"46","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Unhon ne Allah ke raste mein ek ghoda diya, phir dekha ke us ke Malik ne us ki durust nahin ki aur use bechna chahta tha Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se use khareedne ke bare mein poocha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use ek dirham mein bhi na khareedo, kyunke jo apna Sadqa wapas le woh kutte jaisa hai jo apni ulti par wapas hai"
"47","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud bin Abdullah se, Abdur Rahman al-musallii se, al-Ash'as bin Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab ka mehmaan raha unhon ne kaha: Aey Ash'as, meri teen baat yaad rakho jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yaad ki: Kisi aadmi se na poocho ke Us ne apni biwi ko kyun mara, aur witr par hi so — aur main teesri bhool gaya —."
"48","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, bayan al-Yami se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Safar ki namaz do rak'at hai, raat ki namaz do rak'at hai, aur Jume ki namaz do rak'at hai, poori na ke qasr, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban se"
"49","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Amr al-Bajali se, us jama'at mein se ek se jo Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aai, unhon ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, ham Aap se teen cheezon ke bare mein poochte hain: Haizah biwi se aadmi ke liye Kya halal hai, bade hadas se ghusl, aur gharon mein Quran karna? Umar ne kaha: Subhanallah, Kya tum jadugar ho? Tum ne mujh se woh poocha jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha tha; mere baad kisi ne mujh se nahin poocha unhon ne kaha: Rahi haizah biwi se halal cheez, to woh jo izaar se upar hai; rahe ghusl, to hath aur sharmgah dho, wuzu karo, phir sar aur jism par pani dalo; raha Quran karna, to woh Noor hai — jo chahe apna ghar raushan kare"
"50","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin sarajisa ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Hajar-Aswad bosa phir kehte dekha: Main tumhen deta hun yeh jante hue ke tum ek pathar ho; agar Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko tumhen bosa na dekha hota to main tumhen na cuumataa."
"51","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, hayavaa bin Shuraih se, Bakr bin Amr se, Abdullah bin Hubairah se, Abu Tameem al-jaishaanii se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Agar tum Allah par sachcha bharosa karo to woh tumhen isi rizq dega jaise parindon ko deta hai: Woh subah bhooke nikalte hain aur Sham ko pet phaad lautte hain"
"52","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hurairah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Jume ka khutba de rahe the to ek aadmi aaya Umar ne kaha: Tum Jume ke liye der kyun karte ho? Us ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, Main ne sirf azan suni, wuzu kiya aur aa gaya unhon ne kaha: Sirf wuzu bhi? Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate nahin suna: Jab tum mein se koi Jume ko jae to ghusl kare?"
"53","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, maadaana Ibn Abi Talha se, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Jume ka khutba diya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ka zikr karte hue, phir kaha: Main ne khwab mein dekha jaise ek murghe ne mujhe ek ya do martaba conca lagai, aur main Ise apni maut ke qareeb aane ke siwa kuch nahin samajhta log mujhe khalifa muqarrar karne par ubhaarate hain, lekin Allah Ta'ala apne deen aur apni khilafat ko zaya nahin karega us zaat ki qasam Jis ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bheja, agar mera muamla jaldi ho jae to khilafat in chhe aadmiyon mein hai jise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is haal mein juda hue ke Aap un se razi the mere baad mujhe kalaalaa se zyada koi cheez Allahumma nahin karti jab se main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath raha, Main ne Aap se kalaalaa ke bare mein jitna Ikhtilaf kiya utna kabhi nahin kiya, na Aap mujh par kalaalaa ke bare mein jitne sakht hue utane kabhi hue, yahan tak ke Aap ne apne hath se mera seena thokaa aur farmaya: Aey Umar, Surah-Nisa ke aakhir mein nazil garmi wali aayat tumhen kafi hai Aey logo, tum do darakhton se khate ho jinhein main badbudar hi samajhta hun: Pyaaza aur lahasuna. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, jab Aap kisi aadmi se inakii bu pate to use Baqi' ki taraf nikalne ka hukm dete jise Inhen khana hi ho woh pakaakara inakii bu maar de"
"54","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad Ibn Abi Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Jurairi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu nazaraa se, Abu Firas se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamen khutba diya, unhon ne kaha: Jis par us ka hakim zulm kare woh mere paas jane aur main us ke liye badla lunga Amr bin al-Aas khade hue aur kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, agar koi aadmi apni ra'iyat mein se kisi ko taadiiba kare to Kya Aap us se badla lenge? Unhon ne kaha: Main kyun na lun, jabke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne Aap se badla lete dekha hai"
"55","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Haisam bin Rafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Yahya al-Makki ne ham se bayan kiya, Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna, Aap farma rahe the: Jo Musalmanon ke par apna gehun rokakara rakhe, Allah use korha mein mubtala karega — ya unhon ne kaha: Divaaliyaapana mein —."
"56","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Adi bin Adi se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ham jo padhte the us mein yeh bhi padhte the: Apne baapon se munh na phero, kyunke yeh tum kufr hai"
"57","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-Nu'man bin Bashir ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab ko khutba dete suna, logon ke liye jo khola gaya us ka zikr karte hue, aur unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap bhook se sara din tarapate rehte, yahan tak ke pet hai ke liye ghatiya khajur bhi na pate"
"58","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash aur Mansoor se, Abu Wa'il se, as-subayya bin Ma'bad se, ke Unhon ne Hajj aur umrah donon ka ek sath ehram bandha, aur is ka zikr Umar se kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Tumhen apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat ki hidayat mili hai"
"59","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Wa'il se, ke as-subayya bin Ma'bad taghalabii dehati Nasrani the jinhon Islam qabool kiya aur poocha: Sab achcha amal kaun-sa hai? Unhen khabar gaya: Allah ke raste mein jihaada. Unhon ne jihad karna chaha, lekin un se kaha gaya: Kya Tum ne Hajj kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin un se kaha gaya: Hajj aur umrah karo, phir jihad karo woh nikle yahan tak ke al-havaaita mein Unhon ne donon ka ek sath ehram bandha Zaid bin suuhaana aur Salman bin Rabi'ah ne unhen dekha aur kaha: Woh apne oont se zyada gumrah hai — ya apni untni se zyada hidaayatayaaftaa nahin —. woh Umar ke paas gae aur unhen khabar jo unhon ne kaha tha unhon ne kaha: Tumhen apne Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat ki hidayat mili hai"
"60","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Murrah ko sunte hue, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Teen cheezen — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen wazeh karen — mujhe surkh oonton se zyada karti hain: Khilafat, kalaalaa aur suuda. Main ne Murrah se kaha: Kalaalaa ke bare mein kaun shak karta hai? Woh hai jo aulaad aur walid ke siwa ho unhon ne kaha: Woh baap ke bare mein shak karte hain"
"61","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Bakhtari ko kehte suna: Main ne ek aadmi se ek hadees suni jo mujhe pasand aai, aur Main ne use likhna chaha, to main ne kaha: Mere liye likh do woh use khushakhata likh laya, us ne kaha: Al-Abbas aur Ali Umar (Raziyallahu anhum) ke paas jhagde hue dakhil hue, jabke Umar ke paas Talha, az-Zubair, Sa'd aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhum) the Umar ne un se kaha: main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, Kya tum nahin jante, Kya Tum ne nahin suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nabi ka sara maal Sadqa hai siwae us ke jis se Us ne apne ghar walon ko khilaya ya pahnaya; hamara virasaa nahin hota? Unhon ne kaha: Han Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne maal se apne ghar walon par kharch karte aur baqi Sadqa kar dete"
"62","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne kaha: Ghutnon ko mal, kyunke ghutne tumhare liye sunnat banae gae hain"
"63","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Maimun ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Muzdalifah mein Fajr ki namaz ke baad dekha woh khade hue aur kaha: Mushrik suraj nikalne tak nahin nikalte the, kehte the: Chamak, sabiira. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki mukhalifat ki, to Umar suraj nikalne se pahle nikle"
"64","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Abu al-ajafaa as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamen khutba diya, unhon ne kaha: Aurton ke mahr na karo, kyunke agar yeh duniya mein izzat aur Allah ke han taqwa hota to Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is ke sab zyada haqdar hote Aap ne apni kisi beti ki ihsan ki na apni kisi biwi se nikah kiya barah ooqiya se zyada par tum mein se ek aurat ka mahr deta hai yahan tak ke woh us ka fidya ban jata hai, kehta hai: Main ne tumhare liye rassi ka bojh uthaya — ya unhon ne kaha: Mashkize ka pasiinaa —."
"65","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sawwar bin Maimun Abu al-Jarrah al-Abdi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ke gharane ke ek aadmi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo meri qabr ki ziyarat kare — ya kaha: Meri ziyarat kare — main us ka sifaarishii hounga — ya gavaaha. jo donon haramon mein se kisi ek mein mare, Allah use qayamat ke din aman walon mein uthayega"
"66","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Jamrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Juwairiyah bin Qudamah ko kehte suna: Main Madinah aaya aur Umar ke paas dakhil hua jab unhen khanjara mara gaya tha unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen zimmi ke bare mein wasiyat karta hun, kyunke woh tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka ahd hain"
"67","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Tariq bin Shihab ko Abu Musa se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Agar ham Allah ki Kitab par chalen to Allah Ta'ala ne poora karne ka hukm diya hai; agar Nabi ki sunnat (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par chalen to Rasulullah ehram se nahin nikle yahan tak ke qurbani ka janwar apni jagah pahunchi"
"68","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Unhon ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq di Umar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, to Aap ne use ek ginaya"
"69","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin budaila ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Ibn Umar se, ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne Jahiliyat mein ek raat e'tikaf ki Nazr mani thi; Aap Kya kehte hain? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: E'tikaf karo aur roza rakho"
"70","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Sayyar bin al-Ma'rur se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab ko khutba dete suna, unhon ne kaha: Aey logo, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare sath yeh masjid banai, Muhajireen aur ansaara. jab bheed badh jae to tum mein se ek apne bhai ki peeth par sajdah kare"
"71","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr al-Huzali ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-Malih al-Huzali ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar ke samne Talha ka zikr kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Woh ghuruura wala aadmi hai jab se us ka hath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath mara gaya"
"72","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id al-Ansari se, Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath ghar mein the jabke woh ghere hue the, ek darwaze se dakhil hote jahan ham sehan walon ki baat sunte the Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) andar gae phir rang badle hue bahar aaye kaha gaya: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, Kya baat hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh abhi mujhe qatl ki dhamakii de rahe hain; aaj tak mujhe un ka yaqeen nahin tha ham ne kaha: Allah Aap kafi ho, Aey Ameerul-muminiina. unhon ne kaha: Woh mujhe kis liye qatl karenge? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Musalman ka khoon halal nahin magar teen mein se ek ke liye: Woh aadmi jo Islam ke baad kufr kare, pakdamani ke baad zina kare, ya haq kisi jaan ko lagaye Allah ki qasam, Main ne na Jahiliyat mein na Islam mein kabhi zina kiya, na jab se Allah ne mujhe hidayat di koi aur deen chaha, na koi jaan mari to woh mujhe kis liye maarne chahte hain?"
"73","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah bin Marsad al-Hazrami ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'd bin Ubaidah ko suna, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein sab behtareen woh hain jo Quran seekhte aur sikhate hain Abu Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Yahi hai Jis ne mujhe is jagah par rakha hai"
"74","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Nabih bin Wahb se, Aban bin Usman se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehram wala na nikah kare na paigham de"
"75","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, wasallam bin Shaddad se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Humran bin Aban ko Abu Burdah se, Hazrat Usman bin Affan se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo wuzu ko kamil kare jaisa Allah ne hukm diya, to namazen un ke darmiyan ki cheezon ka kaffara hain"
"76","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, un ke walid se, Humran bin Aban se, ke Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas al-maqaaida mein Asr ki namaz ke liye wuzu ka pani laya gaya Usman ne kaha: Main ne tumhen ek hadees sunaane ka irada kiya hai jo main sunaane ka nahin socataa tha al-Hakam Ibn Abi al-Aas ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, yeh ya to bhalai hai jis ki ham pairwi karen ya burayi hai jis se jayen unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas al-maqaaida mein wuzu ka pani laya gaya aur Aap ne farmaya: Jo achchi tarah wuzu kare, phir namaz padhe us ke ruku aur sajde ko kamil karte hue, to us ke aur agli namaz ke darmiyan ki cheezen muaf kar di jati hain jab tak woh qabiiraa gunah na kare — ya'ni: Jab tak woh bada gunah na kare"
"77","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin bahadalaa se, Musa bin Talha se, Humran bin Aban se, Hazrat Usman bin Affan se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas al-maqaaida mein Asr ki namaz ke liye wuzu ka pani laya gaya, aur Aap ne farmaya: Jab Musalman achchi tarah wuzu kare, phir namazen padhe — Hammad ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Jama'at se — ruku aur sajdah kamil karte hue, to Allah un ke darmiyan ki cheezen muaf kar deta hai jab tak woh qabiiraa gunah na kare"
"78","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, ek aadmi se, Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek aadmi faisla karne, mangne, bechne aur khareedne mein narm tha, to woh jannat mein dakhil hua"
"79","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Aban bin Usman se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi banda aisa nahin jo har subah ya har Sham kahe: Allah ke naam se jis ke naam se zameen ya aasman mein koi cheez nuqsan nahin pahuncaatii, aur woh sunne wala, janne wala hai — magar use koi cheez nuqsan nahin deti Aban ko aanshika falij hua tha; ek aadmi dakhil hua aur un ki haalat dekhi, aur Aban samajh gae, unhon ne kaha: Hadees waisi hi hai jaisi Main ne bayan ki, lekin Main ne us din woh nahin kaha tha taake Allah ka faisla jari ho"
"80","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Amir bin Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Usman bin Affan ko kehte suna: Allah ki qasam, mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karne se koi cheez nahin rokti ke main un ki hadees ka sab zyada yaad rakhne wala nahin hun, lekin main gawahi deta hun ke Main ne Aap farmate suna: Jo mere bare mein woh kahe jo Main ne nahin kaha, woh aag mein apni jagah bana le"
"81","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, abadaa Ibn Abi lubaabaa se, Abu Wa'il se, Usman se, ke Unhon ne har hissa teen-teen martaba wuzu kiya aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) isi tarah wuzu karte the"
"82","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Husain bin Abdur Rahman se, Amr bin jawan se, al-ahanafa bin Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Sa'd Ibn Abi Waqqas, Ali, az-Zubair aur Talha (Raziyallahu anhum) se kehte suna: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, Kya tum jante ho ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tangi wali fauj ko tayyar kare, Allah use muaf kar deta hai — to Main ne unhen tayyar kiya yahan tak ke unhen na Langoat ki kam rahi na rassi ki? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Han"
"83","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main bin as-Sa'ib ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hasan ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humran bin Aban ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is khane ke bache hue, miithe pani aur panah dene wale ghar ke siwa sab kuch faalatuu hai; Adam ke bete ko us mein koi fazeelat nahin"
"84","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Wahid bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Rashid, Usman ke aazad-karda, ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere sardar Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne ek sau satrah khaslatein paida ki; jo mein se kisi ek ke sath Allah ke paas aae woh jannat mein dakhil hoga"
"85","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub bin Musa se, Nabih bin Wahb se, Aban bin Usman se, Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab ehram wala apni aankhon ki shikayat kare to us mein musabbar (elo) dala jae"
"86","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim aur mahadii bin Maimun ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abdullah Ibn Abi Raziyallahu se, Rabah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere ghar walon ne meri ihsan apni ek Rumi bandi se kar di Us ne mujh se mere jaisa kala ladka jana, jis ka naam Main ne Abdullah rakha phir main dobara us ke paas gaya aur Us ne mere jaisa ek aur kala ladka jana, jis ka naam Main ne Ubaidullah rakha phir yuuhannaasa naam ke hamare ek Rumi ghulam ne use chaha aur humbistari ki; woh hamla hui aur chipakalii jaisa ladka janii. main ne kaha: Yeh Kya hai? Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, yeh tum nahin hai; yeh yuuhannaasa se hai us ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha Unhon ne Usman ke samne jhagda kiya aur donon ne iqrar kiya Usman ne kaha: Kya tum qabool karoge ke main tumhare darmiyan Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se faisla karun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla kiya ke bachcha bistar ka hai, aur zani ko pathar milta woh tumhara beta hai; tum us ke waris ho aur woh tumhara waris hai main ne kaha: Subhaanaallaaha. unhon ne kaha: Aisa hi hai main use un ke darmiyan sulaataa — yeh do siyahi aur yeh goraa."
"87","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu maana se, Abu Salih se, jo Usman bin Affan ke aazad-karda the, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne al-khaifa ki masjid mein kaha: Aey logo, ek hadees jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni jise Main ne tum chhupae rakha tumhari riaayata karte hue; ab main use nasihat ke taur par zahir karne ka irada karta hun: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah ke raste mein jihad karne wale ka ek din hazaar dinon ke barabar hai, to tum mein se har ek apne Aap ko dekhe"
"88","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Nabih bin Wahb se, Aban bin Usman bin Affan se, un ke walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehram wala na nikah kare na paigham de"
"89","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Asim bin Damrah se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Witr wajib nahin hai, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki achchi sunnat hai Allah ek hai aur taaq ko pasand karta hai; to witr padho, Aey Quran vaalo."
"90","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Sa'd bin Ubaidah se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ita'at sirf nek kaam mein hai"
"91","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abu zibyaana al-janabii se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qalam teen se utha liya gaya hai: Museebat se — ya unhon ne kaha: Deewane se — yahan tak ke woh theek ho jae, bachche se yahan tak ke woh baligh ho ya samjhe, aur sone wale se yahan tak ke woh jaage"
"92","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, Mutarrif se, ash-Sha'bi se, Abu Juhaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Ali se poocha: Kya tumhare paas Allah Ta'ala ki Kitab mein jo hai us ke siwa koi Wahy hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, us zaat ki qasam jo dane ko phaarataa aur jaan ko paida karta hai, main sirf woh samajh janta hun jo Allah Ta'ala kisi aadmi ko apni Kitab mein deta hai, ya jo is saheefe mein hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Us mein Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Diyat, qaidiyon ko chhudana, aur koi Musalman kisi mushrik ke badle qatl nahin kiya jata"
"93","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Qasim bin mukhaimiraa ko Shuraih bin haani se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne A'ishah se chamde ke mouzon par masah ke bare mein poocha unhon ne kaha: Ali se poocho, kyunke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein rahe hain Main ne un se poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Musafir ke liye teen din aur raaten, aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur raat"
"94","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abi Laila ko kehte suna: Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne ham se bayan kiya ke Fatimah (Raziyallahu anha) ne chakki se apne hath par asar ki shikayat ki Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas qaidi jane gae; woh gayin lekin Aap na paya, A'ishah (Raziyallahu anha) se miliin, unhen bataya jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae to A'ishah ne Aap Fatimah ke aane ki khabar di Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae jabke ham apne bistaron par let chuke the; ham uthe, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni jaghon par Hazrat Aap ham donon ke darmiyan baithe yahan tak ke Main ne Aap paon ki thandak apne seene par mehsoos ki, aur farmaya: Kya main tumhen us se behtar na sikhaun jo Tum ne manga? Jab leto to Allah ki takbir chauntis martaba kaho, us ki tasbih tentis martaba, aur us ki tahamiida tentis martaba; yeh tumhare liye khadim se behtar hai"
"95","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Yahya bin al-Jazzar se, Ali se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Ahzab ke din Aap Khandaq ke ek kode par the aur farmaya: Unhon ne hamen darmiyan wali namaz se ghafil rakha yahan tak ke suraj doob gaya; Allah un ki qabron aur gharon ko aag se bhar de — ya un ki qabron aur peton ko aag se bhar de"
"96","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Ali bin Husain se, Marwan bin al-Hakam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usman aur Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan dekha, jabke Usman mut'ah ya donon ko jama karne se mana karte the jab Ali ne yeh dekha to donon ka ek sath ehram bandha, unhon ne kaha: Hazir hun umrah aur Hajj donon ke liye ek sath Usman ne kaha: Kya tum mujhe logon ko kisi cheez se mana karte dekhte ho jabke tum woh karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main kisi ke kehne par Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat nahin choruungaa."
"97","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, ek Basri aadmi se — Basri use Abu al-muvaariia kehte hain, kuufii use Abu Muhammad kehte hain, Hudhail mein se — Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek janaze mein the aur farmaya: Tum mein se kaun Madinah jaega aur koi but baghair kare, koi tasweer baghair mitayi, koi qabr baghair barabar kiye na chhore? Ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main jaunga woh gaya lekin Madinah walon se khadsha aur wapas aaya Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) gae aur usi kaha: Main Aap paas nahin aaya, Ya Rasulullah, yahan tak ke Main ne har but tod diya, har qabr barabar ki, aur har tasweer mitaaii. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mein se kisi par aae — is ke bare mein sakhti se kehte hue — aur Ali se kaha: Fitna phailane wala na bano, na takabbur karne wala, na tajir siwae bhalai ke tajir ke, kyunke woh amal mein sab aage hain"
"98","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Awanah se, Jabir se, Abdullah bin nujaiya se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbani ke liye kate kaan ya seeng wale janwar se mana farmaya"
"99","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, juraiya bin Kulaib se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte sunte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kate kaan ya seeng wale janwar ki qurbani se mana farmaya Qatadah ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se katane ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: Aadha ya zyada"
"100","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Abu al-Bakhtari ko kehte sunte hue, unhon ne kaha: Jis ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko suna Us ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Yaman bheja to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne mujhe bheja jabke main umar mein chhota hun aur faisle ka ilm kam rakhta hun Aap ne apna hath mere seene par mara aur farmaya: Allah Ta'ala tumhari zaban ko Sabit rakhega aur tumhare dil ko hidayat dega; do ke darmiyan koi faisla mujh par kabhi mushkil nahin hua"
"101","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abu al-Bakhtari ko Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se riwayat karte sunte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali ko kehte suna: Jab main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees sunaauun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sab zyada khushamizaaja, sab zyada hidaayatayaaftaa aur sab zyada muttaqi samajho."
"102","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin al-Musayyab ko kehte suna: Ali aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhuma) Usfan mein mile Usman ne mut'ah se mana kiya, to Ali ne kaha: Tum us cheez ke bare mein Kya irada rakhte ho jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ki, use mana karke? Usman ne kaha: Hamen apne haal par chhod do unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen nahin chhod sakta jab Unhon ne yeh dekha to donon ka ek sath ehram bandha"
"103","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah bin saliimaa ko kehte sunte hue, unhon ne kaha: Main Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas do aadmiyon ke sath dakhil hua — ek ham mein se aur ek Bani Asad mein se, mera khayal hai Unhon ne unhen beemar kiya aur kaha: Tum do tagare aadmi ho, to apne deen ke liye jihad karo phir woh baitul-khala mein dakhil hue, bahar aae, ek lapen pani liya aur us se ponchha, phir Quran padha hamari naapasandiidagii dekhne unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baitul-khala mein dakhil hote, hajat karte, phir bahar aate, hamare sath gosht khate aur Quran padhte; bade naapaakii ke siwa koi cheez Aap Quran se nahin rokti thi"
"104","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Shaddad ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sa'd ke siwa kisi ke liye apne walidah-baap donon ka zikr nahin kiya, kyunke Aap ne un se Uhud mein farmaya: Teer calaao, Sa'd, mere walidah-baap tum par fida hon"
"105","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Hunain se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe ruku mein Quran padhne, za'fran se range kapde pahanne, aur sone ki anguthi pahanne se mana farmaya"
"106","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mundhir as-Sauri ko Muhammad Ibn al-Hanafiyyah se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Fatimah ki wajah se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mazi ke bare mein poochne mein haya aati thi, to Main ne ek aadmi ko hukm diya Jis ne Aap se poocha Aap ne farmaya: Us ke liye wuzu hai"
"107","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aun Ibn Abi Juhaifah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ko kehte suna: Main ne Ali ko kehte suna: Jab main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karun to aasman se giranaa mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bare mein woh kehne se zyada pasandeeda hai jo Aap ne nahin kaha jab main apni rae bayan karun to jang dhoka hai"
"108","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Rib'i bin Hirash se — Shu'bah ne kaha: Ali se, aur Waraqah ne kaha: Rib'i se, ek aadmi se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda iman nahin lata yahan tak ke chaar par iman jane: Gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin aur main haq ke sath bheja hua Allah ka Rasulullah hun, maut par iman jane, dobara zinda hone par iman jane, aur taqdeer par iman laye"
"109","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansoor ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rib'i bin Hirash ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khutba dete suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere bare mein jhoot na karo, kyunke jo mere bare mein jhoot bole woh aag mein dakhil hoga"
"110","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hilal bin Yasaf ko Wahb bin al-ajadaaa se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Asr ke baad namaz na padho, siwae is ke ke tum suraj buland rehte padho"
"111","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, bayan se, Sa'd bin Ubaidah se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek lashkar bheja aur un par ek aadmi ko ameer banaya, us ki ita'at ka hukm dete hue Us ne aag jalaaii aur unhen us mein kuudane ka hukm diya kuch ne aisa karne ka irada kiya, jabke doosron ne kaha: Ham aag se bhaagakara aae hain Unhon ne inkar kiya woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya gaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar woh us mein dakhil hote to qayamat tak usi mein rahte Allah Ta'ala ki nafarmani mein kisi insan ki ita'at nahin; ita'at sirf nek kaam mein hai"
"112","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin mudrika se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zur'ah bin Amr bin Jarir ko Abdullah bin nujaiya se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahin hote jis mein tasweer ho na us mein jis mein koi bade naapaakii mein ho"
"113","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah aur Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah donon ne ham se bayan kiya, donon ne Zuhri ko kehte suna: Al-Hasan aur Abdullah, Muhammad Ibn al-Hanafiyyah ke beton ne, mujhe apne walid se bayan kiya, ke Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mut'ah ke bare mein fatwa dene wale ek aadmi se kaha: Dekho tum kis bare mein fatwa dete ho? Main gawahi deta hun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mut'ah nikah aur paltu gadhe ke gosht se mana farmaya"
"114","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, as-suddii se, Sa'd bin Ubaidah se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamen khutba diya, unhon ne kaha: Aey logo, apne ghulamon par haduuda qayam karo, shadishuda hon ya ghair-shadishuda, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki ek bandi ne zina kiya tha, aur Aap ne mujhe use kode marne ka hukm diya main us ke paas gaya aur use haal hi mein janii hui paya; darte hue ke agar kode marna to woh mar jaegi, main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap khabar di Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne achcha kiya"
"115","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah, Qais aur Sallam sab ne ham se bayan kiya, sab ne Simak bin Harb se, Khalid bin araaraa se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Jab jurhuma ke baad Baitullah gir gaya aur Quraish ne use dobara banaya, to Unhon ne jhagda kiya ke Hajar-Aswad ko kaun rakhega, is par ittifaaqa karte hue ke is darwaze se jo sab pahle dakhil hoga woh use rakhega Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Bani Shaibah ke darwaze se dakhil hue Aap ne ek kapda mangwaya, Hajar-Aswad ko us ke darmiyan mein rakha, aur har qabeela ko ek kinara pakadte uthane ka hukm diya; phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use liya aur rakha"
"116","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah, Qais bin ar-Rabi aur Abu Awanah — sab — ne ham se bayan kiya, sab ne Simak bin Harb se, hanasha bin al-Mu'tamir al-kinaanii se: Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Yaman bheja to logon ne ek sheir ke liye gaddhaa khodaa. log gaddhe par bheed lagae the; sheir us mein gira, phir ek aadmi us mein gira, doosre ko pakadte hue, aur doosra teesre ko pakadte hue, yahan tak ke caara. sheir ne unhen andar zakhmi kiya aur woh mar gaye logon ne hathyar uthae, ladne ke qareeb main aaya aur kaha: Kya tum chaar ke liye do sau aadmi maaroge? Aao, main tumhare darmiyan faisla karta hun; agar pasand ho to faisla hai, warna Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas le jao, jo hukm ke sab zyada haqdar hain Unhon ne pahle ke liye chauthai diyat, doosre ke liye tihai, teesre ke liye aadhi, chauthe ke liye poori muqarrar ki, unhen gaddhe par hazir logon, chaar qabilon par dalte hue kuch ghadabnak hue, kuch raazii. woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur qissa sunaya Aap ne farmaya: Main tumhare darmiyan faisla karta hun ek ne kaha: Ali ne pahle hi hamare darmiyan faisla kar diya hai, unhen Ali ke hukm ki khabar dete hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Faisla waisa hi hai jaisa Ali ne faisla kiya — yeh Hammad ke alfaz hain — aur Qais ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ali ke hukm ko baraqaraara rakha"
"117","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Asim bin Damrah as-saluulii ko kehte suna: Main ne Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ke har hisse mein witr padhte: Us ke shuru, darmiyan aur aakhir mein, apni witr Fajr par khatm karte"
"118","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Harisah bin muzarriba ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Tum ne hamen Badr ki raat dekha jabke sab soe hue the siwae Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke, jo ek darakht ke paas namaz padh rahe the dua karte hue ham mein se koi sawar na tha siwae al-Miqdad (Raziyallahu anhu) ke"
"119","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hani bin Hani ko kehte suna: Main ne Ali ko kehte suna: Ammar ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mangi, to Aap ne farmaya: Nek, khushbudar — use andar aane do"
"120","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hubairah ko Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aakhri das raaton mein apne ghar walon ko jagaate the"
"121","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hubairah bin yariima ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ek shagaaf jubba tohfe mein diya gaya, jise Aap ne mujhe bheja Main ne use pahna, aur Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Main tumhare liye us se razi nahin jo apne liye napasand karta hun Aap ne mujhe hukm diya, to Main ne use aurton mein dupatton mein kaat diya"
"122","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne main bin Ka'b ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte dekha: Jab mere walid ka intiqaala hua to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aap chacha ka intiqaala ho gaya hai Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur unhen dafan karo main ne kaha: Woh mushrik hue Aap ne farmaya: Jao unhen dafan karo aur kuch na karo yahan tak ke mere paas Donon Main ne aisa hi kiya, phir Aap paas aaya, aur Aap ne mujhe ghusl ka hukm diya"
"123","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Fuzail Abu Mu'az ne mujhe khabar di, Abu hariiza as-sijistaanii se, ash-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Jab main unhen dafan karke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas wapas to Aap ne mujh se aisi baat kahin jinhein main duniya ke badle na dun"
"124","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, main bin Ka'b se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Jab main Abu Talib ko dafan karke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne mere liye dua se dua ki"
"125","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham al-Fazari se, Abdur Rahman bin al-Haris bin Hisham se, Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni witr mein kehte the: Aey Allah, main Tere gussa se Teri raza ki panah mangta hun, Tere azab se Teri mu'afi ki, aur tujh se Teri panah mangta hun main Teri nemat gin nahin sakta na Teri tareef; Tu waisa hi hai jaisi Tu ne apni tareef ki"
"126","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhen ghodon aur ghulamon par sadqe se choot di hai; chauthai dahaaii lao: Har chalis dirham se ek dirham"
"127","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek, Zaidah aur Sulaiman bin Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak bin Harb ne ham se bayan kiya, hanasha bin al-Mu'tamir se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Yaman bheja to main ne kaha: Aap mujhe jawan bhejte hain jabke mujhe faisle ka ilm kam hai Aap ne farmaya: Jab do jhagarane wale aayenge to pahle ke haq mein faisla na karo yahan tak ke doosre ki baat sun lo; jab doosre ko sunoge to jaan jao kaise faisla karna hai Allah Ta'ala tumhari zaban ko Sabit rakhega aur tumhare dil ko hidayat dega Ali ne kaha: Us ke baad main Qazi raha"
"128","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) azan par witr padhte, aur iqamat par do rak'at padhte"
"129","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Asim bin Damrah ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Chasht padhte the"
"130","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Asim bin Damrah ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke bare mein poocha Unhon ne Zuhr se pahle chaar, Zuhr ke baad do, aur Asr se pahle chaar zikr kiya"
"131","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hani bin Hani ko Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jab al-Hasan bin Ali paida hue to main ne kaha: Us ka naam Harb rakho main Abu Harb kahalaanaa chahta tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur unhen mangwaya, farmaya: Tum ne us ka Kya naam rakha? Ham ne kaha: Ham ne us ka naam Harb rakha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin woh al-Hasan hai jab al-Husain paida hue to Ham ne us ka naam Harb rakha Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur farmaya: Tum ne us ka Kya naam rakha? Ham ne kaha: Harba. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh al-Husain hai"
"132","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, Hani bin Hani se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hasan bin Ali chehre se istidad tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sab zyada mushaabeha the, aur al-Husain us se neeche Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sab zyada mushaabeha the"
"133","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Khaleel ko — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Un ka naam Abdullah bin al-Khaleel hai — kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Ek aadmi ne mere thaile mein namaz padhi; Main ne use apne walidah-baap ke liye bakhshish mangte suna halanke woh mushrik mare the main ne kaha: Kya tum apne walidah-baap ke liye bakhshish mangte ho halanke woh mushrik mare? Us ne mujh se kaha: Ibrahim ne apne walidah-baap ke liye bakhshish mangi thi main na jaan saka Kya jawab dun main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr kiya, to Allah Ta'ala ne nazil kiya: {Ibrahim ka apne baap ke liye bakhshish mangna} anta tak"
"134","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Ali bin Rabi'ah al-Asadi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ali ke paas hazir tha jab un ke liye sawari laya gayi apna paon rakaaba mein rakhte hue unhon ne kaha: Allah ke naam se us ki peeth par jamakara unhon ne kaha: Alhamdulillah, teen martaba, aur kaha: Allahu-Akbar, teen martaba phir kaha: Pak hai Tu, Main ne apne upar zulm kiya, to mujhe muaf kar; Tere siwa koi gunah nahin muaf karta phir woh hone main ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, Aap kyun hanse? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko waisa karte dekha jaisa Main ne kiya, phir hansate. main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap kyun hanse? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara Parwardigar apne bande par ta'ajjub karta hai jab woh kehta hai: Mere gunah muaf kar, yeh jante hue ke us ke siwa koi gunah nahin muaf karta"
"135","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, Hubairah aur Ali ke sahaba se, Hazrat Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jiaa se mana farmaya — ya mujhe mana farmaya —, jau ki sharab jo nasha deti hai"
"136","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin saliimaa ko kehte suna: Main ne Ali ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas aae jabke main beemar tha, farmaya: Aey Allah, agar meri muddat aa gayi hai to mujhe rahat de; agar der hai to mujhe utha; agar aazmaish hai to sabr de Aap ne mujhe apne paon se thokaa aur farmaya: Tum ne Kya kaha? Main ne Aap dohraya Aap ne farmaya: Aey Allah, use shifa de — ya kaha: Aey Allah, use afiyat de Ali ne kaha: Us ke baad Main ne apne dard ki kabhi shikayat nahin ki"
"137","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main bahut mazi nikalne wala aadmi tha, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti mere sath thin Main ne ek aadmi ko hukm diya Jis ne Aap se mazi ke bare mein poocha Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum use dekho to wuzu karo aur use dhoo."
"138","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, ar-rukaina bin ar-Rabi se, Husain bin Qabeesah al-Fazari se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mazi ke bare mein poocha Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mazi dekho to wuzu karo aur apni sharmgah dho; jab tum uchalataa pani dekho to ghusl karo"
"139","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Waki aur Sallam donon ne ham se bayan kiya, donon ne Abdul-a'la bin Amir se, Abu Jamilah se, Hazrat Ali se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki ek bandi ne zina kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hadd qayam karne ka hukm diya main us ke paas gaya aur us ka khoon abhi qaht na paya main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap khabar di Aap ne farmaya: Jab us ka khoon khushk jae to use kode maro apne daahine hathon ki milkiyat walon par haduuda qayam karo"
"140","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Aun as-Saqafi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Salih al-Hanafi ko kehte suna: Main ne bin al-Kawwa ko Ali se doodh-bhai ki beti ke bare mein poochte suna Ali ne kaha: Main ne Hamzah ki beti ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Woh mere doodh-bhai ki beti hai"
"141","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Malik bin Maisarah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-nazzaala bin Sabrah ko kehte suna: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne ar-Rahba mein Zuhr padhi, phir logon ki zaruuraton mein lage baithe rahe yahan tak ke Asr aai phir pani ka ghada laya gaya; Unhon ne ek lapen dala apna chehra aur hath dhote hue, apne sar aur paon ka masah kiya, phir khade hue aur bacha hua pani khade kar piya phir kaha: Log khade kar peena napasand karte hain, lekin Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko waisa karte dekha jaisa Main ne kiya aur kaha: Yeh us ka wuzu hai Jis ne apna wuzu nahin toraa."
"142","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Malik bin Urfutah se, Abd Khair al-khaivaanii se, ke Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas kursi laya gayi aur woh us par baithe phir pani ka ghada laya gaya; Unhon ne apne hath teen martaba dhoya, teen martaba kulli ki naak mein pani carhaate hue, apna chehra ek hath se teen martaba dhoya, apne bazu teen martaba dhoya, apna hath bartan mein dala phir apne sar ka masah kiya, apne hathon ko sar par aage karte hue — mujhe nahin ma'loom Unhon ne peeche diya ya nahin — aur apne paon teen martaba dhoya phir kaha: Jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taharat dekhna chahe, yeh Nabi ki taharat hai"
"143","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Aun as-Saqafi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Salih al-Hanafi ko kehte suna: Main ne bin al-Kawwa ko Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se doodh-bhai ki beti ke bare mein poochte suna Ali ne kaha: Main ne Hamzah ki beti ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Woh mere doodh-bhai ki beti hai"
"144","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Malik bin Maisarah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-nazzaala bin Sabrah ko kehte suna: Ali ne ar-Rahba mein Zuhr padhi, phir logon ki zaruuraton mein lage baithe rahe yahan tak ke Asr aai"
"145","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Mas'ud bin al-Hakam ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khade dekha to ham khade hue; phir Ham ne Aap baithe dekha to ham baithe Shu'bah ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad se kaha: Janaze ke bare mein, ya'ni? Unhon ne kaha: Han"
"146","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Sa'd bin Ubaidah se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek janaze ke liye nikle yahan tak ke Baqi' al-gharaqada pahunche Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baithe aur ham Aap irda-gird baithe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek chhadi li aur us se zameen kuredii, phir apna sar uthaya aur farmaya: Koi jandar nahin magar jannat mein us ki jagah aur jahannam mein us ki jagah jana hui hai — ya likhi hui — aur woh bakhton hai ya khushanasiiba. logon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, to Kya ham amal chhodkar apni taqdeer par bharosa karen? Ham mein se jo khushanasiibon mein se hoga woh us ke liye amal karega, aur ham mein se jo badanasiibon mein se hoga woh us ke liye amal karega Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amal karo, kyunke har ek ke liye aasan kiya gaya hai jo khushanasiibon mein se hoga use us ke amal ki taraf aasan kiya jaega, aur jo badanasiibon mein se hoga use us ke amal ki taraf aasan kiya jayega phir Aap ne tilawat ki: {Raha woh Jis ne diya aur khadsha, aur behtareen badle ko sach wahdaniyat, to ham us ke liye aasan rasta aasan karenge lekin raha woh Jis ne roka aur ghani samjha, aur behtareen badle ko jhutlaya, to ham us ke liye mushkil rasta aasan karenge}"
"147","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz bin Abdullah Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere chacha al-maajishuuna Abdullah Ibn Abi Salamah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman al-aaraja se, Ubaidullah Ibn Abi Rafi' se, Hazrat Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz shuru karte to takbir kehte, phir kehte: Main ne apna chehra us ki taraf phera Jis ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya, haq ki taraf jhukte hue, aur main mushrikon mein se nahin Beshak meri namaz aur meri qurbani aur mera zindagi aur mera maut Allah ke liye hai, jo jahanon ka Rabb hai us ka koi Shareek nahin, aur isi ka mujhe hukm diya gaya hai, aur main Musalmanon mein pehla hun Aey Allah, Tu Badshah hai, Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin Tu mera Rabb hai aur main Tera banda hun Main ne apne upar zulm kiya aur main apne gunah ka iqrar karta hun, to mere tamam gunah muaf kar, kyunke Tere siwa koi gunah nahin muaf karta mujhe behtareen akhlaq ki hidayat de, Tere siwa koi us ki behtareen ki hidayat nahin deta, aur us ki burayi mujh se pher de, Tere siwa koi us ki burayi nahin Allah hazir hun Teri paas mein, tamam bhalai Tere hathon mein hai, aur burayi Teri taraf marfooan nahin main Tere sath hun aur Teri taraf hun barkat wala aur buland hai tuu. main Teri bakhshish mangta hun aur Teri taraf Tauba karta hun aur jab ruku karte to kehte: Aey Allah, Tere liye Main ne ruku kiya, tum par iman laya, aur Tere samne kar meri sunne aur dekhne ki taqat, meri haddiyan, mera gooda aur meri haddiyon Tere samne jhuk gaen aur jab apna sar uthate to kehte: Allah us ki sunta hai jo us ki tareef karta hai Aey Allah, hamare Rabb, Tere liye tareef hai, aasmanon ko bharatii hui aur zameen ko bharatii hui, aur jo un ke darmiyan hai use bharatii hui, aur us ke baad jo Tu chahe use bharatii hui aur jab sajdah karte to kehte: Aey Allah, Tere liye Main ne sajdah kiya, tum par iman laya, aur Tere samne kar mera chehra us ke samne sajde mein gira Jis ne use paida kiya aur sanvaaraa aur us ki surat khubsurat banai, aur us ki sunne aur dekhne ki taqat shigaf barkat wala hai Allah, sab behtareen paida karne chhae aur jab salam pherte to kehte: Aey Allah, mujhe muaf kar jo Main ne pahle kiya aur jo baad mein karun, jo Main ne zahir kiya aur jo kar kiya, aur jo Tu mujh se behtar janta hai Tu hi aage karta hai aur Tu hi peeche karta hai Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin Abu Bishr ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yeh raat ki namaz mein hai"
"148","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-a'la se, Abu Jamilah se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae, aur Aap ne mujhe hukm diya, to Main ne pichhne lagane wale ko us ki ujrat di"
"149","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Ash'as bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Bishr ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Rashid al-Hibrani se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghadiira khumma ke din mere sar par amama tilawat, us ka kinara mere peeche latakaate hue, phir farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne Badr aur Hunain ke dinon mein mujhe aise farishton se mazboot kiya jo yeh amama pahne the phir farmaya: Amama kufr aur iman ke darmiyan parda hai aur Aap ne ek aadmi ko Faris shikar se teer nikalte dekha, to farmaya: Use phenk do phir durust shikar ko dekha aur farmaya: Is ko aur is ke jaisi ko aur sarakande ke nezon ko thamne rakho, kyunke Aap sath Allah tumhen zameenon mein jamaaegaa aur fath se tumhari madad karega"
"150","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, Abu Wa'il se, Ibn Abi al-hayyaaja se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha: main tumhen usi kaam par karta hun jis par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe lagaya tha: Tasweeren mitaanaa aur qabren barabar rokna"
"151","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin al-Mughirah se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Ali bin Alqamah se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Kya ham gadhe ko ghodi par carhaaen? Aap ne farmaya: Aisa sirf woh karte hain jo nahin jaante"
"152","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin al-Mughirah se, Zaid bin Wahb se, unhon ne kaha: Khariji ka sardar Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur un se kaha: Allah se daro, kyunke tum maroge. unhon ne kaha: Nahin, us zaat ki qasam Jis ne dane ko cheera aur jaan ko paida kiya, lekin mujhe is se ek zarb se qatl kiya jaega jo Ise rang degi — aur Unhon ne apne hath se apni dadhi ki taraf ishara kiya — pakka ahd aur muqarrar faisalaa. par hua woh Jis ne jhoot garhaa."
"153","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, al-Mughirah bin hazaf se, Hazrat Ali ya Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Musalmanon ko un ki qurbaaniyon mein Shareek kiya: Ek gae saat ke liye kafi hai"
"154","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muslim al-aavara ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne habbaa al-Urani ko Hazrat Ali se riwayat karte suna, ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Ek aadmi kisi qaum se muhabbat karta hai lekin un ke jaise amal nahin kar sakta Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi us ke sath hai jis se woh muhabbat karta hai"
"155","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne hujaiyyaa bin Adi ko Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen aankh aur kaan ko ghaura se dekhne ka hukm diya"
"156","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Kulaib se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Burdah ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek ghar mein tha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Aey Ali, Allah se hidayat mango, aur hidayat ke sath raste ki apni rehnumai yaad karo, aur Allah se istiqaamata mango, aur istiqaamata ke sath teer ka apna seedha karna yaad karo"
"157","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais Ibn Abi Sulaim se, Mujahid se, Abdullah bin sakhabaraa se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath baithe intezar kar rahe the, jab ek janaza hamare paas se guzra, to ham us ke liye khade hue unhon ne kaha: Yeh Kya hai? Ham ne kaha: Yeh woh hai jo tum hamare paas bhejte ho, Aey Muhammad ke saathiyo. Abu Musa al-Ash'ari ne ham se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kisi Musalman, ya Yahudi, ya Nasrani ka janaza tumhare paas se guzre to us ke liye khade ho, kyunke ham us ke liye nahin khade hote, lekin ham un ke liye khade hote hain jo farishton mein se us ke sath hain Ali ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aisa sirf ek martaba kiya, aur woh Ahle-Kitab the; Aap ek mamle mein un ki mushaabehata karte the, aur jab Aap mana kiya gaya to ruk gaye"
"158","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, unhon ne kaha: Az-Zubair bin al-Awwam ke qatil ne Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas dakhil ki ijazat mangi Ali ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Safiyyah ke bete ka qatil zaroor jahannam mein dakhil hoga Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Har Nabi ka ek havaarii hai, aur mera havaarii az-Zubair hai"
"159","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, Hazrat Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Darmiyan wali namaz Asr ki namaz hai"
"160","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Hakim aur Nu'aim bin Hakim se, donon ne Abu Maryam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Meri ummat ke kuch log Quran padhenge aur woh un ki hansli se aage nahin barhegaa; woh Islam se aise nikal jaenge jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai un ki nishani vikrita hath wala aadmi hai Abu Maryam ne kaha: Mere bhai ne mujhe khabar di — aur woh apne aazad-karda ke sath an-naharavaana mein haruuriyon ki taraf nikla tha — unhon ne kaha: Woh un ke paas nahin aaya yahan tak ke Unhon ne us ke qasid ko qatl kar diya tha jab Us ne yeh dekha to un ke par utha aur un se laraa. jab un se farigh hua to kaha: Vikrita wale ko talash karo qasid aate-jate rahe lekin use na pa sakein phir baad mein ek aadmi aaya aur use khushkhabri di, us ne kaha: Ham ne use do aadmiyon ke neeche zameen ke nichle hisse mein paya to Us ne us ke hath aur giltii tode, use liya aur khada kiya, aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, na Main ne jhoot kaha na mujh se jhoot kaha gaya Unhon ne yeh martaba-martaba kaha"
"161","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sa'id bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidah as-Salmani ne kaha: Main tumhen sirf Wahy khabar deta hun jo Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe khabar di: Mein ek chhote hath wala hai — ya vikrita hath wala, ya giltii wale hath wala — agar yeh na hota ke tum hajat se zyada mawafiq ho jao, to main tumhen khabar deta ke Allah ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban par unhen qatl karne wale ke liye Kya wa'da kiya hai to Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Ka'ba ke Rabb ki qasam Unhon ne yeh teen martaba kaha"
"162","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Kulaib se, Main ne Abu Burdah ko suna, Unhon ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe darmiyan ki ungli aur us ke thaile wali par anguthi pahanne se mana farmaya"
"163","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, shimra bin Atiyyah se, Suwaid bin ghafalaa al-Ju'fi se, unhon ne kaha: Ali bazaar nikalte aur kehte: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ne sach kaha un se kaha gaya: Tumhara kehna: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ne sach kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ne sach kaha jab main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karun to Allah ki qasam, aasman se giranaa aur parindon ka mujhe uchak le mujhe yeh kehne se zyada pasandeeda hai: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se woh suna jo Main ne nahin suna aur jab main tumhen apni taraf se bayan karun to jang dhoka hai Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aakhri zamane mein ek qaum pahunchegi umar mein jawan, aql mein naadaana, behtareen makhlooq ki baat se baat karte hue, Quran padhte hue aur woh un ke halaq se aage nahin badhe woh deen se aise nikal jaenge jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai jo unhen pae woh unhen qatl kare ya un se lade, kyunke jo unhen qatl karega use unhen qatl karne mein qayamat ke din ajr milta"
"164","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Jameel bin Murrah se, Abu al-vadiia as-suhaimii se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Ali Ibn Abi Talib ke sath an-naharavaana mein the unhon ne kaha: Vikrita wale ko talash karo to Unhon ne use talash kiya aur na paya woh un ke paas aae, aur unhon ne kaha: Jao aur use talash karo, kyunke Allah ki qasam, na Main ne jhoot kaha na mujh se jhoot kaha gaya, yahan tak ke Unhon ne mujh se yeh martaba-martaba kaha to woh aae aur kaha: Ham ne use maqtoolon ke neeche keechad mein paya jaise main use ab dekh raha hun, ek habshii, aurat ke seene jaisa seena, us par chhote baal jaise jarabuua ki gunah par chhote baala. Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) is par khush hue"
"165","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Rib'i se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Koi banda iman ka zaeqa nahin cakhataa yahan tak ke tamam taqdeer par iman laye"
"166","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin Abdullah bin Hurmuz se, Nafi' bin Jubair se, Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) na chhote the na lamba, sar aur dadhi bade, hatheliyon aur paon mote, jod bade, Aapka chehra surkhi liye, seene par balon ki lakeer lambi, jab chalte to zor se aage jhukte, jaise dhalan utar rahe hon Main ne Aap jaisa koi na Aap se pahle dekha na baad mein"
"167","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, bin zii huddaana se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban par jang ko dhoka naam diya"
"168","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abdul-Aziz bin al-mukhtaara ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin fairuuza se, hudaina Abu saasaana ar-Raqashi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas hazir tha jab al-Waleed bin Uqbah jane gae, Unhon ne sharab pi thi, aur Humran bin Aban aur ek aur aadmi ne un ke par gawahi di Usman ne Ali se kaha: Us par hadd qayam karo Ali ne Abdullah bin Jaafar zii al-janaahaina ko kode marne ka hukm diya Unhon ne kode marne shuru kiye jabke Ali samajhte rahe, yahan tak ke chalis lagaye phir un se kaha: rok Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chalis maare, Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne chalis maare, aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne assi maare, aur har ek sunnat hai, aur yeh mujhe zyada pasandeeda hai"
"169","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu at-Tayyah se, anazaa ke ek aadmi se, Bani Asad ke ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) hamare paas nikle jab pukaarne wale ne doosri pukarte kahi, aur kaha: Tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne witr ka hukm diya aur us ke liye yeh waqt muqarrar kiya azan kaho, Aey bin an-nabbaaha — ya: Iqamat kaho, Aey bin an-nabbaaha."
"170","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, zadahaama se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo janabat se pani se ek baal baghair chhue chhore, Allah us ke sath jahannam ka aisa-aisa karega liye Main ne apne sar ko — ya unhon ne kaha: Apne balon ko — dushman samjha, aur woh apne baal chhote katwae the"
"171","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Sabit bin Sauban ne ham se bayan kiya, abadaa Ibn Abi lubaabaa se, Abu Wa'il se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne teen-teen martaba wuzu kiya"
"172","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas sau ooqiya the aur Main ne us mein se das ooqiya Sadqa kiye doosre ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas sau dinar the aur Main ne us mein se das dinar Sadqa kiye doosre ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas das dinar the aur Main ne us mein se ek dinar Sadqa kiya Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek ne achcha kiya, aur tum ajr mein barabar ho; tum mein se har aadmi ne apne maal ka dahai hissa Sadqa kiya"
"173","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, habbaa al-Urani se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali ko kehte suna: Main pehla hun Jis ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi"
"174","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke jab woh Hajar-Aswad ke paas se guzarte aur us par bheed dekhte to us ki taraf munh karte aur takbir kehte, aur kehte: Aey Allah, Teri Kitab aur Tere Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat ki sach mein"
"175","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Hazrat Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wasiyat se pahle qarz ka faisla kiya, jabke tum padhte ho: {Us ki ki hui kisi wasiyat ya qarz ke baad}. aur yeh ke sage bhai jo ek hi walidah se hon woh baap ki taraf ke sharik bhaiyon ko rokakara waris honge"
"176","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Hubairah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas hazir tha jab un se Huzaifah ke bare mein poocha gaya unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Munafiqon ke naamon ke bare mein poocha aur unhen bataye gaye un se apne bare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Apne Aap ko main janta tha jab main ne poocha to mujhe jawab diya gaya, aur jab main khamosh raha to mujh se pahle baat ki gayi"
"177","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Maisarah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Wahb ko kehte suna: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Habarah shagaaf kapda bheja — ya'ni resham ka — to Main ne use pahna aur us mein bahar rawana Aap ne apne chehre par gussa dekha aur farmaya: Main ne yeh tumhen pahanne ke liye nahin bheja tha unhon ne kaha: To Main ne use hamari aurton mein, ya: Meri biwiyon mein taqseem diya"
"178","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Haris se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Ali, main tumhare liye woh pasand karta hun jo apne liye pasand karta hun, aur tumhare liye woh napasand karta hun jo apne liye napasand karta hun ruku mein qiraat na karo, na sajde mein, aur baal bandh namaz na padho, jo shaitan ki aaramgah hai, aur namaz mein kankriyon se na khelo, aur sone ki anguthi na pahno, aur qassi kapde na pahno, na narm ziinaposhon par sawari karo"
"179","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Umair bin Sa'id an-nakhaii se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Koi aisa nahin jis par Main ne hadd qayam ki aur woh mar gaya ke main us ke liye diyat dun, siwae sharab ki hadd ke, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use sunnat ke taur par muqarrar nahin kiya — ya unhon ne kaha: Siwae sharab ki hadd ke, kyunke Ham ne use muqarrar kiya"
"180","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim at-Taimi se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas Allah ki Kitab aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yeh sahifa ke siwa kuch nahin: Madinah ayra aur Saur ke darmiyan haram hai jo us mein koi bidaata dakhil kare, ya kisi bidati ko panah de, us par Allah, farishton aur sab logon ki lanat hai Allah us se koi farz ya nafl qabool nahin karega aur jo apne maalikon ki ijazat ke baghair kisi qaum ko dost banae, us par Allah, farishton aur sab logon ki lanat hai; us se koi farz ya nafl qabool nahin kiya jayega"
"181","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hajjaj se, al-Hakam se, Maimun Ibn Abi Shabeeb se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe do jawan khadim diye jo bhai the, to Main ne mein se ek ko bech diya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Donon bachchon ka Kya hua? Main ne kaha: Main ne mein se ek ko bech diya Aap ne farmaya: Use wapas"
"182","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Al-ahanafa bin Qais ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quraish se sulah ki to Aap ne likha: Yeh woh hai jis par Muhammad, Allah ke Rasulullah ne samajhautaa kiya hai unhon ne kaha: Agar ham jante ke Aap Allah ke Rasulullah hain to ham Aap se na larate. to Aap ne use mitaayaa aur likha: Muhammad bin Abdullah"
"183","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, al-ajalaha se, ash-Sha'bi se, Abdullah bin Khaleel al-Hazrami se, Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke un ke paas teen aadmi jane gae jo ek aurat ki paki mein Shareek hue the, to Unhon ne un ke darmiyan qura dala aur kaha: Tum jhagarane wale Shareek ho Unhon ne bachche ko qura jiitane wale ko diya, aur baqi do ke liye do-tihai diyat muqarrar ki is ki khabar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko di gayi, aur Aap hanse yahan tak ke Aap dadhen zahir huin"
"184","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yahya bin Salamah bin Kuhail ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, habbaa al-Urani se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khutba dete suna, aur woh aisi hansii hanse jaisi Main ne unhen kabhi hanste nahin dekha, jabke woh mimbar par the unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne Aap ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhte dekha mere walid ne hamen dekha jabke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padh raha tha, aur kaha: Aey mere bete, tum donon Kya kar rahe the? Main ne kaha: Ham namaz padh rahe the Abu Talib ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Allah ki qasam, mera pichavaaraa kabhi mujh se upar nahin uthegaa. Main ne unhen apne walid ki baat par hanste dekha phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne Aap ko logon se zamana pahle namaz padhte dekha"
"185","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mughirah Woh-dabbii se, Umm Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Jab se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke din mujhe jhanda saunpa, mujhe na aankh ki suujana hui na siradarda."
"186","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Amr bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu faakhitaa se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aae aur hamare sath raat guzari, jabke al-Hasan aur al-Husain so rahe the al-Hasan ne pani manga, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamari ek mashkeeza ke paas gae aur use pyale mein nicorane lage, phir unhen pilaya al-Husain ne peene ke liye hath badhaya, lekin Aap ne unhen roka aur al-Hasan se shuru kiya Fatimah ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jaise woh Aap zyada pasandeeda hai Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, lekin Us ne pahle pani manga phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main, aur tum, aur yeh donon — aur mera khayal hai Aap ne kaha: Aur yeh sone wala — ya'ni Ali — qayamat ke din ek jagah honge"
"187","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wasallam bin Shaddad ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Amir bin Abdullah bin az-Zubair ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne az-Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha: Tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karne se Kya rokta hai jaise bin Mas'ud aur falan riwayat karte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, jab se Main ne Islam qabool kiya main Aap se juda nahin hua, lekin Main ne Aap ek baat kehte suna Aap ne farmaya: Jo mere bare mein woh kahe jo Main ne nahin kaha, woh jahannam mein apni jagah bana le"
"188","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Muslim bin Jundub se, az-Zubair bin al-Awwam (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Jume ki namaz padhte the, phir chhaon ki taraf jaldi karte, aur ek ya do paon ki jagah ke siwa kuch na hota"
"189","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: As-Salt bin dinar ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah bin suhabaana aur Abu Raja al-utaaridii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Hazrat az-Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ko yeh aayat padhte suna: {Aur us fitne se daro jo sirf Unhin ko nahin pahunche jinhon tum mein se zulm kiya}. unhon ne kaha: Main ne yeh aayat ek waqt tak padhi aur apne Aap ko us ke walon mein nahin samjha, lekin ham us ke walon mein ho gae hain"
"190","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, ke yaiisha bin al-Waleed bin Hisham ne unhen bayan kiya ke az-Zubair bin al-Awwam (Raziyallahu anhu) ke ek aazad-karda ne unhen bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum tum pahle ki nabiyon ki beemari renga aai hai: Hasad aur bughza. bughz mundne wali hai; main nahin kehta woh baal mundti hai, lekin woh deen mundti hai us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum jannat mein dakhil nahin hoge yahan tak ke iman lao, aur iman nahin laoge yahan tak ke ek-doosre se muhabbat karo Kya main tumhen woh na bataun jo tumhare liye woh qayam karega: Apne darmiyan salam phailao"
"191","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas aae jabke main beemar tha, aur mujh se farmaya: Kya Tum ne wasiyat ki hai? Main ne kaha: Haan, Main ne apna sara maal wasiyat kar diya hai Aap ne farmaya: Phir Tum ne apne bachchon ke liye Kya chhoda? Main ne kaha: Woh bhalai ke sath ghani hain Aap ne farmaya: Dahai hissa wasiyat karo Aap mujhe ghataate rahe aur main ghataataa raha yahan tak ke Aap ne farmaya: Tihai wasiyat karo, aur tihai bahut hai"
"192","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd aur Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah aur doosron ne ham se bayan kiya, sab ne Zuhri se, Amir bin Sa'd se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main aisi beemari mein beemar hua jis se main marne ke qareeb tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas aae, aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas bahut maal hai, aur mujh se sirf ek beti waris hai Kya main apna sara maal Sadqa kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin main ne kaha: Kya main aadha Sadqa kar dun — ya unhon ne kaha: Kya main aadhe ki wasiyat karun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, phir main kis wasiyat karun? Aap ne farmaya: Tihai, aur tihai bahut hai kyunke tumhara apne warison ko ghani chhodna unhen logon ke hathon se mangte hue mohtaj chhorne se behtar hai"
"193","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd aur Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah aur doosron ne ham se bayan kiya, sab ne Zuhri se, Amir bin Sa'd se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum koi kharch nahin karte magar tumhen us ka ajr milta hai, yahan tak ke woh luqma bhi jo tum apni biwi ke munh tak uthate ho"
"194","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd aur Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah aur doosron ne ham se bayan kiya, sab ne Zuhri se, Amir bin Sa'd se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main sakht beemar hua aur marne ke qareeb tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas aae, aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya main apni hijrat ke baghair peeche chhoda jaunga? Aap ne farmaya: Tum mere baad peeche nahin chhore jao aur Allah ki raza chahte hue koi amal karoge magar us se tumhara girana aur darja badhe shayad tum peeche chhore jao yahan tak ke kuch log tumhare sath nafa paen aur kuch log tumhare sath nuqsan paaen. Aey Allah, mere sahaba ki hijrat poori kar, aur unhen Aediyon par na aaya lekin bakhton hai Sa'd bin khaulaa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us par reham aaya ke woh Makkah mein hua"
"195","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Amir bin Sa'd se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kuch logon ko diya aur ek aadmi ko na diya Sa'd ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki qasam, woh shak mu'min hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ya Musalman Sa'd ne phir kaha: Allah ki qasam, main use mu'min samajhta hun Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ya Musalman phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ek aadmi ko deta hun aur us ko deta hun jo us se behtar hai, darte hue ke Allah Ta'ala use munh ke bal jahannam mein phenk dega"
"196","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sabit Abu Zaid aur Sallam bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Usman an-Nahdi se, Sa'd Ibn Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Mere kaanon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna aur mere dil ne yaad rakha, Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne baap ke siwa kisi aur ki taraf nasab ka da'wa kare, yeh jante hue ke woh us ke baap ke siwa hai, us par jannat haram hai"
"197","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ziyad bin mikharaaqa ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu abaayaa ko suna — ya Qais bin abaayaa, Abu Dawud ko shak hua — ke Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ne apne ek bete ko kehte suna: Aey Allah, main tujh se jannat mangta hun, us ke aise-aise hujre, aur jahannam aur us ki beriyon aur zanjiiron se Teri panah mangta hun Sa'd ne us se kaha: Tum ne Allah se bahut bhalai mangi, aur us se bahut burayi se panah mangi — ya unhon ne kaha: Bade — aur Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ek qaum hogi jo dua mein hadd se barhegii. tumhen kafi hai yeh kehna: Aey Allah, main tujh se tamam bhalai mangta hun, jo main us mein se janta hun aur jo nahin janta, aur main tujh se tamam burayi se panah mangta hun, jo main us mein se janta hun aur jo nahin jaanta"
"198","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sa'id bin Hassan al-Makki ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Ubaidullah Ibn Abi nahiika se, Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh ham mein se nahin jo Quran ko khush-aavaazii se nahin parhataa."
"199","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Yunus bin Jubair ko Muhammad bin Sa'd se, Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Adam ke bete ka pet peep se bhar jae yeh us ke liye sheara se hai se behtar hai"
"200","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ikrimah bin Khalid al-Makhzumi ko bin Sa'd se, Sa'd se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne taoon ke bare mein farmaya: Agar woh kisi zameen mein ho aur tum us mein ho to use na chhodo; aur agar woh kisi zameen mein ho aur tum us mein na ho to us mein dakhil na ho Abu Dawud ne kaha: Jis ne is ke siwa kuch kaha Us ne ghalti ki"
"201","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Salim bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'd se, Sa'd se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi tarah"
"202","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibrahim bin Sa'd Ibn Abi Waqqas ko Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ali se farmaya: Kya tum is par razi nahin ke mere liye isi ho jaise Raziyallahu Musa ke liye the"
"203","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Uhud ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke daayen aur baayen do aadmiyon ko safed kapde pahne dekha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf se sab sakht pada ladte hue Main ne unhen us din se pahle na baad mein kabhi nahin dekha"
"204","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu yaafuura se, Unhon ne Mus'ab bin Sa'd ko kehte suna: Main ne Sa'd ke thaile mein namaz padhi jab Main ne ruku kiya to apne hath jorakara ghutnon ke darmiyan rakhe mere walid ne mujh se kaha: ham aisa karte the yahan tak ke hamen is se mana kiya gaya, aur hamen apne hath ghutnon par rakhne ka hukm diya gaya"
"205","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak bin Harb ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mus'ab bin Sa'd ko kehte suna: Mere walid ke bare mein chaar aayaat nazil huin unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne kaha: Main ne Badr ke din ek talwar hasil ki, to main use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe woh ghanimat mein de den Aap ne farmaya: Use wahin rakh do jahan se liya phir main Aap paas wapas aur kaha: Kya main aise chhoda jaunga jaise koi nafa nahin? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use wahin rakh do jahan se liya phir yeh aayat nazil hui: {Woh tum ghanimat ke bare mein poochte hain} — aur Abdullah ki qiraat mein isi tarah hai: (Woh tum ghanimat ke bare mein poochte hain) — poori aayat unhon ne kaha: Sa'd ki walidah ne kaha: Kya Allah ne walidah-baap ki ita'at ka hukm nahin diya? To main na khana khaauungii na pani piuungii yahan tak ke tum Allah se kufr karo Unhon ne khana-peena chhod diya yahan tak ke woh lakdi se un ka munh phailane lage phir nazil hua: {Aur Ham ne insan ko apne walidah-baap se bhalai ka hukm diya, lekin agar woh tum jida karen ke mere sath use Shareek karo jis ka tumhen ilm nahin, to un ki ita'at na karo}. Ansar ke ek aadmi ne khana banaya aur Muhajireen mein se kuch aur Ansar mein se kuch ko dawat di Ham ne khaya-piya yahan tak ke nashay mein hue, phir fakhr kiya ek aadmi ne oont ki haddi uthai aur Sa'd ki naak us se phaara di, to Sa'd ki naak phatii rah gayi, aur yeh sharab haram hone se pahle tha phir nazil hua: {Aey iman walon, nashay mein namaz ke qareeb na jao} aur nazil hua: {Sharab aur juwa aur but aur faal ke teer shaitan ke kaam ki gandagi hi hain} — aayat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Sa'd ke paas aae jabke woh beemar the, aur woh apna sara maal wasiyat karna chahte the, to Aap unhen ghataate rahe yahan tak ke tihai par pahunche unhon ne kaha: To log tihai ki wasiyat karte hain"
"206","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Mus'ab bin Sa'd se, Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Tabuk ke lashkar mein Ali Ibn Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ko peeche chhod unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya Aap mujhe aurton aur bachchon mein peeche chhodte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum is par razi nahin ke mere liye isi ho jaise Raziyallahu Musa ke liye the, siwae is ke ke mere baad koi Nabi nahin"
"207","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid al-Ansari ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Muhammad bin Sa'd Ibn Abi Waqqas ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen cheezen Adam ke bete ki khushanasiibii mein se hain, aur teen cheezen Adam ke bete ki bakhti mein se hain Adam ke bete ki khushanasiibii mein se hain: Nek biwi, tandurusta sawari, aur kushaada ghar — ya unhon ne kaha: Aur nek ghara. aur Adam ke bete ki bakhti mein se teen hain: Bura ghar, buri biwi, aur buri sawari"
"208","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-aizaara bin main ko Umar bin Sa'd se, un ke walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Mujhe Musalman par ta'ajjub hai; jab use museebat pahunchti hai to ajr chahta hai aur sabr karta hai, aur jab use bhalai pahunchti hai to Allah ki tareef karta hai aur shukr karta hai Musalman ko har cheez mein ajr milta hai, yahan tak ke us luqme mein bhi jo woh apne munh tak karta hai"
"209","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail Ibn Abi Khalid se, Qais Ibn Abi Hazim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath dekha jab hamare paas darakhton ke patton ke siwa koi khana na tha, yahan tak ke ham mein se ek aise hajat karta jaise bakriyan karti hain ab Bani Asad mujhe Islam ke bare mein malamat karte hain waqt main zaroor tabaah hota aur meri koshish bekaara jati"
"210","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se, Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya: Tum mere liye isi ho jaise Raziyallahu Musa ke liye the"
"211","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Malik bin Anas ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Yazid se, Zaid Abu Ayyash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'd se safed gehn se sult gehun khareedne ke bare mein poocha, aur Unhon ne use napasand kiya Sa'd ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se taza khajooron ke badle khushk khajooron ke bare mein poocha Aap ne farmaya: Kya taza khajoor sookhne par hoti hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han Aap ne farmaya: Nahin — ya: Aap ne mana farmaya"
"212","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah, Hisham aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya — sab ne — Asim bin bahadalaa se, Mus'ab bin Sa'd se, un ke walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaha logon ko sab sakht aazmaya jata hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ambiya ko, phir agle behtareen ko, phir agle behtareen ko, yahan tak ke aadmi ko us ke deen ke hisab se aazmaya jata hai agar woh deen mein mazboot ho to us ki aazmaish sakht hoti hai; aur agar us ke deen mein narmi ho to use usi hisab se aazmaya jata hai — ya: Usi matke tak aazmaish bande ko nahin deti yahan tak ke woh zameen par chale aur us par koi gunah na ho"
"213","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Aun as-Saqafi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Umar ne Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Unhon ne tumhari har cheez mein shikayat ki hai, yahan tak ke namaz mein kiya unhon ne kaha: Raha main, to main pehli do rak'aten lambi karta tha aur aakhri do chhoti, aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ki jo pairwi ki us mein kam nahin karta unhon ne kaha: Tumhare bare mein yahi socha jata hai, ya: Mera tumhare bare mein khayaala."
"214","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Kufa walon ne Umar se Sa'd ki shikayat ki, to Unhon ne unhen hataya aur un par Ammar ko muqarrar kiya unhon ne kaha: Sa'd achchi tarah namaz karna nahin jaanta Umar ne is ka zikr un se kiya Sa'd ne kaha: Raha main, to main unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz parhaataa tha, aur main us se na hatta tha: Donon Sham ki namazen; main pehli do mein farmaya aur aakhri do mein chhoti karta Umar ne kaha: Tumhare bare mein yahi socha jata hai, Aey Abu ishaaqa."
"215","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih se, jo at-tavaaamaa ke aazad-karda the, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd ke bachchon mein se ek ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sa'd se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise tum darakhton mein se kuch katwae pakad — ya'ni haram ke darakht — us ka maal tumhara hai us ke darakht na chaante jaen, na kaate jaen unhon ne kaha: Sa'd ne kuch jawanon ko katwae dekha, to Unhon ne un ka saaman le liya woh apne maalikon ke paas gae aur unhen khabar di ke Sa'd ne aisa-aisa kiya woh un ke paas aae aur kaha: Aey Abu Ishaq, tumhare jawanon — ya: Tumhare aazaadakardaaon — ne hamare jawanon ka saaman liya unhon ne kaha: Lekin Main ne unhen liya Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jise tum haram ke darakhton mein se katwae pakad, us ka maal tumhara hai lekin mere maal se jo chaho mango"
"216","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Sa'id bin al-Musayyab se, Sa'd bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Usman bin Maz'un ko kunvaarepana se inkar kiya, aur agar Aap unhen ijazat dete to ham apne Aap ko khassi kar lete"
"217","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin al-Musayyab ko kehte suna: Main ne Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Uhud ke din mere liye apne walidah-baap donon ko jama kiya"
"218","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Isa bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Koi maut jis se main chahun mujhe us se zyada karti nahin ke mazloom hote hue apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jaun"
"219","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne chacha Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne Bani main ka zikr hua, aur Aap ne farmaya: Woh mere ek qabeela hain unhon ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai Aap ne farmaya: Aur main mein se hun ya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh farmaya, ya us aadmi ne yeh kaha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen jawab diya"
"220","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, ke jab Abdur Rahman bin Auf namaz padha chuke the aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae, to woh peeche hatane lage, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen ishara kiya: Jaise ho isi Hazrat to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdur Rahman ki namaz ke peeche namaz padhi"
"221","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Nasr bin Ali al-huddaanii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: An-Nazr bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se mila, aur kaha: Mujhe ek hadees sunaao jo tumhare walid ne tumhen Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sunayi unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya (Raziyallahu anhu), unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ramazan ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Ek Maheena jis ka roza Allah ne tum par farz kiya hai, aur Main ne us ke qiyam ko qayam kiya hai jo use iman aur sawab ki niiyata se roza rakhe aur qiyam kare woh apne gunahon se aise nikalta hai jaise us din jab us ki walidah ne use jana tha"
"222","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Bajalah se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne Majoosiyon se jizya nahin liya yahan tak ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne gawahi di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajar ke Majoosiyon se woh liya tha"
"223","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Abu al-Bakhtari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek aadmi se ek hadees suni aur woh mujhe pasand aai, to main ne kaha: Likh do woh use mere paas likha hua, naqsha kiya hua laya unhon ne kaha: Ali aur al-Abbas Umar ke paas dakhil hue, aur un ke sath Abdur Rahman bin Auf, az-Zubair bin al-Awwam aur Sa'd Ibn Abi Waqqas the unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, Kya Tum ne nahin suna, Kya tum nahin jante, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nabi ka sara maal Sadqa hai siwae us ke jis se Us ne apne ghar walon ko khilaya aur pahanaayaa. hamara virasaa nahin hota unhon ne kaha: Han"
"224","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, bashshaara Ibn Abi Saif se, al-Waleed bin Abdur Rahman se, ghuzaifa bin al-Haris se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ubaidah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah Ta'ala ke raste mein faalatuu kharch kare, neki saat sau gunaa nikali jati hai jo apne upar, ya apne ghar walon par kharch kare, ya beemar ki iyadat kare, ya takleef door kare, neki us ke jaisi das gunaa hai roza dhal hai jab tak woh use na phaare. jise Allah Ta'ala us ke jism mein mubtala kare, us ke liye kaffara hai"
"225","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais se, Abdur Rahman bin Sabit se, Abu Sa'labah al-Khushani se, Abu Ubaidah bin al-Jarrah aur Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne is kaam ko nubuwwat aur rehmat ke taur par shuru kiya, aur khilafat aur rehmat hogi, aur katne wali badshahat hogi, aur zameen mein zor aur zulm aur fasad hoga woh sharmagaahon, sharaabon aur resham ko halal samajhenge, aur us par un ki madad ki jaegi, aur hamesha rizq diye jaenge, yahan tak ke Allah se milen."
"226","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Maimun se, bin Samurah se, un ke walid se, Abu Ubaidah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hijaz ke Yahud ko Jazirat-Arab se nikal do"
"227","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Musa bin Talha se, un ke walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha, aur Aap khajooron mein nisecana karte logon ke paas se guzre Aap ne farmaya: Yeh Kya kar rahe hain? Main ne kaha: Woh khajooron ka nisecana kar rahe hain, narr ko ki mein rakhte hue Aap ne farmaya: Main nahin samajhta yeh kuch nafa deta hai phir farmaya: Agar unhen nafa deta hai to karen rae par mera hisab na lo, lekin jab main tumhen Allah Ta'ala ki taraf se kuch bataun to main Allah ke bare mein kabhi jhoot nahin bolataa."
"228","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sallam aur Yazid bin Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Musa bin Talha se, un ke walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us ka zikr kiya jo hamare samne se guzarne hai janwaron mein se jabke ham namaz padhte hain Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek apne samne kajave ki pichhli lakdi jaisi koi cheez rakhe, aur jo us ke samne se guzrega use nuqsan nahin pahunchaye"
"229","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, un ke ek shaikh se, Talha bin Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ghair-muhrim ki taraf se muhrim ko tohfe mein diye shikar ke gosht ke bare mein poocha gaya, aur Aap ne us ki ijazat di"
"230","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Ubaidah bin Muhammad bin Ammar bin Yasir se, Talha bin Abdullah bin Auf se, Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jae woh shaheed hai, aur jo apne khoon ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jae woh shaheed hai"
"231","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Nufail bin Hisham bin Sa'id bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail al-Adawi se — Quraish ke Adi — apne walid se, apne dada se, ke Zaid bin Amr aur Waraqah bin Naufal deen ki talash mein nikle yahan tak ke mosula mein ek rahib ke paas pahunche Us ne Zaid bin Amr se kaha: Tum kahan se aae ho, Aey oont sawar? Us ne kaha: Ibrahim ke ghar se us ne kaha: Aur tum Kya chahte ho? Us ne kaha: Main deen chahta hun us ne kaha: Wapas jao, kyunke jise tum chahte ho woh tumhari zameen mein zahir hone wala hai raha Waraqah, to woh Nasrani ho gaya Zaid ne kaha: Raha main, to mujhe iisaaiiyata pesh ki gayi aur woh mujhe qasam na lagi to woh wapas, kehta hua: Sach mein, sach mein, nekii. aur woh kehta hai: Jitna Tu mujh par bojh phenke, phir woh sajde mein girataa hai unhon ne kaha: Us ka beta Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere walid isi the jaisa Aap ne dekha aur jaisa Aap pahunchi, to un ke liye bakhshish mango Aap ne farmaya: Haan, kyunke woh qayamat ke din akeli ummat hoga unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae, Zaid bin Harisah ke sath, jabke woh apne ek dastarkhwan se kha rahe the, aur Unhon ne unhen apne khane ki dawat di Zaid bin Amr ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Aey mere bhai ke bete, ham us mein se nahin khate jo buton par zabah kiya jae"
"232","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain bin Abdur Rahman ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hilal bin Yasaf ko Abdullah bin zalim al-Mazini se, Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hira par the, Abu Bakr, Umar, Usman, Ali, Talha, az-Zubair, Sa'd aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhum) ke sath Aap ne farmaya: Sabit rah, Aey Hira, kyunke tum par sirf ek Nabi, ya Siddiq, ya shaheed hai Sa'id ne zikr kiya ke woh un ke sath the"
"233","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-hurra bin as-sayyaaha an-nakhaii se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin al-akhanasa ko kehte suna: Main al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah ko khutba dete dekha, aur Unhon ne Ali ki burayi ki Sa'id bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail al-Adawi — Quraish ke Adi — (Raziyallahu anhu) khade hue aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Das jannat mein hain: Allah ke Rasulullah, Abu Bakr, Umar, Usman, Ali, Talha, az-Zubair, Sa'd bin Malik aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhum). agar main daswen ka naam le chahta to us ka naam lunga phir Unhon ne us ka naam liya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin zaida."
"234","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Haris bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Salamah se, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ne hamen Sa'id bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail aur aravaa naam ki ek aurat ke darmiyan sulah ke liye bheja, jo un par zameen ka kuch da'wa karti thi Sa'id ne kaha: Kya tum samajhte ho Main ne us ki zameen mein se kuch liya, jabke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo haq ek balisht zameen le woh saat zameenon se us ka tauq pahnaya jayega"
"235","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Haris se, Abu Salamah se, Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni qasam se maal hathiyaae, Allah use us ke liye barkat nahin dega"
"236","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Zaid bin Qunfuz se, Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Talha bin Ubaidullah se, Sa'id bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Marwan un ki zameen le chahta tha, lekin Unhon ne unhen inkar kiya, aur kaha: Agar woh mere paas aayenge to main un se laruungaa. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jae woh shaheed hai"
"237","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Haris se, Abu Salamah se, Sa'id se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne maalikon ki ijazat ke baghair kisi aazad-karda ko dost banae, us par Allah ki lanat hai"
"238","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'd bin Ibrahim se Bani main ke bare mein poocha unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh mere ek qabeela hain, aur mera khayal hai Aap ne farmaya: Aur main mein se hun main ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yeh kaun riwayat karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin zaida."
"239","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Hasan Ibn Abi Jaafar al-jufarii ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu chamda se — Madinah walon mein se — bin huvaitiba bin Abdul-Uzza se, un ki dadi se, un ke walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Woh Allah par iman nahin laya jo mujh par iman nahin laya, aur woh mujh par iman nahin laya jo Ansar se muhabbat nahin karta"
"240","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Hasan Ibn Abi Jaafar ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu chamda se, bin huvaitiba bin Abdul-Uzza se, un ki dadi se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Wuzu ke baghair koi namaz nahin, aur us ke liye koi wuzu nahin jo us par Allah ka naam na le"
"241","[AI-translation] Yunus ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin bahadalaa se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare liye ek lakeer khiincii aur farmaya: Yeh Allah ka rasta hai phir us ke daayen aur baayen lakeeren khiinciin, aur farmaya: Yeh raste hain; mein se har raste par ek shaitan hai jo us ki taraf bulaataa hai phir Aap ne tilawat ki: {Aur yeh ke yahi mera seedha rasta hai} — aayat"
"242","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap salam kiya, lekin Aap ne mujhe diya nahin mujhe Purane aur nai ghabrahat ne gher liya main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya mere bare mein koi nai baat hui hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala apne Nabi par apne mamle mein se jo chahta hai Wahy karta hai, aur jo Us ne naya nazil kiya hai us mein se hai ke tum namaz mein baat nahin karoge."
"243","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala ne bandon ke dilon mein dekha aur Muhammad ko muntakhib, to unhen apne paighaamon ke sath bheja aur apne ilm se unhen cunaa. phir un ke baad logon ke dilon mein dekha aur un ke liye un ke sahaba ko muntakhib, unhen apne deen ke madadgar aur apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke vaziira banaya jise mu'min husn samjhen woh Allah ke han achcha hai, aur jise mu'min bura samjhen woh Allah ke han bura hai"
"244","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Banda sach bolta rehta hai aur sach talash karta rehta hai yahan tak ke woh Allah ke paas Siddiq likha jata hai aur woh jhoot bolta rehta hai aur jhoot talash karta rehta hai yahan tak ke woh Allah ke paas kazzab likha jata hai"
"245","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, bayan se, unhon ne kaha: Jab murjiaa zahir hue to main Abu Wa'il ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr un se kiya unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kehte suna ke Aap ne farmaya: Mu'min ko bura dena fisq hai, aur us se ladna kufr hai"
"246","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhte to kehte the: Allah par salam, Jibreel par salam, miikaaiila par salaama. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamari taraf mude aur farmaya: Na kaho: Allah par salam, kyunke Allah Ta'ala as-salam hai lekin kaho: Tahiyyatu Allah ke liye hain, namazen aur pak kalimaata. salam ho tum par, Aey Nabi, aur Allah ki rehmat aur barkaten salam ho ham par aur Allah ke nek bandon par main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasulullah hain"
"247","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu nahashala ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Wa'il se, unhon ne kaha: bin Mas'ud ne kaha: Umar logon se aage ho Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki Umar ke bare mein dua ke sath: Aey Allah, logon ko Umar ke sath mazboot karo"
"248","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: bin an-navvaahaa aur bin Usal musailimaa ke do qasid kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Allah ka Rasulullah hun? Unhon ne kaha: Ham gawahi dete hain ke musailimaa Allah ka Rasulullah hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Allah aur us ke Rasoolon par iman lata hun agar main qasid ko qatl karne wala hota to tum donon ko qatl karta Abdullah ne kaha: To sunnat jari rahi ke qasid qatl nahin kiye jate Abdullah ne kaha: Raha bin Usal, to Allah us ke par hamen kafi hua; aur raha bin an-navvaahaa, to woh mere zehana mein raha yahan tak ke Allah Ta'ala ne us par qaboo diya"
"249","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala ne Ibrahim ko Khaleel banaya, aur tumhare sathi Allah ke Khaleel hain Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qayamat ke din Allah Ta'ala ke han makhlooq mein sab azeem hain phir Unhon ne tilawat ki: {Sakta hai tumhara Rabb tumhen Maqam-Mahmud tak uthae}."
"250","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Isha ki namaz ke baad qeel baat se mana farmaya"
"251","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Unhon ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi us ke sath hai jis se woh muhabbat karta hai"
"252","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Unhon ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Har khaayina ka qayamat ke din ek jhanda hoga; kaha jaega: Yeh falan ki khayanat hai"
"253","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Unhon ne Abu Wa'il ko kehte suna: Abdullah ne kaha: Mujhe tumhari majlis ki khabar milti hai, aur mujhe tumhare paas nikalne se koi cheez nahin rokti siwae tumhen ukataane ke dar ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen nasihat ke liye durust waqt chuna the, hamare liye ukataahata se darte hue"
"254","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek baat kahi, aur main doosri kehta hun Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke sath Shareek thaharaate hue mare woh jahannam mein dakhil hoga Abdullah ne kaha: Aur main kehta hun: Jo Allah ke sath Shareek na thaharaate hue mare, Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega"
"255","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Jab teen hon to do teesre ko chhodkar sargoshi na karen, kyunke yeh use ghamgin karta hai"
"256","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash aur Mansoor ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ko bura dena fisq hai, aur us se ladna kufr hai"
"257","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko kehte suna: Ek aadmi ne Abdullah se Allah Ta'ala ke qaul {baghair badle pani se} ya {ya seen} ke bare mein poocha Abdullah ne kaha: Kya Tum ne is ke siwa sara Quran padh liya hai? Us ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Kuch log use padhte hain, use ghatiya khajooron ke bikharane ki tarah bikherate hue; woh un ki hansli se aage nahin barhataa. main un mushaabeha suraton ko janta hun jinhein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek sath jorate the unhon ne kaha: To Ham ne Alqamah ko hukm diya, aur Unhon ne un se poocha unhon ne kaha: Mufassal ki bees suraten; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har do suraton ko ek rak'at mein jorate the"
"258","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya hamara hisab hoga jo Ham ne Jahiliyat mein kiya? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein neki kare us ka hisab nahin hoga jo Us ne Jahiliyat aur Islam mein kiya jo Islam mein burayi kare us ka hisab hoga jo Us ne Jahiliyat aur Islam mein kiya"
"259","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Kitna bura hai ke mein se ek kahe: Main falan-falan aayat bhool gaya lekin use bhulaayaa gaya Quran ko yaad karte raho, kyunke us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, woh aadmiyon ke seenon se oonton ke bandhan se chuutane se zyada tez se nikalta hai"
"260","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jo pakka qasam khae taake us se maal hathiyaae, us mein badkar hote hue, woh Allah Ta'ala se liye jabke woh us se ghadabnak hoga unhon ne kaha: Al-Ash'as bin Qais al-Kindi hamare paas nikle aur kaha: Abu Abdur Rahman ne tumhen Kya sunaya? Unhon ne kaha: To ham ne kaha: Aisi-aisi hadees unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha; yeh mere bare mein nazil hui Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne ek kuen ke bare mein ek aadmi se jhagda kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari istidlal, ya us ki qasam main ne kaha: Phir woh gunah hote hue qasam khaaegaa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo pakka qasam khae, us mein badkar ya gunah hote hue, taake us se maal hathiyaae, woh Allah Ta'ala se liye jabke woh us se ghadabnak hoga aur nazil hua: {Jo Allah ke ahd aur apni qasmon ke badle thodi qeemat khareedte hain} — aayat"
"261","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mera khayal hai Unhon ne marfu' bayan kiya — unhon ne kaha: Qayamat se pahle harj ke din honge: Aise din mein ilm jaega aur jahalat zahir hogi al-Ash'ari bin Mas'ud ke thaile mein the, aur al-Ash'ari ne kaha: Harj ka matlab qatl hai"
"262","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wasil ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah bin Mas'ud se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kaun-sa gunah sab bada hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ke tum Allah ke sath Shareek thehrao jabke Us ne tumhen paida kiya unhon ne kaha: Phir kaun-sa? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ke tum apni aulaad ko is dar se qatl karo ke woh tumhara maal baantegaa. unhon ne kaha: Phir kaun-sa? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo"
"263","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mahadii bin Maimun ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi jaisi, aur Unhon ne yeh aayat padhi: {Aur jo Allah ke sath kisi aur ma'bood ko nahin pukarta, na us jaan ko marte jise Allah ne haram kiya magar haq ke sath, na zina karte hain}."
"264","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Unhon ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh un se suna aur Unhon ne marfu' bayan kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala se zyada ghairat wala koi nahin, aur liye Us ne buraiyan haram ki, jo us mein se zahir hai aur jo chipii hai Allah se zyada tareef ko pasand karne wala koi nahin, aur liye Us ne apni tareef ki aur Allah, Tabaraka wa Ta'ala se zyada uzr ko pasand karne wala koi nahin"
"265","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr se, aur Unhon ne Abu Wa'il ko riwayat karte suna ke ek aadmi bin Mas'ud ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main ne aaj raat Mufassal ek rak'at mein padha Abdullah ne kaha: Sheara ki jaldi tilawat jaisi! Main un mushaabeha suraton ko janta hun jinhein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek sath jorate the Unhon ne Mufassal ki bees suraten zikr ki, ek rak'at mein do suuraten."
"266","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Koi aurat kisi aurat ko kar phir apne shauhar ke samne us ka sifat na bayan kare, jaise woh use dekh raha ho"
"267","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din logon ke darmiyan sab pahle khoon ka faisla hoga — ya: Muqaddar hoga"
"268","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhen ek umdah hadees na sunaauun? Ibrahim ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Jab nazil hua: {Jo iman jane aur apne iman mein zulm na karaya}, to unhon ne kaha: Ham mein se kaun hai Jis ne ghalti nahin ki? Yahan tak ke yeh aayat nazil hui: {Allah ke sath shirk na karo; Beshak shirk bada zulm hai}."
"269","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen namaz padhai aur zyada ya kam kiya — jo yeh bhoolaya woh ya to Ibrahim Alqamah se hain, ya Alqamah Abdullah se jab Aap apni namaz se farigh hue to kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Kya namaz mein koi nai baat hui hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, aur woh Kya hai? Ham ne Aap khabar jo Aap ne kiya tha Aap ne apni taang modi, qible ki taraf munh kiya, phir do sajde kiye phir apne chehre se hamari taraf mude aur farmaya: Agar namaz mein koi nai baat hoti to main tumhen khabar deta lekin main tumhare jaisa insan hun; main bhoolta hun jaise tum bhoolte ho jab main bhoolun to mujhe yaad bhagao tum mein se jo apni namaz mein shak kare woh durust ke sab qareeb ko talash kare aur us par kamil kare phir salam phere, aur do sajde kare"
"270","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, ke woh Abdullah ke sath Arafah mein Usman ki khilafat mein khade the Usman ne Abdullah se kaha: Kya main tumhari ihsan na karaun — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ya doosre ne is sanad mein kaha: Kya main tumhari ihsan kisi bandi se na karaun jo tumhen tumhare bare mein woh yaad dilaaegii jo tum bhool gae ho? Unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne is tarah kaha taake Alqamah sune: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Tum mein se jo ihsan ki taqat rakhe woh ihsan kare; warna roza rakhe, kyunke roza us ke liye rok hai"
"271","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko kehte suna: Abdullah ne kaha: Main un mushaabeha suraton ko janta hun jinhein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek sath jorate the unhon ne kaha: To Ham ne Alqamah ko hukm diya, aur Unhon ne un se poocha unhon ne kaha: Mufassal ki bees suraten; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har do suraton ko ek rak'at mein jorate the"
"272","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mughirah se, Ibrahim se, hunaiya bin nuvairaa se, Alqamah se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Qatl mein logon mein sab zyada rukne wale iman wale hain"
"273","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan bin al-hurra se, al-Qasim bin mukhaimiraa se, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah ne mera hath pakda, aur Alqamah ne zikr kiya ke bin Mas'ud ne un ka hath pakda, aur bin Mas'ud ne zikr kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ka hath pakda aur unhen tashahhud sikhaya: Tahiyyatu Allah ke liye hain, namazen aur pak kalimaata. salam ho tum par, Aey Nabi, aur Allah ki rehmat aur barkaten salam ho ham par aur Allah ke nek bandon par main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasulullah hain jab tum yeh kaho to tumhari namaz kamil hai agar chaho khade ho; aur agar chaho diya"
"274","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne Zuhr paanch rak'at padhi Aap se kaha gaya: Kya namaz farma di gayi hai? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur woh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne paanch padhin to Aap ne salam pherne ke baad do sajde kiye"
"275","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chataai par lete, aur chataai ne Aap khaal par nishan chhod diya main unhen Aap se ponchhne laga, kehta hua: Mere walidah-baap Aap par fida hon, Ya Rasulullah, Kya Aap hamen ijazat nahin denge ke Aap liye kuch bichaaen jo Aap hifazat kare, sone ke liye? Aap ne farmaya: Mera duniya se Kya wasta? Main aur duniya yahi aise hain jaise ek sawar jo darakht ke neeche chhaon le, phir chale aur use chhod de"
"276","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Alqamah se, Abdullah se, Allah Ta'ala ke qaul ke bare mein: {Shak Us ne apne Rabb ki bade nishaniyon mein se dekha}. unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ko sabz farsha par dekha, aasman ke aasman ko dhake hue"
"277","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad se, un ke walid se, aur Alqamah se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko har utarne aur chadhne mein, khade aur baithe, takbir kehte dekha, aur apne daayen aur baayen salam pherte, yahan tak ke Main ne Aap rukhasaara ki safedi dekhi aur Main ne Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko aisa karte dekha"
"278","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yazid bin Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ibrahim an-nakhaii se, Alqamah ya al-Aswad se, Abdullah se, Allah Ta'ala ke qaul {qayamat qareeb aai aur chand phat gaya} ke bare mein unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein chand phataa."
"279","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Wuhaib bin Khalid aur Yazid bin zuraia ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud Ibn Abi Hind se, ash-Sha'bi se, Alqamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne bin Mas'ud se kaha: Log kehte hain ke tum jinnion wali raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the unhon ne kaha: Ham mein se koi Aap sath na tha, lekin Ham ne Aap Makkah mein na paya aur pahaarii darron aur wadiyon mein talash kiya main ne kaha: Unhen qatl kar diya gaya, uchak liya gaya Ham ne sab buri raat guzari jo kisi qaum ne guzari ho jab subah hui to Ham ne Aap aate dekha ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kal raat Ham ne sab buri raat guzari jo kisi qaum ne guzari ho; Ham ne Aap na paya Aap ne farmaya: Jinnion ka ek bulane wala mere paas aaya, to main gaya aur unhen Quran sunaya Unhon ne hamen sath liya aur hamen un ke ghar aur un ki aag dikhaaiin. Unhon ne un se rizq mangi, to Aap ne farmaya: Har haddi jis par Allah ka naam na liya gaya ho, tumhare hathon mein sab gosht wali haalat mein hoti hui, aur har gobar tumhare janwaron ka bachna hai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen un se istinja karne se mana farmaya, aur farmaya: Yeh jinnion mein se tumhare bhaiyon ki rizq hai"
"280","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Aswad ko suna, Unhon ne Abdullah ko suna: Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko {to Kya koi nasihat pakarane wala hai} padhte suna"
"281","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Aswad bin Yazid ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah mein an-Najm padhi aur us mein sajdah kiya, aur jo Aap sath the Unhon ne sajdah kiya, siwae ek boodhe ke Jis ne kankriyon ya mitti ki ek mutthi li, use apni peshani tak uthaya, aur kaha: Yeh mujhe kafi hai Abdullah ne kaha: Main ne use Badr ke din kafir mara hua dekha"
"282","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umarah bin Umair ko al-Aswad se, Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se koi shaitan ke liye apni namaz ka hissa muqarrar na kare, yeh samajhte hue ke us par lazim hai ke daayen ke siwa na nikle Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kasrat baayen nikalte dekha hai"
"283","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak bin Harb ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad ya Alqamah se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur zikr kiya ke Us ne humbistari se kam ek aurat ko chhua tha Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use jawab nahin diya yahan tak ke Allah Ta'ala ne nazil kiya: {Aur din ke donon kinaron aur raat ki auqat mein namaz qayam karo} — aayat ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya yeh usi ke liye khaas hai ya sab logon ke liye? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin sab logon ke liye"
"284","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad se, un ke walid se, Abdullah se, ke woh apne daayen salam pherte the: Salam ho tum par, aur Allah ki rehmat aur barkatein; aur apne baayen: Salam ho tum par aur Allah ki rahamata. al-Aswad se, is ke siwa sanad se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi jaisi riwayat aai hai"
"285","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Ubaidah ne bayan nahin kiya, lekin Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad ne, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baitul-khala mein dakhil hue, to main Aap peeche gaya Main ne Aap liye do pathar aur ek gobar rakha Aap bahar aae, donon pathar liye, gobar phenk diya, aur farmaya: Yeh gandagi hai"
"286","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad se, un ke walid se, Abdullah se, ke jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas qaidi jane jate to Aap mutawajjuh gharane ko ek sath dete, unhen juda karna napasand karte hue"
"287","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Murrah ko Masrooq se, Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ka khoon halal nahin magar teen mein se ek se: Shadishuda zani, jaan ke badle jaan, aur woh jo apna deen chhod de, jama'at se juda hote hue"
"288","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Abdullah bin Murrah se — mera khayal hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Zaidah ne is sanad mein kaha, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Woh ham mein se nahin jo rukhsar piite, kapde phaare, aur Jahiliyat ki pukarte pukaare."
"289","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Murrah ko Masrooq se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Abdullah se shuhada ki ruuhon ke bare mein poocha — aur agar Abdullah na hote to hamen koi na milta jo hamen bayan kare — aur unhon ne kaha: Shuhada ki Roohein Allah ke paas sabz parindon ke poton mein hain, jannat ki naharon mein jahan chahen ghuumatii hui, phir Arsh ke neeche caraaghon mein panah leti hui un ka Parwardigar un se kehta hai: Tum Kya chahte ho? Woh kehte hain: Ham kuch nahin chahte — yeh teen martaba kehte hue — siwae is ke ke duniya mein kare jaen aur qatl kiye jaen"
"290","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Abu Woh-Duha se, Masrooq se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main sachche, tasdiiqashudaa Abu al-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi deta hun ke Aap ne farmaya: Muhaffalaata janwar bechna dhoka hai, aur dhoka Musalman ke liye halal nahin"
"291","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Abu Woh-Duha se, Masrooq se, Abdullah se, ke jab Quraish Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke par sarakasha hue to Aap ne un ke par qahatasaalii ke zamana ki dua ki yahan tak ke Unhon ne murdaara aur haddiyan khayein, yahan tak ke aadmi khada hota aur apne aur aasman ke darmiyan dhuan jaisi koi cheez dekhta; yahi Allah Ta'ala ka qaul hai: {Us din jab aasman wazeh dhuwen pahunchayega}."
"292","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Abu Woh-Duha se, Masrooq se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jis ke paas ilm ho woh apne ilm se baat kare, aur jis ke paas ilm na ho — ya unhon ne kaha: Jis se us ke bare mein poocha jae jis ka use ilm nahin — woh kahe: Allah behtar janta hai, kyunke Allah Ta'ala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se farmaya: {Kaho: Main tum is ke liye koi ajr nahin mangta siwae qurbadari ki muhabbat ke}."
"293","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Mughirah se, Abu Woh-Duha se, Masrooq se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zindagi mein chand phataa, to Quraish ne kaha: Yeh Ibn Abi Kabshah ka jadu hai unhon ne kaha: Aur unhon ne kaha: Intezar karo jo musafir tumhare paas laen, kyunke Muhammad sab logon ko masahuura nahin kar rakhta unhon ne kaha: Phir musafir aae aur waisi hi khabar laye"
"294","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Yahya bin vassaaba se, Masrooq se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfu', Aap ne farmaya: Napak bure amal ka kaffara nahin banta, lekin pak bure amal ka kaffara banta hai"
"295","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Wahb ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mere baad tarjeeh aur aise mamle dekhoge jinhein tum napasand karoge. ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap hamen Kya hukm dete hain? Aap ne farmaya: Unhen un ka haq do jo Us ne unhen diya hai, aur Allah se apna haq mango"
"296","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Wahb al-Juhani ko kehte suna: Main ne Abdullah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se bayan kiya, aur woh sachche, tasdiiqashudaa hain: Tum mein se ek ki paida us ki walidah ke pet mein chalis raaton tak jama rehti hai, phir khayal hi muddat tak jama hua khoon banta hai, phir khayal hi muddat tak gosht ka loothda banta hai, phir us ke paas farishta bheja jata hai aur chaar baton ka hukm diya jata hai: Us ka rizq, us ki umar, us ka amal, aur woh bakhton hai ya khushanasiiba; phir us mein rooh phuunkii jati hai Allah ki qasam, tum mein se ek — ya tum mein se ek aadmi — jannat walon ke amal karta rah sakta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur us ke darmiyan sirf ek hath ka kushadgi rahe, phir taqdeer us par ghalib aati hai aur woh jahannam walon ke amal karta hai aur us mein dakhil hota hai; aur tum mein se ek aadmi — ya tum mein se ek — jahannam walon ke amal karta rah sakta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur us ke darmiyan sirf ek hath ka kushadgi rahe, phir taqdeer us par ghalib aati hai aur woh jannat walon ke amal karta hai aur us mein dakhil hota hai"
"297","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor aur al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Ubaidah as-Salmani se, Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein sab behtareen meri piirhii hai, phir woh jo un ke baad aayenge, phir woh jo un ke baad aayenge; phir ek qaum pahunchegi jin ki qasmen un ki gawahi se pahle hongi, aur woh gawahi denge is se pahle ke un se gawahi mangi jae"
"298","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Ahwas ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Agar main apni ummat mein se koi Khaleel banata to Abu Bakr ko banata"
"299","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Ahwas ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi sach bolta hai yahan tak ke woh Siddiq likha jata hai, aur aadmi jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke woh kazzab likha jata hai"
"300","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne mujhe khabar di, jinhon Abu al-Ahwas ko suna, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham apne ek sathi ke bare mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae, un se use daaghane ki ijazat mangte hue, aur woh khamosh rahe; phir Ham ne dobara poocha aur woh khamosh rahe; phir teesri martaba poocha aur woh khamosh rahe; phir dobara poocha to farmaya: Use garmi patthron se dagho, jalaao — aur Unhon ne use napasand kiya"
"301","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, jinhon Abu al-Ahwas ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is dua se dua karte the: Aey Allah, main tujh se hidayat, taqwa, pakdamani aur kifayat mangta hun"
"302","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, jinhon Abu al-Ahwas ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne kaha: Ham nahin jante the har do rak'at mein Kya kahen siwae apne Rabb ki tasbih, takbir aur tahamiida ke, aur Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bhalai ki kunjiyaan aur us ke jaamea kalimaat sikhaye gae — ya us ke jaamea aur khaatima kalimaat — aur Unhon ne hamen hukm diya ke har do rak'at mein kahen: Tahiyyatu Allah ke liye hain, aur namazen aur achchi baat; salam ho tum par, Aey Nabi, aur Allah ki rehmat aur barkatein; salam ho ham par aur Allah ke nek bandon par; main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasulullah hain; phir tum mein se ek sab pasandeeda dua cune aur us se dua kare"
"303","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main al-Aswad bin Yazid ke paas aaya — aur woh mere bhai aur dost the — aur main ne kaha: Abu al-Ahwas Abdullah se tashahhud mein karte hain: Aur barkat len unhon ne kaha: Un ke paas jao aur unhen is se mana karo, aur un se kaho: Abdullah ne Alqamah ko tashahhud sikhaya, unhen apne hath par samajhte hue"
"304","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, jinhon Abu al-Ahwas ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman se ladna kufr hai, aur use bura dena fisq hai; aur Musalman ke liye halal nahin ke apne bhai ko teen din se zyada chhod"
"305","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud Ibn Abi al-furaata ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Zaid al-Abdi se, Abu al-aayana se, Abu al-Ahwas se, bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bandaron aur suuaron ke bare mein poocha, Kya woh Yahud ki nasla mein se hain Aap ne farmaya: Nahin; Allah Ta'ala ne kabhi kisi qaum par lanat karke unhen masakha nahin kiya phir unhen nasla di; lekin yeh ek makhlooq thi jo pahle se hazir thi, lekin jab Allah Ta'ala Yahud par ghazabanaaka hua aur unhen masakha kiya to unhen un ke jaisa bana diya"
"306","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz mein do salaamon se salam pherte the"
"307","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jaafar bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, an-Nazr bin Humaid al-Kindi se — ya al-Abdi — al-Jarud se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quraish ko bura na do, kyunke un ka aalim zameen ko ilm se bhar dega Aey Allah, Tu ne mein se pahalo ko azab — ya museebat — cakhaayaa, to mein se pichalo ko Fazl chakha"
"308","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jaafar ne ham se bayan kiya, an-Nazr bin Humaid se, al-Jarud se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khoon bahane wale ke ke bazu tumhen mutaassira na karen, kyunke Allah ke paas us ka ek qatil hai jo marta nahin; aur woh aadmi tumhen mutaassira na kare Jis ne haram se maal kiya, kyunke agar woh use kharch kare ya Sadqa kare to us se qabool nahin hoga, aur agar woh use chhore to us mein us ke liye barkat nahin hogi, aur agar us mein se kuch bache to woh aag ki taraf us ka Tosha hoga"
"309","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin al-aqamara se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat nahin pahunchegi magar badtareen logon par"
"310","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-hajarii se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah tumhen maal de to woh tum par lage; faalatuu se do, un se shuru karo jin ki parwarish karte ho, aur kifayat par tumhen malamat nahin hath teen hain: Allah Ta'ala ka hath sab buland hai, dene wale ka hath jo us ke baad hai, aur mangne wale ka hath jo qayamat tak sab neeche hai aur Shu'bah ke siwa doosre ne Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan kiya"
"311","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin al-aqamara se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jo kal Allah Ta'ala se Musalman kar milanaa chahe woh in paanch namazon ki hifazat kare jahan un ke liye azan di jae, kyunke Allah ne tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye hidayat ke raste muqarrar kiye hain, aur woh hidayat ke majlison mein se hain main nahin samajhta tum mein se koi magar us ke ghar mein ek masjid hai jis mein woh namaz padhta hai; lekin agar tum apne gharon mein namaz padho aur apni masajid chhod do to Tum ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat chhod di, aur agar Tum ne apne Nabi ki sunnat chhodi to gumrah ho jaaoge. koi Musalman nahin jo achchi tarah wuzu kare, phir namaz ki taraf chale, magar us ke har qadam par us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai, woh us se ek darja buland kiya jata hai, aur us se ek gunah mitaayaa jata hai, yahan tak ke ham apne qadam chhote karte the Main ne hamen dekha hai, aur us se koi peeche na rehta tha siwae munafiq ke jis ka nifaq ma'loom tha; Main ne ek aadmi ko bhi dekha jise do aadmiyon ke darmiyan sahara diya jata yahan tak ke use saf mein khada kiya jata"
"312","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail bin Raja se, Abdullah Ibn Abi al-Hudhail se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar main koi Khaleel banata to Abu Bakr ko Khaleel banata; lekin woh mere bhai aur mere sathi hain, aur tumhare sathi Allah ke Khaleel hain"
"313","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud Ibn Abi al-furaata ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Zaid se, Abu al-aayana se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo saanp maare, jaise Us ne kafir mara"
"314","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu al-Ahwas se, bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne irada kiya ke ek aadmi ko hukm dun ke logon ko namaz parhe, phir un logon ke par peeche rahun jo Jume ki namaz se peeche rehte hain aur un ke ghar un par jala dun"
"315","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe karna sikhaya: Beshak main rizq dene wala hun, quwwat wala, zabaradasta."
"316","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umarah bin Umair, ya doosre ko, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hajj kiya, aur Aap ne Mina mein do rak'at padhin; aur Abu Bakr ke sath, aur Unhon ne Mina mein do rak'at padhin; aur Umar ke sath, aur Unhon ne do rak'at padhin kaash chaar rak'aton mein se mera hissa do qubuulashudaa hota"
"317","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Ibrahim se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, ke Unhon ne Abdullah ke sath Hajj kiya aur jamre ko saat kankriyon se marne ki, Baitullah ko apne baayen aur Mina ko apne daayen rakhte hue, aur kaha: Yeh us ka thehrne ka maqam hai jis par Surah-Baqarah nazil hui"
"318","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, wasallam bin Shaddad se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ek muhim mein the jis mein Abdur Rahman bin Yazid hazir the, aur logon mein khul gaya ke kuch Surah-Baqarah aur Aal-Imran kehna napasand karte the, is par isaraara karte hue ke kahen: Woh surat jis mein gae ka zikr hai, aur woh surat jis mein Aal-Imran ka zikr hai Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Main Mina mein Abdullah ke sath tha jab woh wadi ke neeche gae, jamre ko apni dayan bhaunha ki taraf rakha, phir Kaabe ki taraf munh kiya aur use saat kankriyon se marne ki, har kankari par Allah ki takbir kehte hue jab farigh hue to kaha: Yahan se — us zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin — Us ne marne ki jis par Surah-Baqarah nazil hui"
"319","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne Muzdalifah mein Fajr ki namaz Fajr se pahle andhere mein padhi, aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is namaz ko is waqt is jagah ke siwa nahin padhte the"
"320","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Hakim bin Jubair se, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kifayat rakhte hue mange woh qayamat ke din apne chehre par kharoncon ya kataavon ke sath jayega kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, use Kya kafi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Pachaas dirham ya sone mein us ki qiimata."
"321","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, Allah Ta'ala ke qaul {dil ne jhoot nahin kaha jo Us ne dekha} ke bare mein, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Jibreel ko sabz qiimakhvaaba ke kapde mein dekha jo aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan ko phaad hue the"
"322","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne mujhe khabar di, Amr bin Maimun se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek gunbada mein the, ham mein se chalis ke qareeb, aur Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum is par razi ho ke jannat walon ka chauthai ho? Unhon ne kaha: Han Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum is par razi ho ke jannat walon ka tihai ho? Aap ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, mujhe ummeed hai tum jannat walon ke aadhe hoge; aur yeh liye kyunke jannat mein koi dakhil nahin hoga siwae Musalman jaan ke, aur tum mushrikon mein yahi aise ho jaise siyahi baila ki khaal par safed baal, ya surkh baila ki khaal par kala baala."
"323","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Maimun ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sajde mein the aur Quraish ke log Aap irda-gird the, aur qareeb mein oont ki ojharii thi, unhon ne kaha: Is zabah kiye oont — ya oont — ki ojharii kaun milayega aur Nabi ki peeth par phenkegaa? To Uqbah Ibn Abi muaita aaya aur use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki peeth par phenkta phir Fatimah aaeen aur use Aap peeth se liya aur Jis ne aisa kiya us ke par dua ki Abdullah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ke par dua karte kabhi nahin dekha siwae us din ke, jab Aap ne farmaya: Aey Allah, tum par Quraish ke sardar hain; Aey Allah, tum par Abu jahala bin Hisham, Utbah bin Rabi'ah, Shaibah bin Rabi'ah, Uqbah Ibn Abi muaita aur Umayyah bin khalafa hain — ya Ubayy bin khalafa — Shu'bah ko shak hua Abdullah ne kaha: Main ne unhen Badr ke din maqtool dekha aur kuen mein phenka gaya — ya unhon ne kaha: Gaddhe mein — siwae is ke ke Ubayy bin khalafa — ya Umayyah bin khalafa — khilaya aadmi tha, to gaddhe tak dene se pahle bikhar gaya"
"324","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muslim al-baatina ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Maimun se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek saal Abdullah bin Mas'ud ke paas aata-jata raha, kabhi unhen yeh kehte na suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, siwae is ke ke ek din ek riwayat aai aur unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya — phir ghabrahat ne unhen gher liya aur aankhon se pasiinaa beh laga — phir unhon ne kaha: Us se upar kuch, ya us se neeche kuch, ya us ke qareeb kucha."
"325","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Amr bin Maimun se, Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) teen martaba dua karte aur teen martaba bakhshish mangte the"
"326","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Waki ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Amr bin Maimun se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Badr ke din main Abu jahala ke paas aaya jabke woh gira hua tha; Main ne use apni talwar se mara lekin kuch na hua, aur us ki talwar giri, to Main ne use dobara mara phir main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas garmi din mein aaya jaise zameen se uthaya gaya hun, aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ka yeh dushman, Abu jahala, qatl kiya gaya hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, Kya woh waqaee qatl kiya gaya hai? Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh waqaee qatl kiya gaya hai to hamare sath chalo aur Ham ne unhen woh dikhaayaa; woh us ke paas aae, use dekha, aur farmaya: Yeh is ummat ka Firaun tha"
"327","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Amr bin hai se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abdullah se, ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se Lailatul-Qadr ke bare mein poocha Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun caandanii raaton wali raat ko yaad karta hai? Abdullah ne kaha: Main, Allah ki qasam — mere walidah-baap fida — use yaad karta hun; mere hath mein kuch khajur thin jise main sahar kar raha tha, apni kajave ki peeth se Fajr se pahunchne mein, aur woh waqt tha jab chand nikal raha tha"
"328","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi gadhon par sawari karte the, oon pehente the, aur bakriyan dohte the; aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka ek gadha tha jis ka naam ufaira tha"
"329","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ubaidah ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) pehli do rak'aton mein jaise garmi patthron par the; unhon ne kaha: Woh apne honth kisi cheez se hilate the, to main kehta hun: Yahan tak ke woh khade hon, aur woh kehte hain: Yahan tak ke woh khade hon"
"330","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ubaid bin Nistas se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum mein se ek janaze ke peeche chale to janaze ke chaaron kinare pakde, phir baad mein nafl kare ya chhore, kyunke yeh sunnat mein se hai"
"331","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu az-Zubair se, Nafi' bin Jubair se, Abu Ubaidah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Mushrikon ne hamen Zuhr, Asr, Maghrib aur Isha ki namazon se ghafil rakha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal ko hukm diya, Unhon ne azan aur iqamat kahi, aur Ham ne Zuhr padhi; phir Unhon ne iqamat kahi aur Ham ne Asr padhi; phir Unhon ne iqamat kahi aur Ham ne Maghrib padhi; phir Unhon ne iqamat kahi aur Ham ne Isha padhi phir Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare siwa zameen par koi jama'at nahin jo Allah Ta'ala ko yaad karti ho"
"332","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hudaij bin Mu'awiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Quran ko taza karna chahe jaisa woh nazil hua, woh use bin Umm Abd ki qiraat par padhe"
"333","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Zameen walon par raham karo, aur jo aasman mein hai woh tum par raham karega"
"334","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan bin Sa'd se, Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek safar mein the jab ek aadmi jhaadi mein dakhil hua aur lauwa ka anda nikaalaa. lauwa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap sahaba ke sar par fadfadata aaya, aur Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se Kis ne Ise be-aulad kiya? Logon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Main ne us ka anda liya Aap ne farmaya: Laotao, laotao, us par raham karte hue"
"335","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak bin Harb ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Mas'ud ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Tum paoge, tumhari madad ki jaegi, aur tumhare liye futoohat khole jati; tum mein se jo use pae, woh Allah se dare, neki ka hukm de, aur burayi se roke."
"336","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ubaidah bin Abdullah ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen hajat ka khutba sikhaya: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai — ya: Tareef Allah ke liye hai — ham us ki madad mangte hain aur us ki bakhshish mangte hain, aur ham apne nafson ki buraiyon se Allah ki panah mangte hain jise Allah hidayat de, koi use gumrah nahin kar sakta; aur jise woh gumrah kare, koi use hidayat nahin de sakta main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasulullah hain phir woh teen aayaat padhte the: {Aey iman walon, Allah se daro jaisa us se darne ka haq hai} aayat ke anta tak, aur padhte the: {Aey logo, apne Rabb se daro Jis ne tumhen ek jaan se paida kiya} aayat, phir padhte the: {Aey iman walon, Allah se daro aur seedhi baat kaho; woh tumhare amal sanvaara dega} aayat ke anta tak phir apni hajat kaho Shu'bah ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ishaq se kaha: Kya yeh nikah ke khutbe mein hai ya doosre mein? Unhon ne kaha: Har hajat mein"
"337","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ubaidah ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kasrat kehte the: Pak hai Tu, hamare Rabb, aur Teri tareef ke sath; Aey Allah, mujhe muaf karo jab {jab Allah ki madad aur fath aae} aur {to apne Rabb ki tareef ke sath tasbih kar aur us se bakhshish mang; Beshak woh Tauba qabool karne wala hai} nazil huin, to Aap ne farmaya: Pak hai Tu aur Teri tareef ke sath; Aey Allah, mujhe muaf kar; Beshak Tu Tauba qabool karne wala, raham karne wala hai"
"338","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ubaidah ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main ek raat namaz padh raha tha, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar mere paas se guzre, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mango, tumhen diya jayega Umar ne kaha: To Abu Bakr aur main daud; Main ne Abu Bakr se kisi neki mein daud nahin lagai magar paya ke woh mujh se pahle us tak pahunche phir main nikla aur kaha: Meri ek dua hai jise main shayad hi kabhi deta hun: Aey Allah, main tujh se aisa iman mangta hun jo aae nahin, aankh ki thandak jo khatm na ho — ya unhon ne kaha: Jo fanaa na ho — aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki rifaqat hamesha ke sab uunce bagh mein"
"339","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, unhon ne kaha: Main Jume ko Kufa ki masjid mein dakhil hua aur wahan ek aadmi tha jis ke irda-gird log jama the; agar woh use apne peton mein le rakhte to le lete, us se apni muhabbat ki wajah se; aur woh bayan kar rahe the unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne kaha: Shahadat ke bare mein kasrat na kaho: Falan shaheed qatl kiya gaya, aur falan shaheed qatl kiya gaya; lekin agar tumhen kisi qaum ki tareef kare ho ke woh shaheed hue, to us dastay ki tareef karo jise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek qabeela ki taraf bheja, aur thodi hi muddat guzar thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan khade hue aur farmaya: Beshak tumhare bhai apne Rabb se mile hain; aur Unhon ne Allah Ta'ala se manga ke un ki taraf se pahunchi de ke woh razi hain aur woh un se razi hai to agar tum kisi qaum ki tareef karo ke woh shaheed hain, to un ki tareef karo unhon ne kaha: Aur woh aadmi Abu Ubaidah the"
"340","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo mere bare mein jaan jhoot bole, woh aag mein apni jagah bana le"
"341","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah ko, un ke walid se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sood khane wale, khilane wale aur us ke do gawahon par lanat ki — ya unhon ne kaha: Aur us ke gawah aur us ke munshii par"
"342","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Amr bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Us ki misaal jo haq mein apni qaum ki madad kare us oont jaisi hai jo gaddhe mein gira ho aur gunah se ghasiitaa jae Amr bin Sabit ne Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan kiya, jabke Shu'bah ne marfu' bayan nahin kiya"
"343","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan bin Sa'd se, Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek jagah thehre aur apni hajat ke liye gae; jab aae to ek aadmi ne cheentiyon ki basti ko aag lagai thi, ya to darakht mein ya zameen par Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh Kis ne kiya? Logon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Main ne kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bujhao, bujhao"
"344","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hudaij bin Mu'awiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdullah bin Utbah se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Najashi ke paas bheja, assi aadmi, hamare sath Jaafar Ibn Abi Talib aur Usman bin mazauuna. Quraish ne Umarah aur Amr bin al-Aas ko bheja, aur un ke sath Najashi ke liye hadiya bheja jab woh us ke paas dakhil hue to use sajdah kiya aur hadiya diya, kehte hue: Hamare qabeela ke kuch log hamare deen se phir gae hain aur tumhari zameen mein thehre hain us ne kaha: Woh kahan hain? Unhon ne kaha: Woh tumhari zameen mein hain, to Najashi ne unhen bulavaayaa. Jaafar ne kaha: Main aaj tumhara tarajumaana hun, to woh un ke peeche chale yahan tak ke Najashi ke paas dakhil hue, lekin use sajdah na kiya us ne kaha: Tum Badshah ko sajdah kyun nahin karte? Unhon ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala ne hamen apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bheje, jinhon hamen hukm diya ke Allah ke siwa kisi ko sajdah na karen Najashi ne kaha: Woh Kya hai? To use khabar di gayi, aur Amr bin al-Aas ne kaha: Woh Isa ke bare mein tum ikhtilaf karte hain us ne kaha: Tum Isa aur un ki walidah ke bare mein Kya kehte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ham kehte hain jaisa Allah Ta'ala ne kaha: Woh Allah ki rooh aur us ka kalima hai, jise Us ne pak kunwari ki taraf dala jise kisi aadmi ne na chhua aur jis ki taraf kisi bachche ko marfooan na kiya gaya to Najashi ne ek lakdi li aur kaha: Aey paadariyon aur rahibon ki jama'at, tum Aap kahe se is ke wazan bhar bhi aage nahin khushaaamadiida tum ko aur use jis ki taraf se tum aae ho; main gawahi deta hun ke woh Nabi hain main chahun ke un ke sath houun aur un ki jootiyan uthaaun — ya unhon ne kaha: Un ki paas karun meri zameen mein jahan chaho raho phir bin Mas'ud jaldi aae aur Badr mein hazir hue"
"345","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Aun bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, un ke walid se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the jab Aap muskuraae. ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap kis par muskuraye? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe mu'min aur beemari se us ki takleef par ta'ajjub hai; agar woh janta ke beemari mein Kya hai to beemar rehna pasand karta yahan tak ke Allah Ta'ala se mile"
"346","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Aun bin Abdullah se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni nazar aasman ki taraf uthai phir musafir ki ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne aisa kyun kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe do farishton par ta'ajjub hai jo zameen par utre ek bande ko us ke namaz ki jagah mein talash karte hue lekin use na paya; phir apne Rabb ki taraf chadhe aur kaha: Aey Rabb, ham Tere mu'min bande ke liye us ke din aur raat mein aisi-aisi nekiyan likhte the, lekin Ham ne paya ke Tu ne use apne jaal mein rok rakha hai, to Ham ne us ke liye kuch na likha Us ne farmaya: Mere bande ke liye us ke din aur raat mein us ka amal likho, aur us mein se kuch kam na karo; mujh par hai us ka ajr jis ka Main ne use roka, aur us ke liye hai us ka ajr jo woh karta tha"
"347","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Yazid al-Huzali se, Aun bin Abdullah se, bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ruku mein teen martaba kahe: Apne Parwardigar, azeem ki paki, us ka ruku kamil hai, aur yahi us ka kam se kam hai; aur jo apne sajde mein teen martaba kahe: Apne Parwardigar, buland ki paki, us ka sajdah kamil hai, aur yahi us ka kam se kam hai"
"348","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman at-Taimi se, Abu Usman an-Nahdi se, bin Mas'ud se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bilal ki azan tumhen tumhari sahar ke bare mein dhoka na de, kyunke woh azan sirf liye kehte hain taake tumhara jaagane wala aae aur tumhara sone wala jage; na yeh Fajr jo aisi hai — ya'ni phailane wali — lekin woh Fajr jo aisi hai — ya'ni lanbii."
"349","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah aur Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, Abu Usman se, bin Mas'ud se — Abu Awanah ne Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan kiya, jabke Sabit ne marfu' bayan nahin kiya — ke Unhon ne ek dehati ko chadar pahne dekha jise Us ne latkayein tha, jabke woh namaz padh raha tha, aur us se kaha: Jo namaz mein takabbur se apna kapda ghaseete Allah ke paas us ka kuch nahin, na halal na haraama."
"350","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin bahadalaa se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hajj ke mausima mein Hajj mujhe dikhai gayin, aur Main ne apni ummat ko maidan aur pahaad raha dekha; un ki kasrat aur soorat ne mujhe khush kiya mujh se kaha gaya: Kya tum razi ho? Main ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap sath sattar hazaar hain jo baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge, jo khujate nahin lagate, shaguna nahin lete, dam nahin mangte, aur apne Rabb par bharosa karte hain phir ukkaashaa bin Mihsan al-Asadi khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah se dua karen ke mujhe mein kare Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, use mein karo phir doosra khada hua aur kaha: Allah Ta'ala se dua karen ke mujhe mein kare Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ukkaashaa is mein tum aage gaya"
"351","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek jawan ladka tha Makkah mein Uqbah Ibn Abi muaita ki bakriyan charata hua jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr mere paas aae, mushrikon se bhaagakara. Aap ne farmaya: Aey ladke, Kya tumhare paas doodh hai jo hamen pilao? Main ne kaha: Main ameen hun aur tumhen nahin pilaauungaa. unhon ne kaha: Kya tumhare paas ek jawan bakri hai jis par narr abhi na chadha ho? Main ne kaha: Haan, to main use un ke paas laya; Abu Bakr ne use pakda, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne than pakda, dua ki, aur than bhar gaya; Abu Bakr Aap paas khokhalaa pathar jane, aur Aap ne us mein Duha, phir Aap ne aur Abu Bakr ne piya, phir mujhe pilaya phir Aap ne than se kaha: Peeche ja, aur woh peeche gaya baad mein main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe is achchi baat mein se sikhao — ya'ni quraaana. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum sikhaya hua ladke ho to Main ne un ke munh se sattar suraten li, mein koi mujh se jhagda nahin karta"
"352","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin bahadalaa se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Badr ke din ham ek oont par do the aur ek oont par teen; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sawari sathi Ali aur Abu lubaabaa al-Ansari the jab un ke paidal chalne ki bari aai to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, sawar hon aur ham Aap liye paidal hain Aap ne farmaya: Tum donon paidal chalne mein mujh se zyada qawi nahin, na main tum ajr ka zyada khvaahishamanda hone mein kam hun"
"353","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, Abdullah se, ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye araak se miswak katwae the jabke hawa unhen jhulaatii thi, aur un ki taang mein dubalaapana tha; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba hanse, aur Aap ne farmaya: Tumhen Kya hansaataa hai? Unhon ne kaha: Un ki taang ke dubalepana par Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, woh miizaana mein Uhud se bhaari hai"
"354","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, Isa bin Asim se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Shaguna le shirk hai; aur ham mein se koi nahin magar Allah use tawakkul se door karta hai"
"355","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin bahadalaa se, riwayat se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Suffah walon mein se ek aadmi mara, aur Unhon ne us ki chadar mein do dinar pae Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do daagha."
"356","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman ash-Shaibani se, unhon ne kaha: Riwayat bin Hubaish hamare paas se guzre, to main un ke samne khada hua aur un se Allah Ta'ala ke qaul {shak Us ne apne Rabb ki bade nishaniyon mein se dekha} ke bare mein poocha riwayat ne kaha: Abdullah ne kaha: Unhon ne Jibreel ko un ki surat mein dekha, chhe sau paron len"
"357","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kabhi Jume ko roza todte nahin dekha"
"358","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, Abdullah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har mahine ke shuru se teen din roza rakhte the"
"359","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim ne ham se bayan kiya, riwayat se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap apni ummat ke un logon ko kaise pahacaanenge jinhein Aap ne qayamat ke din nahin dekha? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chamakdar, safed wasallam wale, wuzu ke wasallam se citakabare."
"360","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo mere bare mein jaan jhoot bole, woh aag mein apni jagah bana le"
"361","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Mujahid se, Abu Ma'mar al-Azdi se, bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Kuch log masjid mein baithe — do Quraishi aur ek Saqafi, ya do Saqafi aur ek Quraishi — aur mein se ek ne kaha: Kya tum samajhte ho Allah sunta hai jo ham kehte hain? Mein se ek ne kaha: Jab ham apni aawazein buland karte hain woh sunta hai, aur jab ham buland nahin karte woh nahin sunta doosre ne kaha: Agar woh us mein se kuch sunta hai to woh sab sunta hai to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya, aur Allah Ta'ala ne nazil kiya: {Tum chipate na the ke tumhari sunne ki taqat tumhare par gawahi de} aayat"
"362","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Mujahid se, Abu Ma'mar se, ke Makkah walon ke ek imam ne do salam phere, to Abdullah ne kaha: Us ne yeh kaise seekha? Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe khabar gaya ke Abu Dawud ke siwa doosre ne kaha: Shu'bah se, Abdullah ne kaha: Us ne yeh kaise seekha? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisa karte the"
"363","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansoor ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Khaithamah bin Abdur Rahman ko Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, Aap ne farmaya: Namaz ke baad jaagane mein koi bhalai nahin siwae do aadmiyon mein se ek ke: Musafir ya namaz padhne chhae"
"364","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, bayan se, Murrah se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Unhon ne hamen darmiyan wali namaz, Asr ki namaz se ghafil rakha; Allah un ke gharon aur qabron ko aag se bhar de"
"365","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Murrah ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Sab sachchi baat Allah ki Kitab hai, sab behtareen hidayat Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hidayat hai, sab bure mamle nae ijaad kiye hue hain; jis ka tum wa'da kiya gaya hai woh aane wala hai, tum us se gunjaish nahin rakhte, aur sirf Wahy door hai jo aane wala nahin Amr ne kaha: Yeh kalima (aur sirf Wahy door hai jo aane wala nahin), Murrah ne mujhe Abdullah se bayan kiya, ya ek aadmi ne Abdullah se"
"366","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Muslim se, Tariq bin Shihab se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne koi beemari nahin utari magar us ki shifa utari, siwae budhape ke; to gae ka doodh piyo, kyunke woh har darakht se caratii hai"
"367","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Muslim se, Tariq bin Shihab se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Rashk sirf do mein hai: Ek aadmi jise Allah ne maal diya aur use haq mein kharch karne ki taqat di, aur ek aadmi jise Allah Ta'ala ne hikmat aur ilm diya, to woh us se faisla karta hai aur logon ko sikhaataa hai"
"368","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin khaazima ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim at-Taimi se, al-Haris bin Suwaid se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua jabke Aap bukhar tha; Main ne Aap chhua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap sakht bukhar hai Aap ne farmaya: Haan, mujhe tum mein se do aadmiyon jaisa bukhar hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya yeh liye ke Aap dogunaa ajr hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan; us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, koi Musalman takleef, beemari ya doosre se mubtala nahin hota magar Allah Ta'ala us ke gunah us se door karta hai jaise darakht apne patte giraataa hai"
"369","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abu Abdur Rahman se, bin Mas'ud se, ke woh namaz mein maraduuda shaitan se, us ki phoonk, thook aur vasavase se panah mangte the Abu Dawud ne Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan nahin kiya, jabke doosron ne marfu' bayan kiya"
"370","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Waleed bin al-aizaara ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Amr ash-Shaibani se poocha, unhon ne kaha: Is ghar wale ne ham se bayan kiya — Abdullah ke ghar ki taraf ishara karte hue — unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kaun-sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Waqt par namaz main ne kaha: Phir kaun-sa — ya unhon ne kaha: Phir Kya? Abu Dawud ko shak hua — Aap ne farmaya: Phir walidah-baap se nekii. main ne kaha: Phir Kya — ya phir kaun-sa? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke raste mein jihaada. Unhon ne mujhe yeh bayan kiye, aur agar main zyada mangta to woh barhaate."
"371","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ne mujhe khabar di, Ausaja se, Ibn Abi al-Hudhail se, bin Mas'ud se, jo salam pherte waqt kehte the: Aey Allah, Tu salam hai, aur tujh se salamti hai; barkat wala hai Tu, Aey jalal aur izzat len Shu'bah ne Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan nahin kiya, jabke doosron ne marfu' bayan kiya"
"372","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Ausaja se, Ibn Abi al-Hudhail se, Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni dua mein se kuch mein kehte the: Aey Allah, jaisa Tu ne meri akhlaq achchi ki, mere akhlaq husn karo is tarah Abu Dawud ne bayan kiya; muhaadira ne kaha: Asim se, Ausaja se, Ibn Abi al-Hudhail se, Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"373","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Hudhail ko suna: Ek aadmi Abu Musa ke paas aaya aur un se ek aadmi ke bare mein poocha Jis ne apni beti, apne bete ki beti aur apni bahan chorii. unhon ne kaha: Beti ke liye aadha hai, bahan ke liye aadha hai, aur Abdullah ke paas jao; woh meri pairwi karega to woh Abdullah ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr un se kiya, aur unhon ne kaha: Waqt main gumrah hota aur hidayat walon mein na hota; main is mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se faisla karunga: Beti ke liye aadha hai, bete ki beti ke liye chhata hai, aur bahan ke liye bacha hua hai to woh Abu Musa ke paas aaya aur unhen khabar di, aur unhon ne kaha: Hamen kisi cheez ke bare mein na poocho jabke yeh aalim tumhare darmiyan hai"
"374","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Hudhail ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the; Aap ne Zuhr der ki aur Asr jaldi, donon ko jama karte hue, aur Maghrib der ki aur Isha jaldi, donon ko jama karte hue Shu'bah ne is mein nahin kaha: Abdullah se unhon ne kaha: Aur Ibn Abi Laila se riwayat aai ke Unhon ne Ise Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mausul bayan kiya"
"375","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, wasallam bin Shaddad se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Alqamah al-qari se — Bani qaaraa mein se — Abdullah bin Mas'ud se — unhon ne kaha: Aur al-Mas'udi ki riwayat behtar hai — unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah se lautte hue the, aur Ham ne par diya Aap ne farmaya: Hamari namaz ke liye hamari hifazat kaun karega? — Shu'bah ne kaha: Hamari nigaraanii kaun karega? — Bilal ne kaha: Main karunga al-Mas'udi ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Tum so jaaoge. Aap ne farmaya: Hamari namaz ke liye hamari hifazat kaun karega? bin Mas'ud ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main karunga Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum so jaaoge. unhon ne kaha: To Main ne un ki hifazat ki yahan tak ke jab Fajr qareeb hui, jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha tha woh mujh par ghalib aaya aur main so gaya ham sirf suraj par jaage Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur woh kiya jo woh karte the, phir farmaya: Agar Allah Ta'ala chahta ke tum us se na sote to tum na sote; lekin Us ne chaha ke woh tumhare baad walon ke liye ho — to yeh aise hi hai jo tum mein se soe ya bhool Shu'bah ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Aisa karo, jo tum mein se soe ya bhool al-Mas'udi ne apni riwayat mein kaha — aur yeh Shu'bah ki riwayat mein nahin hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sawari gum ho gayi thi, to Ham ne use talash kiya aur use ek darakht ke paas paya jis ki Langoat darakht mein atki thi main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hath use kabhi na kholate."
"376","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: As-saaqa bin Hazn ne ham se bayan kiya, Aqeel al-jaadii se, Abu Ishaq se, Suwaid bin ghafalaa se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Abdullah, Kya tum jante ho Islam ki kaun-si halqa sab mazboot hai? Main ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke liye vafaadaarii, Allah ke liye muhabbat, aur Allah ke liye nafarata. Aey Abdullah, Kya tum jante ho kaun-se log sab zyada janne wale hain? Main ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain Aap ne farmaya: Logon mein sab zyada janne wala mein haq ka sab zyada janne wala hai jab log ikhtilaf karen, chahe woh ilm mein kam ho aur chahe woh apne pichavaare par renge."
"377","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shimra bin Atiyyah al-Asadi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Mughirah bin Sa'd bin al-akharama at-Taayi ko, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zamiindaariyaan na lo, kahin tum duniya ke khvaahishamanda na ho jao Abdullah ne kaha: Baraazaana, baraazaana Kya hai; aur Madinah, Madinah Kya hai"
"378","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne shimra bin Atiyyah al-Asadi ko tayya ke ek aadmi se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi jaisi riwayat karte suna"
"379","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Jamrah ne mujhe khabar di, tayya ke ek aadmi se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne jama karne se mana farmaya — ya'ni maal aur aulaad ki kasarata."
"380","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair bin Mu'awiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Karim al-jazarii se, Ziyad se — Ibn Abi Maryam nahin — Abdullah bin Ma'qil se, unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke sath un ke paas Abdullah bin Mas'ud ke yahan tha, aur mere walid ne un se kaha: Kya Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Pachataavaa Tauba hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko suna"
"381","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Hubairah bin yariima se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jo kahin ke paas aae aur us ki kahi baat par iman jane Us ne us ka inkar kiya jo Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil hua"
"382","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, wasallam bin Shaddad se, al-Aswad bin Hilal se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne kaha: Najuumii ghair-Arabon ke kahin hain; jo kahin par iman jane Us ne us ka inkar kiya jo Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil hua"
"383","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, al-Bara bin main al-kaahilii se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam ki chakki paintis, chhattis ya saintiisa saal ghuumegii; agar woh halaak hue to halaak hone walon ka rasta hai, aur agar un ka deen un ke liye qayam raha to sattar saal qayam jata Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, guzre hue ke sath ya bache hue ke sath? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bache hue ke sath"
"384","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Zarr se, Wa'il bin muhaanaa se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne aurton se farmaya: Sadqa do, kyunke tum jahannam walon mein kasrat ho ek aurat jo naamavara aurton mein se na thi, ya mein sab samajhadaaron mein se, ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kahan — ya kis liye, ya kyun? Aap ne farmaya: Kyunke tum bahut lanat karti ho aur shauhar ki kufr karti ho"
"385","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, jinhon Abdullah bin Salamah ko suna, jinhon Abdullah bin Mas'ud ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh un se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, pachaas se zyada martaba unhon ne kaha: Tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghaib ki kunjiyaan di gayin siwae paanch ke: {Beshak Allah, usi ke paas qayamat ka ilm hai} surat ke anta tak"
"386","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Ibn Abi Ziyad se, Abu Sa'd al-Azdi se, Abu al-kanuuda se, Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sone ki anguthiyon, ya sone ke halaqon se mana farmaya"
"387","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Malik bin Maisarah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-nazzaala bin Sabrah ko Abdullah bin Mas'ud se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek aayat padhi, aur ek aadmi ne us ke par padha, to ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya Shu'bah ne kaha: Mere behtareen ilm ke dakhil Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ikhtilaf na karo, kyunke tum pahle walon ne ikhtilaf kiya aur halaak hue Shu'bah ko shak hua: Ikhtilaf na karo ke bare mein; baqi durust hai"
"388","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Sa'd bin Iyadh se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sab pasandeeda gosht agli dasta tha, bakri ka agli dasta; aur us mein zehr karaya gaya tha, aur Unhon ne samjha ke Yahud ne unhen zehr diya tha"
"389","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Salamah bin Kuhail ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu az-zaaraa se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Phir Allah Ta'ala shafa'at ki ijazat dega; Roohul-qudusa, Jibreel khade honge, phir Ibrahim, Allah ke Khaleel khade honge, phir Isa ya Musa khade honge — Abu az-zaaraa ne kaha: Mujhe nahin ma'loom mein se mard unhon ne kaha — phir tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chauthe khade honge aur shafa'at karenge; un ke baad koi us se zyada ki shafa'at nahin karega jitni woh shafa'at karenge Wahy Maqam-Mahmud hai jis ka Allah Ta'ala ne zikr kiya: {Taake tumhara Rabb tumhen Maqam-Mahmud tak uthae}."
"390","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Malik bin Umair ne ham se bayan kiya, al-urayaana bin al-Haisam an-nakhaii se, Qabeesah bin Jabir al-Asadi se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bhaunhen ukhaarane wali, aankhon ke darmiyan se banane wali, aur godne wali aurton par lanat karte suna, jo Allah ki paida badalatii hain"
"391","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, vabaraa se, Hammam bin al-Haris se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne kaha: Jume ko ghusl karna sunnat mein se hai"
"392","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah, mahadii bin Maimun aur bin Fuzalah — sab ne — ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal se, Abu Qatadah al-Adawi se, usaira bin Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abdullah bin Mas'ud ke sath baithe the jab surkh hawa chali, aur ek aadmi aaya jis ka ek hi takiya-kalaam tha us ka kehna: Aey Abdullah, qayamat aa gayi; Aey Abu Abdur Rahman, qayamat aa gayi woh seedhe baithe, chehre par gussa zahir — woh apne ek sofe par teke the — aur kaha: Qayamat nahin pahunchegi yahan tak ke na wirasat aadha jae na ghanimat par khushi manaaii jae phir kaha: Musalmanon ka ek dushman un ke par jama hoga — aur Unhon ne apne hath se ishara kiya unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Qatadah se kaha: Sham, tumhara matlab hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Aur us pada mein sakht iratidaada hoga unhon ne kaha: Musalman ek-doosre ko mazboot karenge, milenge aur sakht pada larenge. unhon ne kaha: Phir ek dasta maut par bai'at karega aur fath ke siwa na lautegaa; woh milte hain aur ladte hain yahan tak ke raat unhen juda kare, aur donon taraf lautte hain, koi faateha nahin, aur dasta halaak hota hai doosre din doosra dasta maut par bai'at karega; woh milte hain aur ladte hain yahan tak ke raat unhen juda kare, aur donon taraf lautte hain, koi faateha nahin, aur dasta halaak hota hai teesre din doosra dasta maut par bai'at karega; woh milte hain aur ladte hain yahan tak ke raat unhen juda kare, aur donon taraf lautte hain, koi faateha nahin, aur dasta halaak hota hai chauthe din baqi Musalman un ke par uthenge, aur Allah Ta'ala unhen fath dega; ek baap ke bete, jo sau ke uska kare jate the, dekhenge — mein se koi nahin bachta siwae ek aadmi ke to kaun-si wirasat aadha jae, ya kaun-si ghanimat par khushi manaaii jae? Unhon ne kaha: Jabke woh aise honge, woh bade baat sunenge: Dajjal un ki aulaad aur gharwalon mein un ki jagah le chuka hai unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ka ameer ek jaasuusa bhejta, das sawar; main un ke naam, un ke baapon ke naam aur un ke ghodon ke rang janta hun; us din woh zameen par sab behtareen sawar hain, ya zameen par sab behtareen sawaron mein se"
"393","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Husain se, Abdul-a'la se, Kharijah bin as-Salt se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha jata tha: Qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke masajid guzaragaaha banai jaen, aadmi aadmi ko sirf jaan se salam kare, aadmi aur us ki biwi milne tijarat karen, aur aurton aur ghodon ke meher mehenge hon, phir saste hon aur qayamat tak phir kabhi mehenge na hon Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne kaha: Ham ne bin Mas'ud se jaisa kaha jata tha waisa kuch nahin suna siwae isake. as-Sauri ne yeh hadees Husain se, Abdul-a'la se, as-Salt se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah ke sath masjid mein dakhil hua; Unhon ne ruku kiya, aur ek aadmi un ke paas se guzra jabke woh ruku mein the aur unhen salam kiya Abdullah ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ne sach kaha jab farigh hue to kaha: Kaha jata tha"
"394","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek, Abu Awanah aur Shaiban — sab ne — ham se bayan kiya, Abu yaafuura se, Ibn Abi Aqrab se, unhon ne kaha: Ham bin Mas'ud ke paas aae aur unhen kehte suna: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ne sach kaha, Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ne sach kaha ham ne kaha: Aey Abu Abdur Rahman, yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lailatul-Qadr saat ke darmiyan mein hai; suraj baghair shuaaon ke nikalta hai to Main ne use dekha, aur woh waisa tha jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha tha"
"395","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, un se Jis ne unhen bayan kiya, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jootiyon aur chamde ke mouzon mein namaz padhte dekha"
"396","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, ar-rukaina bin ar-Rabi se, al-Qasim bin Hassan se, Abdur Rahman bin Harmalah se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) das cheezen napasand karte the: Aap — ya'ni khaluq khushbu — sone ki anguuthiyaan bandhna, muavvizaata ke siwa dam, pani ko us ki jagah se rokna, khubsurat ko us ki durust jagah ke bahar zahir karna, taaviiza baandhanaa, tehband latakaanaa, bachche ko bigaaranaa baghair use rokna, safed baal ranganaa, aur nard se maaranaa."
"397","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek azeem ne mujhe bayan kiya, hamare ek azeem se jise main nahin mila, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Mas'ud ke sath Khabbab ke paas dakhil hua, jinhein lagaye gaya tha Abdullah ne kaha: Kya tum nahin jante ke hamen is se mana kiya gaya tha aur yeh hamare liye napasand kiya gaya tha? Khabbab ne kaha: Takleef sakht thi, aur tabiibon ne kaha: Tumhara koi ilaj nahin siwae isake. Abdullah ne kaha: Main ne tumhen is ke liye kabhi nahin daraa."
"398","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Awanah, Shaiban aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya — sab ne — Jabir se, al-Qasim bin Abdur Rahman se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas qaidi jane gae aur Aap ek ghar ke sab faqiron ko ek sath dete, unhen juda karna napasand karte hue"
"399","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Qasim se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne gavarnarii ke kuch ghulam al-Ash'as bin Qais ko qarz par beche, phir unhen taqaaze ke liye bheja al-Ash'as ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe das hazaar mein becha, jabke Abdullah ne kaha: Main ne tumhen bees hazaar mein becha Abdullah ne kaha: Mere aur apne darmiyan ek aadmi cuno. al-Ash'as ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main zaroor cunuungaa; tum mere aur mere darmiyan ho Abdullah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main mere aur tumhare darmiyan us hukm se faisla karunga jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna: Jab donon bechne wale ikhtilaf karen aur un ke darmiyan koi istidlal na ho, to jaisa saaman wala kahe waisa hai, ya woh mansookh karen Hushaim Ise al-Qasim se, un ke walid se, Abdullah se riwayat karte hain"
"400","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran al-Qattan ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abd Rabbihi se, Abu Iyadh se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haqeer banayi jane wali nekiyon se bacho, kyunke woh aadmi par jama hoti hain yahan tak ke use halaak kar den Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke liye misaal di, jaise log jo banajara zameen mein thehre; logon ke khane ka waqt aaya, to ek aadmi lakdi lata aur doosra chhoti lakdi, yahan tak ke Unhon ne us ka kala dher jama kiya, phir aag jalaaii Jis ne us mein dali hui cheez pakaaii."
"401","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin khaazima ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Abdullah bin Murrah se, al-Haris al-aavara se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Sood khane wala, khilane wala, us ke do gawah, us ka munshii, godne wali aur khoobi ke liye godavaaii jane wali aurat, halala karne wala aur jis ke liye halala kiya jae, Sadqa rokne wala, aur hijrat ke baad dehati zindagi mein laut wala — qayamat ke din Muhammad ki zaban par lanat kiye gae hain"
"402","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan bin Sa'd se, abadaa an-Nahdi se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne koi hurmat haram nahin ki magar woh janta tha ke tum mein se ek use dekhega; Beshak main tumhari kamaren pakde hun ke tum aag mein na giro jaise patange gira hain"
"403","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul-Wahid bin Wasil ne ham se bayan kiya, Auf Ibn Abi Jamilah al-aaraabii se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Sulaiman bin Jabir se pahunchi, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ek aadmi hun jo uthaya jaega; to Quran seekho aur logon ko sikhao, Faraez seekho aur logon ko sikhao, aur ilm seekho aur logon ko sikhao, kyunke main uthaya jaunga; ilm ghategaa aur fitne zahir honge yahan tak ke do aadmi fareeze par ikhtilaf karenge aur koi na payenge jo un ke darmiyan faisla kare"
"404","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Imran bin Husain se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek raat the yahan tak ke Ham ne baat lambi ki, phir apne gharon ko aae; subah ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jaldi aae, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nabi apni nabiyon aur apni nabiyon mein se apne pairukaron ke sath mujhe dikhaye gae; ek Nabi guzarne us ke sath us ki ummat ke teen the, ek Nabi us ki ummat ke giroh ke sath, ek Nabi guzarne us ki ummat ke chand faqiron ke sath, ek Nabi guzarne us ki ummat ke ek aadmi ke sath, aur ek Nabi us ke sath us ki ummat ka koi na tha, yahan tak ke Musa bin Imran mere paas se gai-Isra'il ki bheed mein guzre jab Main ne unhen dekha to woh mujhe husn lage, to main ne kaha: Aey Rabb, yeh kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Yeh tumhara bhai Musa bin Imran hai aur gai-Isra'il mein se woh jo us ke peeche chale main ne kaha: Aey Rabb, meri ummat kahan hai? Us ne kaha: Apne daayen dekho Main ne dekha, aur teele — Makkah ke teele — aadmiyon ke chehron se phaad the main ne kaha: Aey Rabb, yeh kaun hain? Kaha gaya: Yeh tumhari ummat hain kaha gaya: Kya tum razi ho? Main ne kaha: Haan, main razi hun kaha gaya: Apne baayen dekho Main ne dekha, aur aasman aadmiyon ke chehron se bhara tha main ne kaha: Aey Rabb, yeh kaun hain? Kaha gaya: Yeh tumhari ummat hain kaha gaya: Kya tum razi ho? Main ne kaha: Haan, mere Rabb, main razi hun kaha gaya: Aap sath sattar hazaar hain jo baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge phir ukkaashaa bin Mihsan, Bani Asad ke bhai, ne shuru kiya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah se dua karen ke mujhe mein kare Aap ne farmaya: Aey Allah, use mein karo phir doosre aadmi ne shuru kiya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah se dua karen ke mujhe mein kare Aap ne farmaya: Ukkaashaa bin Mihsan is mein tum aage gaya unhon ne kaha: Aur hamen zikr kiya gaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere walidah-baap tum par fida; agar tum sattar mein ho rakhte ho to ho; agar naaqaabila ho aur kam raho to teelon walon mein ho; agar naaqaabila ho aur kam raho to aasman walon mein ho, kyunke Main ne wahan bahut log bheed karte dekhe unhon ne kaha: Aur hamen zikr kiya gaya ke kuch mu'min aadmiyon — ya mu'minon ke logon — ne apne mein guftagu ki, kehte hue: Tumhara Kya khayal hai yeh sattar hazaar kaun hain? Yahan tak ke Unhon ne apne muamle ka natiijaa nikali, kehte hue: Log jo Islam mein paida hue jo us par amal karte rahe yahan tak ke us par hue un ki baat Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunchee, jinhon farmaya: Jaisa tum samajhte ho waisa nahin; lekin woh hain jo khujate nahin lagate, dam nahin mangte, shaguna nahin lete, aur apne Rabb par bharosa karte hain aur hamen zikr kiya gaya ke Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai meri ummat ke jo meri pairwi karen woh jannat walon ka chauthai honge, to Ham ne Allah ki takbir kahi Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai woh aadhe honge unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne Allah ki takbir kahi unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne yeh aayat padhi: {Pahalon mein se ek giroh, aur pichhle mein se ek giroh}."
"405","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Khumair bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne bin Mas'ud ko kehte suna: Main apne Quran ke nuskhe ko chhupa raha hun; jo nuskhe chhupa sake woh kare, kyunke Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: {Jo chipaaegaa woh qayamat ke din woh pahunchayega jo Us ne chhipaya}. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se sattar suraten li, jabke Zaid bin Sabit bachchon mein ek ladka hi hai; Kya main woh chhod dun jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se liya?"
"406","[AI-translation] Huzaifah bin al-Yaman ki rivaayaten, Allah un par raham kare Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, jinhon Abu Wa'il ko suna, Huzaifah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kisi qaum ke kuda ke dher par aae aur khade kar peshab kiya, phir pani manga; main Aap paas pani laya aur Aap ne wuzu kiya aur apne chamde ke mouzon par masah kiya"
"407","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Huzaifah se kaha gaya: Abu Musa peshab ke bare mein sakht hain Abu Dawud ne kaha: Jarir ne is hadees mein kaha: Abu Musa shiishii mein peshab karte the aur peshab ke bare mein sakht the Huzaifah ne kaha: Kaash woh aisa na karte; main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha jab Aap kisi qaum ke kuda ke dher par aae aur khade kar peshab kiya"
"408","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, aur Hammad bin Salamah ne, Asim se — donon ne Abu Wa'il se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne kaha: Fitne ke bare mein hamen kaun bayan karega? Huzaifah ne kaha: Main karunga unhon ne kaha: Tum? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, aadmi ka apne ghar aur maal mein fitna roze, sadqe, neki ka hukm aur burayi se rokne se mitataa hai unhon ne kaha: Main tum is ke bare mein nahin poochta; main tum qayamat se pahle ke fitne ke bare mein poochta hun, samandar ki laharon ki tarah umarataa hua unhon ne kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, tumhare aur us ke darmiyan ek band darwaza hai Umar ne kaha: Mujhe darwaze ke bare mein batao — Kya woh toda jaega ya khola jaega? Unhon ne kaha: Lekin woh toda jayega Umar ne kaha: Phir woh qayamat tak kabhi band nahin hoga Abu Wa'il ne kaha: Ham ne Masrooq se kaha: Huzaifah se darwaze ke bare mein poocho, woh kaun hai Unhon ne un se poocha, aur unhon ne kaha: Darwaza Umar hain logon ne yeh hadees riwayat ki ke Umar ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki fitne ke bare mein hadees hamen kaun bayan karega?"
"409","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Husain se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Huzaifah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ki namaz ke liye khade hote to miswak se apna munh saaf karte the"
"410","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Abu Wa'il se, unhon ne kaha: Huzaifah ne kaha: Aaj ke munafiq Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zindagi se fajir hain; waqt woh use chhipate the, jabke aaj woh use zahir karte hain"
"411","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin bahadalaa se, riwayat bin Hubaish se, Huzaifah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas al-buraaqa laya gaya — gadhe se upar aur khaccara se neeche safed janwar — aur woh aur Jibreel us ki peeth se na utre yahan tak ke woh unhen baitul-Maqdis le aae; Jibreel un ke sath aasman chadhe, Jibreel ne khulavaayaa, aur unhen jannat aur jahannam dikhaaii. phir Unhon ne mujh se kaha: Kya Unhon ne baitul-Maqdis mein namaz padhi? Main ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Tumhara naam Kya hai, Aey ganje? Main tumhara chehra janta hun lekin tumhara naam nahin jaanta unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main riwayat bin Hubaish hun unhon ne kaha: Tum kahan pate ho ke Unhon ne namaz padhi? To Main ne aayat padhi: {Pak hai woh jo apne bande ko raat mein le gaya} aayat ke anta tak unhon ne kaha: Agar Unhon ne namaz padhi hoti to tum namaz padhte jaisa tum Masjid-haram mein namaz padhte ho unhon ne kaha: Main ne Huzaifah se kaha: Kya Unhon ne janwar ko us halqay se bandha jis se Nabi lagate the? Unhon ne kaha: Kya woh darte ke woh un se jaega jabke Allah use un ke paas laya tha?"
"412","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne sila bin zufara ko Huzaifah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Najaran ke log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Hamen ek ameen aadmi bhejo. Aap ne farmaya: Main tumhen sach mein ameen aadmi bhejuungaa, sach mein ameen, sach mein amaanatadaara. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ne us ki Khwahish ki unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Ubaidah bin al-Jarrah ko bheja"
"413","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne sila bin zufara ko Huzaifah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Islam aath hisse hai: Islam ek hissa hai, namaz ek hissa hai, zakat ek hissa hai, Hajj ek hissa hai, Ramazan ka roza ek hissa hai, neki ka hukm ek hissa hai, burayi se rokna ek hissa hai, aur Allah ke raste mein jihad ek hissa hai; aur jis ka koi hissa nahin woh nakam hua Unhon ne zikr kiya ke Shu'bah ke siwa doosre ne Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan kiya"
"414","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne sila bin zufara ko Huzaifah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Log ek maidan mein jama kiye jaenge aur koi jaan baat nahin karegi; sab pahle bulaye jaenge Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), jo kahenge: Hazir hun Teri paas mein aur Teri khushi mein; bhalai Tere hathon mein hai, aur burayi Teri taraf nahin; hidayat paya jis ko Tu ne hidayat di; Tera banda Tere samne; main Tere sath hun aur Teri taraf hun; barkat wala hai Tu, hamare Rabb, aur buland; pak hai Tu, ghar ke Rabb yahi Allah Ta'ala ka qaul hai: {Taake tumhara Rabb tumhen Maqam-Mahmud tak uthae}."
"415","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'd bin Ubaidah ko al-kar bin al-ahanafa se, sila bin zufara al-Absi se, Huzaifah se riwayat karte suna, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath raat mein namaz padhi; woh apne ruku mein kehte the: Apne Parwardigar, azeem ki paki, aur apne sajde mein kehte the: Apne Parwardigar, buland ki paki; aur woh rehmat ki kisi aayat par na aate magar theharti aur mangte, aur azab ki kisi aayat par na aate magar theharti aur panah mangte"
"416","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, jinhon Abu Hamzah ko Abs ke ek aadmi se riwayat karte suna — Shu'bah ne unhen sila bin zufara samjha — Huzaifah se, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi — Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni raat ki namaz jab Unhon ne Allah ki takbir kahi to kaha: Allah sab bada hai, badshahat, Jabr, takabbur aur azmat chhae unhon ne kaha: Phir Unhon ne al-Baqarah padhi unhon ne kaha: Phir ruku kiya, aur un ka ruku un ke qiyam jaisa tha, apne ruku mein kehte hue: Apne Parwardigar, azeem ki paki, apne Parwardigar, azeem ki paakii. phir ruku se sar uthaya aur apne ruku jaisa khade hue, kehte hue: Mere Rabb ke liye tareef hai phir sajdah kiya, un ka sajdah un ke qiyam jaisa, apne sajde mein kehte hue: Apne Parwardigar, buland ki paakii. phir sajde se sar uthaya, donon sajdon ke darmiyan kehte hue: Mere Rabb, mujhe muaf kar, mere Rabb, mujhe muaf kar; aur apne sajde jitna baithe Huzaifah ne kaha: Unhon ne chaar rak'aten padhin, mein al-Baqarah, Aal-Imran, an-Nisa aur al-Ma'idah ya al-An'am padhte hue — Shu'bah ko shak hua"
"417","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Huzaifah ke janaze mein ek aadmi ko suna — mera khayal hai woh Rib'i bin Hirash the — jinhon kaha: Main ne is janaze wale ko kehte suna: Mujhe koi nuqsan nahin us ke baad jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna; agar tum ek-doosre se lado to main apne ghar mein dakhil aur, aur agar mujh par dakhil hua gaya to kahunga: Yahan, mera gunah aur tumhara gunah uthaa."
"418","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Malik al-Ashja'i se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamen logon par teen se fazeelat di gayi: Hamari safen farishton ki safon jaisi banai gayin, zameen hamare liye masjid banai gayi aur us ki mitti pak karne wali, aur mujhe Surah-Baqarah ka aakhir diya gaya; woh khazane mein se hain, Arsh ke neeche ghar mein se"
"419","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Malik se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har neki Sadqa hai"
"420","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, Huzaifah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — unhon ne kaha: Kabhi woh Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan karte, kabhi marfu' bayan na karte — jinhon farmaya: Ek qaum aag se niklegi, badbudar, aag ne unhen jhulasaayaa hoga; woh Allah ki rehmat aur shafa'at karne walon ki shafa'at se jannat mein dakhil honge, aur Tauba kahalaaenge."
"421","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu at-Tufail se, Huzaifah se, Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Muzar ka yeh qabeela zameen par Allah ke kisi nek bande ko nahin choregaa magar use fitne mein daalega aur halaak karega, yahan tak ke Allah baad mein unhen apni taraf se ya aasman se lashkaron se pakdega, unhen zaleel karte hue yahan tak ke woh pahaarii raste ki gunah ki hifazat na kar sakein"
"422","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Hammam bin al-Haris se, unhon ne kaha: Huzaifah se ek aadmi ke bare mein kaha gaya: Yeh ameeron tak pahunchata hai Huzaifah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi Chugalkhor jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga"
"423","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Abu Khalid se, jinhon Abu Ubaidah bin Huzaifah ko Huzaifah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jo ghar beche aur us ki qeemat ghar mein na lagae us mein barkat nahin hogi yeh hadees Wahb bin Jarir se, Shu'bah se, Nabi se marfu' riwayat ki gayi"
"424","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Yusuf se, Abu Ubaidah bin Huzaifah se, Huzaifah se, usi tarah marafuua."
"425","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Zaid bin Wahb se, unhon ne kaha: Huzaifah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen do hadeesein sunaaiin; Main ne ek dekhi hai aur doosri ka intezar hai Aap ne hamen sunaya: Amanat aadmiyon ke dilon ki jadon mein utarii; Unhon ne Quran se seekha aur sunnat se siikhaa. phir Aap ne hamen us ke uthae jane ke bare mein sunaya, farmate hue: Aadmi ek neend sota hai aur us ke dil mein kala nuqtaa lagaya jata hai; us ka nishan us ke andar chaale ki tarah rehta hai, jaise angare jise Tum ne apne paon par lurhakaayaa aur woh chaalaa pada, aur tum use utha hua dekhte ho jis mein kuch nahin log jaagenge aur mein koi ameen na hoga mujh par ek waqt aaya jab mujhe parwah na thi tum mein se kis se muaamalaa karun: Agar Musalman to us ka Islam mujhe karta; agar Yahudi ya Nasrani to us ka wakeel mujhe lautaataa. ab main tum mein se falan aur falan ke siwa kisi se muaamalaa nahin karta logon par ek waqt aayega jab aadmi ke bare mein kaha jaega: Kitna caalaaka, kitna aqalmand, jabke us ke dil mein jau ke dane bhar iman na hoga"
"426","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muslim bin Nadir ko Huzaifah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne meri pindli ka gosht pakda aur farmaya: Tehband ki hadd yahan hai; agar inkar karo to yahan; agar inkar karo to tehband ka takhanon mein koi haq nahin, ya: Takhanon ka tehband mein koi haq nahin"
"427","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Yazid ko kehte suna: Ham ne Huzaifah se kaha: Hamen aise aadmi ki khabar do jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hidayat aur dastoor mein qareeb ho taake ham us se juren. unhon ne kaha: Main kisi ko nahin janta jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hidayat aur dastoor mein zyada qareeb ho yahan tak ke us ke ghar ki deewar use chhupae bin Umm Abd se Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Huzaifah ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein mahfooz jante the ke bin Umm Abd mein Allah se rahmat mein sab qareeb hain"
"428","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, al-Waleed bin al-Mughirah se, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main tez zaban wala aadmi hun, aksar apne gharwalon ke khilaafa. Aap ne farmaya: Bakhshish mangne mein tum kahan ho? Main apne Rabb se din mein sau martaba bakhshish mangta hun"
"429","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Sulaim bin Abd se, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Khawf ki namaz do rak'at aur chaar sajde hain; agar koi muamla tumhen jaldi kare to ladna aur baat tumhare liye halal ho gaya"
"430","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Laila se, ke Huzaifah ne peene ko manga; ek sardar un ke paas chandi ka bartan laya, to Unhon ne use us par phenka aur kaha: Main ne yeh sirf liye kiya kyunke Main ne use is ke bare mein Khabardar kiya tha; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sone-chandi ke bartanon mein peene, aur qiimakhvaaba aur resham pahanne se mana farmaya, farmate hue: Yeh un ke liye duniya mein hai aur tumhare liye aakhirat mein"
"431","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Abdullah bin Yasar se, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na kaho: Jo Allah chahe aur falan chahe; lekin kaho: Jo sirf Allah chahe"
"432","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, al-Mughirah bin hazfa se, Huzaifah ya Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Musalmanon ke darmiyan un ki qurbaaniyon mein taqseem; gae saat ke liye hai Abu Dawud ke siwa doosre kehte hain: Huzaifah se, baghair shak ke"
"433","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Bakhtari at-Taayi ko Abu Saur se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Huzaifah bin al-Yaman aur Abu Mas'ud al-Badri ke sath baitha tha jab Kufa wale Sa'id bin al-Aas ke par nikle aur use wapas diya — al-jaraaa ke din unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Mas'ud ko kehte suna: Main ne kabhi na socha tha ke woh lautegaa baghair is mein khoon bahaane Huzaifah ne kaha: Lekin Allah ki qasam, main janta tha ke woh Aediyon par lautegaa baghair is mein pichhne bhar khoon bahe; main us mein se kuch na janta tha siwae us ke jo Main ne jana jabke Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zinda the: Aadmi subah mu'min karta hai aur Sham ko us ke paas apne deen mein se kuch nahin hota, aur Sham ko mu'min aur subah ko us ke paas apne deen mein se kuch nahin hota; woh logon ki jama'at mein ladta hai — ya unhon ne kaha: Din ke fitne mein, Abu Dawud ko shak hua — Allah use kal qatl karega; us ka dil bartan hai aur us ka pichavaaraa us par ghalib hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Us ka ka hissa? Unhon ne kaha: Us ka pichavaaraa."
"434","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, Abdullah bin Yazid se, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan khade hue aur hamein khabar di jo qayamat tak hoga, siwae is ke ke Main ne Aap se nahin poocha: Madinah walon ko Madinah se Kya nikaalegaa."
"435","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar, Madinah walon mein ghufaraa ke aazad-karda ne ham se bayan kiya, Bani Abdul-ashahala ke Ansar ke ek aadmi se, Huzaifah bin al-Yaman se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aakhri zamane mein ek qaum hogi jo kahegii: Koi taqdeer nahin; agar woh beemar paren to un ki iyadat na karo, agar woh hon to un ke paas na jao, kyunke woh Dajjal ki jama'at hain, aur Allah Ta'ala par lazim hai ke unhen us ke sath milaae."
"436","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, laahiqa bin Humaid se, ke ek aadmi halqay ke darmiyan mein baitha, to Huzaifah ne kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban par lanat — ya unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us par lanat ki jo halqay ke darmiyan mein baithe"
"437","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Mijlaz se, ke ek aadmi Huzaifah ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kya Tum ne nahin dekha ke falan mar gaya? Unhon ne kaha: Jis ne use maut di woh tumhen maut dene par qadir hai phir woh halqay ke darmiyan mein baitha, to Unhon ne us se kaha: Utho, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us par lanat ki jo halqay ke darmiyan mein baithe"
"438","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Subayy bin Khalid se, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Dajjal niklega, aur us ke sath ek nahar aur aag hogi jo us ki nahar mein dakhil hoga, us ka bojh lazim hoga aur us ka ajr mitegaa, aur jo us ki aag mein dakhil hoga, us ka ajr lazim hoga aur us ka bojh mitegaa."
"439","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Dawud al-Wasiti — aur woh siqah the — ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Habib bin Salim ko suna, kehte hue: Main ne an-Nu'man bin Bashir bin Sa'd ko suna, kehte hue: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath masjid mein baithe the, aur Bashir ek aadmi the jo apni riwayat rokte the phir Abu Sa'labah aae aur kaha: Aey Bashir bin Sa'd, Kya tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hukkaama ke bare mein hadees yaad hai? Huzaifah Bashir ke sath baithe the, to Huzaifah ne kaha: Mujhe un ka khutba yaad hai phir Abu Sa'labah baithe, aur Huzaifah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum nubuwwat mein paoge jab tak Allah chahe woh rahe, phir woh use uthaaegaa jab uthana caahegaa. phir nubuwwat ke raste par khilafat hogi, aur woh rahegi jab tak Allah chahe woh rahe, phir woh use uthaaegaa jab uthana caahegaa. phir katne wali badshahat hogi, aur woh rahegi jab tak Allah chahe woh rahe, phir woh use uthaaegaa jab uthana caahegaa. phir zalim saltanat hogi, aur woh rahegi jab tak Allah chahe woh rahe, phir woh use uthaaegaa jab uthana caahegaa. phir nubuwwat ke raste par khilafat hogi phir woh khamosh hue unhon ne kaha: Phir Umar aae, un ke sahaba mein Yazid bin an-Nu'man sath the, to Main ne unhen hadees yaad dila hue likha, aur unhen likha: Mujhe ummeed hai ke Ameerul-Mu'minin katne wali badshahat aur zalim saltanat ke baad aayenge unhon ne kaha: To Yazid ne khat liya aur use Umar ke paas jane, aur woh us se khush aur razi hue"
"440","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ismail bin Jaafar ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr Ibn Abi Amr se, jo al-Muttalib ke aazad-karda the, al-Muttalib se — is tarah Abu Dawud ne kaha — Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat nahin pahunchegi yahan tak ke tum apne sardar ko qatl karo, aur tum apni talwaron se ek-doosre ko maro, aur tum mein se badtareen tumhari duniya ke waris hon"
"441","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Masrooq se, Nu'aim Ibn Abi Hind se, unhon ne kaha: Huzaifah ne kaha: Main ne sarakande ki jhopariyon ke siwa koi jhopariyaan nahin ke jo Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath thin; woh is ke par koi hifazat nahin deti — ya'ni kuufaa. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-akhasaasa woh ghar hain jo Basrah mein hamare paas sarakandon ke bane hain"
"442","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Usman bin Umair ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zazan ne ham se bayan kiya, Huzaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaash Aap khalifa muqarrar karte Aap ne farmaya: Agar main khalifa muqarrar karta aur tum us ki nafarmani karte to tum par azab utarataa. lekin, jo bin Mas'ud tumhen parhe woh padho, aur jo Huzaifah tumhen bayan kare use qabool karo — ya unhon ne kaha: Suno."
"443","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah al-qaisii ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal al-Adawi se, Nasr bin Asim al-Laisi se, unhon ne kaha: Main al-yashkurii ke paas gaya, aur unhon ne kaha: Tumhen Kya laya, Aey Bani Lais? Unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Ham tum Huzaifah ki hadees poochne aae hain unhon ne kaha: Sawariyan mahangii ho gayi thin, to ham Kufa aae us se sawariyan laane. Main ne apne sathi se kaha: Main masjid mein dakhil aur, aur jab bazaar khulegaa to us mein nikaluungaa. to main masjid mein dakhil hua, aur wahan ek halaqaa tha jaise un ke sar kaate gae hon, ek aadmi ke irda-gird jamaa. main aaya aur khada hua, aur kaha: Yeh kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum Kufa walon mein se ho? Main ne kaha: Nahin, lekin Basrah walon mein se unhon ne kaha: Agar tum Kufa walon mein se hote to us ke bare mein na poochte; yeh Huzaifah bin al-Yaman hain unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya is bhalai ke baad burayi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aey Huzaifah, Allah ki Kitab seekho aur us mein jo hai us ki pairwi karo main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya is bhalai ke baad burayi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Dhuan par sulaha. main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, dhuan par sulah Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ek qaum ke dil us par nahin aur jis par the phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir andhaa, baharaa fitna hoga; gumrahi ke daaii — ya unhon ne kaha: Aag ke daaii. tumhara darakht ki nas ko qat — ya'ni darakht — tumhare liye mein se kisi ki pairwi se behtar hai"
"444","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham Woh-dastuvaaii ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Subayy bin Khalid se unhon ne kaha: Aur Hammad bin Zaid, Abu Ubaid Abdul-waris aur Hammad bin Najeeh sab ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu at-Tayyah Yazid bin Humaid Woh-dubaii se, Sakhr bin Badr se, Subayy bin Khalid se — ya Khalid bin Subayy — jinhon kaha: Sawariyan mahangii ho gayi thin, to ham Kufa aae us se sawariyan laane. main masjid mein dakhil hua, aur wahan daramiyaane qad ka aadmi tha, apni muskaana mein khubsurat, Hijaz ke aadmiyon mein se mashhoor, log us ki taraf jhuke hue unhon ne kaha: Mujhe jaldi na karo; main tumhen bayan karunga, kyunke Ham ne abhi jahalat ko peeche chhoda tha, aur jab Islam aaya to woh aisa muamla tha jaisa Main ne kabhi na dekha tha Allah ne mujhe Quran ki samajh di thi log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bhalai ke bare mein poochte the, aur main Aap se burayi ke bare mein poochta tha main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya is bhalai ke baad burayi hai jaisa is se pahle burayi thi? Aap ne farmaya: Han main ne kaha: Hifazat Kya hai, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Talavaara. main ne kaha: Kya talwar mein se kuch bacha hai, aur us ke baad Kya aata hai? Aap ne farmaya: Dhuan par sulah hogi unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Sulah ke baad Kya aata hai? Aap ne farmaya: Gumrahi ke daaii. agar tum us din zameen par Allah ka khalifa dekho to us se cipato, chahe woh tumhari peeth maare aur tumhara maal le; aur agar koi khalifa na dekho to bhaago yahan tak ke maut tumhen aa le jabke tum darakht ki nas kaat rahe ho main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ke baad Kya aata hai? Aap ne farmaya: Dajjaala."
"445","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit, al-A'mash aur Abdul-Aziz bin rufaiya se, Zaid bin Wahb se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Abu Zarr, logon ko khushkhabri do ke jo kahe: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, woh jannat mein dakhil hoga"
"446","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhajir Abu al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Zaid bin Wahb ke paas gae, aur Unhon ne hamen Abu Zarr se bayan kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the, Bilal sath the woh iqamat kehna chahte the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Thandak hone tak der karo phir woh iqamat kehna chahte the aur Aap ne farmaya: Thandak hone tak der karo phir woh iqamat kehna chahte the aur Aap ne farmaya: Thandak hone tak der karo — teen martaba, ya'ni Zuhr ke liye — yahan tak ke Ham ne teelon ke sae dekhe phir Unhon ne iqamat kahi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi phir Aap ne farmaya: Garmi ki ki jahannam ki saans se hai, to namaz thandak hone tak der karo"
"447","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad Ibn Abi Sulaiman se, Zaid bin Wahb se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zyada wale sab neeche hain — ya: Kam wale — qayamat ke din"
"448","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Ibn Abi Ziyad se, kehte hue: Main ne Zaid bin Wahb ko suna, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, lakarabagghon ne hamen kha liya hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe tumhare liye dab'u ke siwa us se zyada dar hai jitna mujhe tumhare liye dab'u ka dar hai: Jab duniya tum par kasrat se undelii jae kaash meri ummat Sona na pahne"
"449","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah aur Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Humaid bin Hilal ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin as-Samit ko suni, Abu Zarr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jinhon farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log honge jin ki nishani mundna hai, jo Quran padhte hain baghair us ke un ke halaq se aage badhe woh deen se — ya Islam se — nikal jaenge jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai woh makhlooq aur khalqa mein badtareen hain"
"450","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Imran ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah bin as-Samit ko Abu Zarr se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hukkaama honge jo namaz ko us ke waqton se der karenge to namaz waqt par padho, phir un ke paas jao; agar woh padh chuke hain to Tum ne apni namaz mahfooz ki, aur agar nahin to tum un ke sath parhte aur woh tumhare liye nafl hogi"
"451","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin as-Samit ko Abu Zarr se riwayat karte suni, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum shorba pakao to us ka pani karo, phir apne padosiyon ke ghar ki taraf dekho aur unhen us mein se kuch neki mein do"
"452","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Imran ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah bin as-Samit ko suni, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Zarr Sham se Usman ke paas aae to kaha: Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, Kya tum samajhte ho main kisi qaum mein hun — Allah ki qasam, main mein nahin na un tak pahuncuungaa — jo Quran padhte hain baghair us ke un ki hansli se aage ho, jo Islam se nikal jate hain jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai, us mein kabhi na lautte hue yahan tak ke teer apne shikanje mein aae; un ki nishani mundna hai Allah ki qasam, agar tum mujhe khade hone ka hukm do to main na baithunga jab tak meri taangen mujhe utha saken; aur agar tum mujhe kajave ke lakdi ke do halaqon se bandho to main use na hounga yahan tak ke tum nafs mujhe ho"
"453","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran se, Abdullah bin as-Samit ko suni, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe sunne aur ita'at ka hukm diya, chahe Habshi ghulam ho kate angon chhae"
"454","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal al-Adawi se, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah bin as-Samit ko Abu Zarr se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ki namaz tuutatii hai, jab us ke samne kajave ki pichhli lakdi jaisi koi cheez na ho, aurat, gadhe aur siyahi kutte se unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zarr se kaha: Siyahi ko surkh se Kya farq hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aey mere bhai ke bete, Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha jaisa Tum ne mujh se poocha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Kala kutta shaitan hai"
"455","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, budaila se, Abu al-Aliya al-Barra se, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah bin as-Samit ko suna, Abu Zarr se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki raan par mara aur farmaya: Tumhara Kya haal hoga jab tum aisi qaum mein raho jo namaz der kare? Namaz waqt par padho, phir un ke paas jao; agar tum masjid mein ho jab iqamat kahi jae to un ke sath padho"
"456","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah bin as-Samit ko suna, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aadmi apne liye amal kare aur log us se us ke liye muhabbat karen? Aap ne farmaya: Woh mu'min ki jaldi khushkhabri hai"
"457","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah — aur woh behtareen aadmiyon mein se the — ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Humaid bin Hilal ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin as-Samit se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ka'ba aur us ke pardon ke darmiyan tha jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein dakhil hue Aap ne Hajar se shuru kiya aur use chhua, phir Baitullah ke saat chakkar lagae aur maqam ke peeche do rak'aten padhin"
"458","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Humaid bin Hilal ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin as-Samit se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jab woh apni namaz se farigh hue the, aur main ne kaha: Salam ho tum par Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum par unhon ne kaha: To main pehla tha Jis ne unhen Islam ke salam se salam kiya"
"459","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal se, Abdullah bin as-Samit se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tum yahan kitne waqt se ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Tees din-raat se Aap ne farmaya: Tees din-raat se! Main ne kaha: Han Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara khana Kya tha? Main ne kaha: Mere paas Zamzam pani ke siwa na khana tha na peena, aur main khilaya hua yahan tak ke mere pet ki tahen phat gayin, aur mujhe apne pet mein bhook ka koi nishan nahin milti unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh barkat wala hai; woh aisa khana hai jo khilata hai, aur beemari ki shifa hai"
"460","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Humaid bin Hilal ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin as-Samit se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath raha jab tak raha phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Mujhe khajooron ki zameen dikhai gayi hai, aur main use yasariba ke siwa nahin dekhataa. Kya tum meri taraf se apni qaum ko pahuncaaoge jis se Allah unhen tumhare sath nafa dega, aur tumhen mein ajr dega? Main ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: To main nikla aur Unais se mila, jinhon mujh se kaha: Tum ne Kya kiya? Main ne kaha: Main ne Islam qabool kiya aur iman laya unhon ne kaha: Mujhe tumhare deen se koi nafrat nahin; Main ne Islam qabool kiya aur iman laya unhon ne kaha: Aur ham apni walidah ke paas aae aur use Islam pesh kiya, aur us ne kaha: Mujhe tumhare deen se koi nafrat nahin; phir us ne kaha: Main ne Islam qabool kiya aur iman laya unhon ne kaha: Aur ham apni qaum ke paas aae aur unhen Islam pesh kiya, aur mein se aadhon ne Islam qabool kiya, jabke doosre aadhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aayenge to ham Islam qabool karenge unhon ne kaha: Imaa bin rahazaa al-Ghifari — aur woh un ke sardar the — unhen namaz padhate the jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah aae to baqi aadhon ne Islam qabool kiya aur Aslam se hamare bhai aae aur kaha: Ham Islam qabool karte hain us par jis par Ghifar se hamare bhaiyon ne Islam qabool kiya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghifar — Allah use muaf kare; aur Aslam — Allah use salamti de"
"461","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, al-munabaisa bin Tarif se, Abdullah bin as-Samit se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Abu zarra. main ne kaha: Hazir hun Teri paas mein aur Teri madad mein, Aey Allah ke farmaya Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara Kya haal hoga jab bhook logon ko gheregii, aur tum apne bistar par aao apni masjid mein laut se aajiz, aur tum apni masjid mein aao apne bistar par laut se aajiz? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain Aap ne farmaya: Tum par pakdamani lazim hai Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara Kya haal hoga jab bahut maut logon ko gheregii, yahan tak ke qabr — ya'ni qabr — ghulam ke badle bechi jae? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain Aap ne farmaya: Tum par sabr lazim hai phir farmaya: Tumhara Kya haal hoga jab tum tel ki ghaanii ke patthron ko khoon mein ghurub dekho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain — ya: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ne mere liye cunaa. Aap ne farmaya: Un se cipato mein se tum ho — ya: Un se milo mein se tum ho"
"462","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sallam bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim at-Taimi se, un ke walid se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Abu Zarr, Kya tum jante ho suraj kahan jata hai jab duubataa hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne farmaya: Woh Arsh ke paas aata hai aur sajdah karta hai, aur use laut ki ijazat di jati hai; aur ek martaba use kaha gaya tha: Wapas jahan se Tu aaya, to woh wapas hai jahan se aaya Wahy us ki aaramgah hai"
"463","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim at-Taimi se, un ke walid se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Jo Allah Ta'ala ke liye masjid banae, chahe reta-tiitara ke ghonsle jaisi, Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata Abu Dawud ne Ise Nabi se marfu' bayan nahin kiya, jabke Yahya bin Adam ne marfu' bayan kiya, qutbaa se, al-A'mash se"
"464","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim at-Taimi se, un ke walid se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, logon ke liye sab pahle kaun-si masjid rakhi gayi? Aap ne farmaya: Masjid-haram, phir Masjid-aqsaa. unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aur un ke darmiyan kitna? Aap ne farmaya: Chalis saal aur jahan namaz tumhen pae, padho, kyunke woh masjid hai"
"465","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu Asma ar-rahabii se, Abu Zarr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jo woh apne Rabb, Tabaraka wa Ta'ala se riwayat karte hain, jinhon farmaya: Main ne zulm ko apne liye haram kiya, aur use apne bandon ke darmiyan haram kiya, to ek-doosre par zulm na karo Adam ka har beta raat-din ghalti karta hai, phir meri bakhshish mangta hai, to main use muaf karta hun aur mujhe parwah nahin"
"466","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Wasil se, al-Ma'rur bin Suwaid se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare Parwardigar Ta'ala ne farmaya: Neki das gunaa hai, aur burayi ek hai, ya main use muaf karta hun jo mujh se zameen bhar zulm lekar mile, mere sath kuch Shareek kiye baghair, main us se zameen bhar bakhshish lekar miluungaa. jo neki ka irada kare lekin use na kare, us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai; jo burayi ka irada kare lekin use na kare, us ke par kuch nahin likha jata jo mujh se ek balisht qareeb ho, main us se ek hath qareeb hota hun; jo mujh se ek hath qareeb ho, main us se ek baanha qareeb hota hun Shu'bah ne Ise Wasil se marfu' bayan nahin kiya, jabke logon ne Ise al-A'mash se, al-Ma'rur se marfu' bayan kiya"
"467","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Suwaid bin al-Haris ko suni, Abu Zarr ko suni, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Mujhe khush na karega ke Uhud mere paas Sona ho aur mujh par teen raaten guzren jabke mere paas us mein se ek dinar — ya unhon ne kaha: Ek wazan — bacha ho, siwae us ke jo main qarz ke liye alag rakhuun."
"468","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud Ibn Abi Hind se, al-Waleed bin Abdur Rahman se, Jubair bin Nufair se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ramazan ke roze rakhe, aur Unhon ne mahine ke kisi hisse mein hamen namaz nahin padhai, yahan tak ke jab caubiisaviin raat hui — bache hue mein se saatwin — to Unhon ne hamen namaz padhai yahan tak ke raat ka taqreeban tihai guzar gaya jab pacciisaviin raat hui to Unhon ne hamen namaz nahin padhai jab chabbiisaviin raat hui — bache hue mein se panchwin — to Unhon ne hamen namaz padhai yahan tak ke raat ka taqreeban aadha guzar gaya main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kaash Aap hamari baqi raat mein hamen nafl padhate Aap ne farmaya: Nahin; jab aadmi imam ke sath namaz padhe yahan tak ke woh jae, us ke liye raat ka qiyam likha jata hai jab Sattaiswin raat hui to Unhon ne hamen namaz nahin padhai jab atthaaiisaviin raat hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne gharwalon ke paas aae aur log un ke liye jama hue, aur Unhon ne hamen namaz padhai yahan tak ke ham al-falah se taqreeban cuuka gaye phir — Aey mere bhai ke bete — Unhon ne mahine ke kisi hisse mein hamen namaz nahin padhai unhon ne kaha: Aur al-falah suhuura hai"
"469","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin mudrika se, kehte hue: Main ne Abu Zur'ah bin Amr bin Jarir ko kharashaa bin al-hurra se, Abu Zarr se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Teen jin ki taraf Allah qayamat ke din na dekhega, na baat karega, aur un ke liye dardnak azab hai main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh kaun hain? Woh nakam hue aur khasaare mein karein Aap ne farmaya: Ehsan jataane wala, tehband latkane wala, aur jhooti qasmon se apna saaman chalane chhae"
"470","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zarr ki ek hadees mujh tak pahunchti, aur main un se milne ki Khwahish karta, to main un se mila aur kaha: Aey Abu Zarr, tumhari ek hadees mujh tak pahunchti aur main tum milne ki Khwahish karta unhon ne kaha: Allah tumhare walid ko barkat de, tum mile, to karo main ne kaha: Mujhe pahunchi ke tum riwayat karte ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumhen khabar ke Allah Ta'ala teen se muhabbat karta hai aur teen se nafrat karta hai unhon ne kaha: Main nahin samajhta ke main apne mahboob ke bare mein jhoot boluungaa. main ne kaha: Woh teen kaun hain jise woh muhabbat karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi jo dushman se mile aur lade; aur tum woh apne paas Kitab mein pate ho: Beshak Allah un se muhabbat karta hai jo us ke raste mein safon mein ladte hain main ne kaha: Aur kaun? Unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi jis ka bura padosi ho jo use takleef de, aur woh us ki takleef par sabr se ibadat kare, to Allah zindagi ya maut se us ke par use kafi ho unhon ne kaha: Aur kaun? Unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi jo safar mein logon ke sath tha, aur woh utre aur qailula kiya, halanke un par uungha aur neend ghalib aai thi, aur Unhon ne apne sar rakhe aur soe, jabke woh khada hua, wuzu kiya, aur Allah ke dar aur us ke shauqa se namaz padhi main ne kaha: Woh teen kaun hain jise Allah nafrat karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ehsan jataane wala bakheel, aur mutakabbir fakhr karne wala — aur tum Allah ki Kitab mein pate ho: Beshak Allah har mutakabbir fakhr karne wale se muhabbat nahin karta unhon ne kaha: Teesra kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Vyaapaarii — ya bechne wala — jo bahut qasmen khae"
"471","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Abu Basrah al-Ghifari se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Kankariyan barabar karna ek martaba hai, aur mere liye na karna mujhe sau kali-aankhon wali oontniyon se zyada pasandeeda hai"
"472","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Najeeh se, Mujahid se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se har cheez ke bare mein poocha, yahan tak ke kankariyan barabar karne ke bare mein, aur Aap ne farmaya: Ek martaba aur Sufyan ne kaha — al-A'mash se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abi Laila se, Abu Zarr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — usi taraha."
"473","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Abu al-Bakhtari ko riwayat karte suni ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un cheezon ke bare mein farmaya jin par aadmi ko ajr milta hai, yahan tak ke apni biwi ke paas aane mein kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, kaise, jabke woh apni Khwahish poori karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum dekhte ho, agar woh haram mein hota to Kya woh gunah na karta? Unhon ne kaha: Han Aap ne farmaya: Usi tarah use ajr milta hai Shu'bah ne Ise marfu' bayan nahin kiya, jabke al-A'mash ne kaha: Amr se, Abu al-Bakhtari se, Abu Zarr se"
"474","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Wasil se, Mujahid se, Abu Zarr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jinhon farmaya: Mujhe paanch cheezen di gayin jo mujh se pahle kisi Nabi ko nahin di gayin: Zameen mere liye masjid aur paki ka zariyaa banai gayi; mahine bhar ki doori se dushman ke par rob se meri madad ki gayi; main surkh aur siyaaha ki taraf bheja gaya; ghanimat mere liye halal ki gayin halanke woh mujh se pahle kisi Nabi ke liye halal na thin; aur mujhe shafa'at di gayi, jo meri ummat ke un logon tak pahuncegii jo baghair Allah ke sath kuch Shareek kiye maren. is tarah Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, jabke Jarir ne kaha: Al-A'mash se, Mujahid se, Ubaid bin Umair se, Abu Zarr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi taraha."
"475","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-Husain se, Ayyub bin Bashir se — ya doosre aadmi se — Misr walon ke Qazi se — ya ek Qazi, Abu Bishr ko shak hua — ke Unhon ne Abu Zarr se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tum musafaha karte the jab tum milte the? Unhon ne kaha: Woh mujh se kabhi na mile magar mujh se musafaha kiya ek martaba main aaya aur mujh se kaha gaya: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumhen talash kiya, to main un ke paas aaya, aur woh mujh se mile aur mujhe gale lagaya — aur woh behtar aur behtar tha"
"476","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zarr se kaha: Agar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekhta to un se kisi cheez ke bare mein puuchataa. unhon ne kaha: Woh Kya hai? Main ne kaha: Main un se poochta: Kya Aap ne apne Parwardigar Ta'ala ko dekha? Phir Abu Zarr ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya Aap ne apne Rabb ko dekha? Aap ne farmaya: Noor — main use kaise dekhta?"
"477","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Yahya bin saama se, kehte hue: Main ne Musa bin Talha ko kehte suna: Main ne Abu Zarr ko ar-Rabadzah mein kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Abu Zarr, jab tum mahine ke teen din roze rakho to terahaviin, caudahaviin aur pandrahaviin ko rakho"
"478","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu al-Ahwas se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni namaz mein ho to rehmat us ke samne hoti hai, to woh apne paon se kankariyan ya bajarii na barabar kare"
"479","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Maqburi se, un ke walid se, Ubaidullah bin Adi bin al-Khiyar se, Salman al-Khair se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jume ko ghusl kare, apne tel se tel lagae, apne ghar ke itra se itra lagae, phir Jume ki namaz mein aae, do aadmiyon ko juda na kare, namaz padhe, aur jab imam bole dhyaana se sune aur khamosh rahe, use us ke aur agle Jume ke darmiyan muaf kiya jata hai is tarah Ibn Abi Zi'b ne kaha — Salman se — jabke hamare sahaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id se, bin Ajlan se, Sa'id se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin vadiiaa se, Abu Zarr se"
"480","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Umar ash-Shami se, Ubaid bin al-khashakhaasha se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke woh masjid mein the, aur main un ke sath baitha Aap ne farmaya: Aey Abu zarra. main ne kaha: Hazir hun Aap ne farmaya: Kya Tum ne namaz padhi? Main ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne farmaya: Khade ho aur padho to Main ne padhi, phir main un ke paas aaya aur un ke sath baitha Aap ne farmaya: Aey Abu Zarr, Kya Tum ne jinnion aur insan ke shaitanon ke sharr se Allah ki panah mangi? Main ne kaha: Kya insan mein shaitan hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, Aey Abu zarra. phir Unhon ne mujh se farmaya: Kya main tumhen jannat ke khazanon mein se khazane ki rehnumai na karun? Main ne kaha: Haan, Ya Rasulullah, mere walidah-baap Aap par fidaa. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke siwa koi taqat na quwwat, kyunke woh jannat ke khazanon mein se khazana hai main ne kaha: Aur namaz, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Qayam neki; jo chahe kam kare, aur jo chahe zyada kare main ne kaha: Aur roza, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Farz jo kafi hai main ne kaha: Aur Sadqa, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Kayeen gunaa, aur Allah ke paas zyada hai main ne kaha: Mein se kaun afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kam wale ki koshish, aur faqeer ko chhupa tohafaa. main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jo Allah ne tum par nazil kiya us mein sab bada kaun-sa hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah, us ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, zinda, qaayama. main ne kaha: Ambiya mein pehla kaun tha, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Aadama. main ne kaha: Kya woh Nabi the? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, kalaam kiye gae nabii. main ne kaha: Rasulullah kitne the, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Teen sau pandrah, bade jamaaata."
"481","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Mundhir as-Sauri se, un ke sahaba se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen chhoda, aur aasman mein fadfadata koi parinda na tha magar Aap ne hamen us ke bare mein kuch ilm yaad dilaya"
"482","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-A'mash ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Mundhir as-Sauri ko un ke sahaba se, Abu Zarr se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do bakriyon ko takaraate dekha, aur mujh se farmaya: Aey Abu Zarr, Kya tum jante ho woh kis par takaraa rahi hain? Main ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne farmaya: Lekin tumhara Rabb janta hai, aur woh qayamat ke din un ke darmiyan faisla karega"
"483","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hashim se, Abu Mijlaz se, Qais bin Abbad se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zarr ko kehte suna: Allah ki qasam, yeh aayat — yeh do jhagarane wale hain jinhon apne Rabb ke bare mein jhagda — sirf in chhe aadmiyon ke bare mein nazil hui: Hamzah, Ali, Ubaidah bin al-Haris, Utbah, Shaibah aur al-Waleed bin utbaa."
"484","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Azraq bin Qais se, Bani Tameem ke ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Mu'awiyah, Allah un par raham kare, ke darwaze par the, aur Abu Zarr hamare sath the Unhon ne zikr kiya ke woh roze se the jab ham dakhil hue aur dastarkhwan biche to Abu Zarr khane lage unhon ne kaha: To Main ne unhen dekha, aur unhon ne kaha: Aey surkh, tumhen Kya hua? Kya tum mujhe mere khane se ghafil karna chahte ho? Main ne kaha: Kya Tum ne hamen nahin khabar tha ke tum roze se ho? — Ya main ne kaha: Kya Tum ne da'wa nahin kiya tha ke tum roze se ho? Unhon ne kaha: Han phir Unhon ne mujh se kaha: Kya Tum ne Quran padha hai? Main ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Shayad Tum ne us mein se Wahid padha lekin muzaaafa na padha: Jo neki jane us ke liye das jaisi hain phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sabr ke mahine aur har mahine ke teen din roza ka — mera khayal hai Aap ne farmaya: Umar bhar roza hai — lekin yeh jis ke bare mein koi shak nahin: Yeh seene ka keena door karta hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Seene ka keena Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Shaitan ki gandagii."
"485","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mahadii bin Maimun ne ham se bayan kiya, Wasil se, jo Abu Uyainah ke aazad-karda the, Yahya bin Uqail se, Yahya bin Ya'mur se — aur kabhi Unhon ne Abu al-Aswad Woh-dualii se zikr kiya — Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke amal mujhe dikhaye gae, us ki neki aur buraaii. Main ne un ki behtareen nekiyon mein raste se takleef hataya dekhi, aur Main ne un ki badtareen buraiyon mein masjid mein balgham dekha jo dafan na kiya gaya ho"
"486","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah aur Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Bani Amir ke ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zarr ko Quba ki masjid mein namaz padhte dekha, qitrii chadar pahne Main ne unhen salam kiya lekin Unhon ne mera salam nahin diya jab woh apni namaz se farigh hue to diya main ne kaha: Kya tum Abu Zarr ho? Unhon ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Main ne Madinah ko naamuvaafiqa paya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe kuch doodh wali untniyan din aur mujhe hukm diya ke un ke doodh aur peshab se piyuun — phir Ayyub un ke peshab par khamosh hue aur Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ke sahaba ke giroh mein masjid ke sae mein dekha jab Unhon ne mujhe dekha to farmaya: Aey Abu zarra. main ne kaha: Main halaak hua, Aey Allah ke farmaya Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhen Kis ne halaak kiya? — Ya unhon ne kaha: Aur woh Kya hai? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main pani se door rehta hun aur mujhe janabat laahiqa hoti hai; Kya main baghair wuzu namaz padhun — ya unhon ne kaha: Baghair taharat? To Aap ne mere liye pani mangwaya, aur ek Habshi bandi pani bhara bada pyala lekar aai, kaanpta, bhara nahin Main ne oont se parda kiya aur ghusl kiya unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Abu Zarr, pak mitti tumhen kafi hai chahe das saal pani na pao; aur jab pani pao to use apni khaal se lagao Abu Bishr ne kaha: Aur Abu Hafs ne ham se bayan kiya: Yazid bin zuraia ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah se, Amr bin bujadaana se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zarr ko suna"
"487","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sallam bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id se, al-Haris bin Yazid se, Abu Zarr se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe mulaazima rakhen Aap ne farmaya: Aey Abu Zarr, tum kamzor ho, aur woh amanat hai; woh qayamat ke din rusavaaii aur pachataavaa hogi, siwae us ke jo use us ke haq se le aur us mein jo us par lazim hai woh poora kare"
"488","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Abu Wa'il se, Abu Musa se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aadmi ladta hai taake us ki jagah dekhi jae, shohrat ke liye ladta hai, aur ghanimat ke liye ladta hai; Allah ke raste mein kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo lade taake Allah ka kalima buland ho woh Allah ke raste mein hai"
"489","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne mujh se kaha: Abu Wa'il ne mujhe ek hadees sunai jo mujhe pasand aai unhon ne kaha: Abu Musa al-Ash'ari ne ham se bayan kiya, ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aadmi zikr ke liye ladta hai, ladta hai taake us ki jagah dekhi jae, aur aisi-aisi ke liye ladta hai; Allah ke raste mein kaun hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo lade taake Allah ka kalima sab buland ho woh Allah ke raste mein hai"
"490","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lathi par teke aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aadmi zikr ke liye ladta hai, aur aisi-aisi ke liye ladta hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo lade taake Allah ka kalima buland ho woh Allah Ta'ala ke raste mein hai"
"491","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qais aur Jarir ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Abu Wa'il se, Abu Musa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bhooke ko khilao, qaidi ko aazad karo, aur beemar ki iyadat karo"
"492","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Abu Ubaidah ko Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se riwayat karte suni, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala raat ko apna hath karta hai taake din ka burayi karne wala Tauba kare, aur din ko taake raat ka burayi karne wala Tauba kare, yahan tak ke suraj apne doobne ki jagah se nikle"
"493","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah aur al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Abu Ubaidah ko Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se riwayat karte suni, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala sota nahin, na us ke laeq hai ke hue woh meezan musafir karta hai aur buland karta hai; raat ke amal din mein us ki taraf uthae jate hain, aur din ke raat mein al-Mas'udi ne badhaya: Us ka hijab aag hai; agar woh use khole to us ke chehre ke anavaara har us cheez ko jala den jis tak us ki nazar pahunche phir Abu Ubaidah ne padha: Barkat wala hai woh jo aag mein hai aur jo us ke irda-gird hai, aur pak hai Allah, jahanon ka Rabb"
"494","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne naam hamen bataye, mein woh jo hamen yaad raha Aap ne farmaya: Main Muhammad hun, Ahmad, al-muqaffii, al-haashira, Tauba ke Nabi aur jang ke nabii."
"495","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah aur Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Usman an-Nahdi se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein the ham ek wadi chadhe, aur jab woh us mein utre to Unhon ne takbir aur tahlil se apni aawazein buland ki, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khaccara par the Aap ne farmaya: Aey logo, apne sath narmi karo, kyunke tum behre ya ghaib ko nahin pukarte rahe; tum sab sunne wale, sab dekhne wale ko pukarte rahe ho"
"496","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas bin Malik se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran padhne wale mu'min ki misaal utrujjah jaisi hai: Us ki khushbu achchi aur zaeqa acchaa. Quran na padhne wale mu'min ki misaal khajoor jaisi hai: Us ka zaeqa achcha lekin us mein khushbu nahin Quran padhne wale badkar ki misaal naazabuu jaisi hai: Us ki khushbu achchi lekin zaeqa karavaa. Quran na padhne wale badkar ki misaal hanzala jaisi hai: Us ka zaeqa khabees aur khushbu gandii."
"497","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id Ibn Abi Burdah se, un ke walid se, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Musalman par har din Sadqa hai unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, agar woh kuch na pae? Aap ne farmaya: Woh apne hath se kaam kare, apne ko nafa de aur Sadqa de unhon ne kaha: Agar woh aisa na kare? Aap ne farmaya: Woh haajatamanda, museebat ki madad kare unhon ne kaha: Agar woh na kar sake? Aap ne farmaya: Woh neki ka hukm de aur burayi se roke. unhon ne kaha: Agar woh na kar sake? Aap ne farmaya: Woh burayi se ruke, kyunke woh us ke liye Sadqa hai"
"498","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id Ibn Abi Burdah se, un ke walid se, Abu Musa al-Ash'ari se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen aur Mu'az ko Yaman bheja, aur un se farmaya: Apne mein ittifaaqa karo, aasan karo aur mushkil na karo, khushkhabri do aur door na bhagaao."
"499","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id Ibn Abi Burdah se, un ke walid se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare darmiyan shehed se mashroob banaya jata hai jise bitaa kehte hain, aur jau se mashroob jise mizra kehte hain, aur donon nasha bhejte hain Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har nashawar haram hai"
"500","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hariisha ne ham se bayan kiya, Talha al-Yami se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har nashawar haram hai"
"501","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id Ibn Abi Burdah se, un ke walid se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi mu'min nahin marta magar Allah us ki jagah aag mein Yahudi ya Nasrani dakhil karta hai unhon ne kaha: To Abu Burdah Umar bin Abdul-Aziz ke paas aae, jinhon un se hadees ke bare mein poocha, aur Unhon ne unhen bayan ki; to Unhon ne unhen teen martaba qasam dilaaii ke Abu Musa ne waqaee unhen Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan ki thi"
"502","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ghailan bin Jarir se, Abu Burdah Ibn Abi Musa se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sawariyan mangne aaye Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, main tumhen sawar nahin karunga, aur mere paas kuch nahin jis se tumhen sawar karun phir kuch oont jane gae aur Aap ne hamen teen safed-kuhaana walon par sawar kiya jab ham aae to Main ne apne sahaba se kaha: Allah ki qasam, Allah hamen barkat nahin dega; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam khayi thi ke hamen sawar nahin karenge jao ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne qasam khayi thi ke hamen sawar nahin karenge Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tumhen sawar nahin kiya; tumhen Allah ke siwa kisi ne sawar nahin kiya Allah ki qasam — agar Allah chahe — main qasam nahin khata phir us se behtar dekhta magar apni qasam ka kaffara deta hun aur behtar karta hun"
"503","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Bakr al-hannaata ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Husain se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni bandi aazad kare phir use naya meher de, use do ajr hain"
"504","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih bin Salih as-Sauri se, ash-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Burdah ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen ko un ka ajr do martaba diya jaega: Ek aadmi jis ki bandi thi, Us ne use adaba sikhaya aur achcha adaba sikhaya, use padhaya aur achcha padhaya, phir use aazad kiya aur us se ihsan ki; Ahle-Kitab ka ek aadmi jo apne Nabi par iman laya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mila aur un par iman laya; aur ek ghulam jo Allah ka haq aur apne maalikon ka haq poora kare unhon ne kaha: Phir ash-Sha'bi ne apne sath ek aadmi se kaha: Ise baghair qeemat lo, kyunke is se kam ke liye Madinah ke safar kiye jate the"
"505","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Burdah bin Abdullah Ibn Abi Burdah Ibn Abi Musa se, un ke dada se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'min mu'min ke liye imarat jaisa hai, har hissa doosre ko mazboot karta hai"
"506","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne ham se bayan kiya, Murrah ko Abu Musa se riwayat karte suni, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bahut aadmi kamaala ko pahunche, lekin koi aurat kamaala ko nahin pahunchee siwae Maryam bint Imran aur Aasiyah Firaun ki biwi ke; aur aurton par A'ishah ki fazeelat aisi hai jaisi sab khane par sareed ki faziilata."
"507","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud al-Audi se, Humaid bin Abdur Rahman al-himyarii se, ke humaamaa — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi — ne al-Ash'ari ke sath isbahaana par hamla kiya, aur isbahaana Umar, Raziyallahu anhu ke zamane mein fath hua unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, humaamaa da'wa karta hai ke woh tujh se milne se muhabbat karta hai Aey Allah, agar woh sachcha hai to us ke sach se us ke liye faisla kar; aur agar woh jhoota hai to use us par La chahe woh napasand kare Aey Allah, humaamaa ko us ke is safar se na aaya to woh isbahaana mein mara, aur al-Ash'ari khade hue aur kaha: Aey logo, Allah ki qasam, jo Ham ne tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna — aur hamara ilm is se aage nahin — humaamaa shaheed hai"
"508","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Abdullah bin Nafi' ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Sa'id Ibn Abi Hind se, Abu Musa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Resham aur Sona meri ummat ki aurton ke liye halal kiya gaya, aur us ke mardon ke liye haraama."
"509","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Yazid bin Aws se, ke jab al-Ash'ari beemari se bhaari hue to un ki biwi un par roii, aur unhon ne kaha: Kya tum nahin jaanatiin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Kya farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: To Main ne baad mein aurat se poocha: Unhon ne Kya kaha? Us ne kaha: Woh us se bari hai jo muunde, buland awaz se roye, aur phaare."
"510","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Sinan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne bete Sinan ko dafan kiya, jabke Abu Talha al-Khaulani qabr ke kinare baithe the unhon ne kaha: Woh-Dahhak bin Abdur Rahman ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah Ta'ala bande ke bachche ko leta hai to apne farishton se kehta hai: Mere bande ne Kya kaha? Woh kehte hain: Us ne Teri tareef ki aur kaha: Ham Allah ke hain aur usi ki taraf laut wale hain woh kehta hai: Us ke liye ghar banao, aur us ka naam baitul-hamd rakho"
"511","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, kehte hue: Main ne Sa'id bin Jubair ko Abu Musa se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is ummat ka koi — na Yahudi na Nasrani — mere bare mein sune phir mujh par iman na jane, magar woh jahannam walon mein hoga"
"512","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Nafi' se, Sa'id Ibn Abi Hind se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Jo nard se khele Us ne Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki nafarmani ki"
"513","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, ghalib at-tammaara se, kehte hue: Aws bin Masrooq — ya Masrooq bin Aws — ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ungliyan barabar hain main ne kaha: Har ungli ke liye das oont? Aap ne farmaya: Han"
"514","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, Abu Mijlaz se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ash'ari ne apne sahaba ke sath Isha ki namaz padhi jabke Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan the, phir ek rak'at padhi jis mein an-Nisa ya al-Baqarah ki sau aayaat padhin un se kaha gaya: Yeh Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne bharasaka koshish ki ke apne qadam wahan rakhun jahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rakhe, aur woh karun jo Aap ne kiya"
"515","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Tamimah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Jo hamesha roza rakhe, jahannam us par aise tang hoti hai — aur Unhon ne ungliyon ke jod se nabbe banaya Shu'bah ne Ise marfu' bayan nahin kiya, jabke Sa'id ne marfu' bayan kiya"
"516","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Woh-Dahhak bin Yasar ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Tamimah se, Abu Musa se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jinhon farmaya: Jo hamesha roza rakhe, jahannam us par aise tang hoti hai, aur Unhon ne ungliyon ke jod se nabbe banaya"
"517","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Nek sathi ki misaal itrafarosha jaisi hai: Agar woh tumhen apne itra mein se na de to us ki khushbu mein se kuch tumhen pahunchti hai bure sathi ki misaal dhaunkanii wale jaisi hai: Agar us ki aag tumhen na lage to us ka dhuwen tumhen pahuncha hai Abu Dawud ne Ise marfu' bayan nahin kiya"
"518","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Muslim se, kehte hue: Main ne Tariq bin Shihab ko Abu Musa se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke woh al-Batha mein thehre the Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tum ne ehram kaise bandha? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Labbaik, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ehram jaise ehram ke sath Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne achcha kiya; Baitullah ka tawaf karo aur as-Safa aur al-Marwah ke darmiyan, phir ehram ho to Main ne kiya, aur Bani Qais ki ek aurat ke paas gaya Jis ne mere sar se juen nikaaliin. phir main logon ko us se fatwa deta, yahan tak ke ek aadmi ne mujh se kaha: Aey Abdullah bin Qais, apne kuch fatave mein narmi karo, kyunke tum nahin jante Ameerul-Mu'minin ne tumhare baad manasik ke bare mein Kya nikali hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Jise Main ne kisi cheez ke bare mein fatwa diya, woh intezar kare, kyunke Ameerul-Mu'minin us ke paas aa rahe hain, to un ki pairwi karo unhon ne kaha: To woh aae, aur main un ke paas gaya aur is ka zikr un se kiya unhon ne kaha: Agar ham Allah ki Kitab se len to Allah ki Kitab hamen poora karne ka hukm deti hai; aur agar ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat se len to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ehram nahin khola yahan tak ke qurbani apne thikane pahunchi"
"519","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Yunus bin Jubair se, Hittan bin Abdullah ar-Raqashi se, ke al-Ash'ari ne apne sahaba ke sath ek namaz padhi jab woh apni namaz mein baithe to un ke peeche logon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Namaz neki aur zakat ke sath qayam hui jab al-Ash'ari apni namaz se farigh hue to kaha: Tum mein se Kis ne aisi baat kahin? Log khamosh hue unhon ne kaha: Aey Hittan, shayad Tum ne kaha main ne kaha: Main ne nahin kaha, halanke mujhe dar tha ke tum mujhe us se daantoge. al-Ash'ari ne kaha: Kya tum nahin jante tum apni namaz mein Kya kehte ho? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen khutba diya aur hamen hamari sunnat sikhaye aur hamari namaz hamen samajhaaii. Aap ne farmaya: Apni safen seedhi karo, phir tum mein se ek tumhen parhaae. jab imam takbir kahe to takbir kaho; aur jab woh kahe: Na gumaraahon ke, to amin kaho, aur Allah tumhen jawab dega jab woh ruku kare to ruku karo, kyunke imam tum pahle ruku karta hai aur tum pahle karta hai Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: To us ke liye us ke badle aur jab woh kahe: Allah sunta hai jo us ki tareef kare, to kaho: Aey Allah, hamare Rabb, Tere liye tareef hai, aur Allah tumhen sune, kyunke Allah Ta'ala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban par farmaya: Allah sunta hai jo us ki tareef kare aur jab woh takbir kahe aur sajdah kare to takbir kaho aur sajdah karo, kyunke imam tum pahle sajdah karta hai aur tum pahle karta hai Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: To us ke liye us ke badle jab baithne par ho to pahle kalimaat hon: Tahiyyatu Allah ke liye hain, achchi cheezen, namazen Allah ke liye hain salam ho tum par, Aey Nabi, aur Allah ki rahamata. salam ho ham par aur Allah ke nek bandon par main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, aur Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasulullah hain"
"520","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Wuhaib bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud se, Abu nazaraa se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri se, ke al-Ash'ari ne Umar se teen martaba ijazat mangi lekin Unhon ne ijazat na di, to woh aur Unhon ne unhen bheja: Tumhen Kis ne diya? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne teen martaba ijazat mangi lekin ijazat na mili, aur Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab ijazat mangne wala teen martaba ijazat mange aur ijazat na mile to woh aur unhon ne kaha: Tum mere paas use zaroor laoge jo yeh janta ho, ya main tumhare sath aisa-aisa karunga Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Al-Ash'ari mere paas kaanpate aae, un ka chehra zard hua woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ke halqay par khade hue aur kaha: Main Allah ki qasam deta hun har aadmi ko jo is mein se kuch janta ho magar us ke sath khada ho, kyunke mujhe is aadmi se apne liye dar hai to main ne kaha: Main tumhare sath hun doosre ne kaha: Aur main tumhare sath hun to woh mutamaina hue"
"521","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu at-Tayyah se, kehte hue: Main ne ek siyahi aadmi ko suna — jo Ibn Abbas ke sath Basrah aaya tha — kehte hue: Jab Ibn Abbas Basrah aae to unhen Abu Musa se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadeesein sunai gaen to Ibn Abbas ne unhen un ke bare mein poochte hue likha, aur al-Ash'ari ne unhen likha: Tum apne zamane ke aadmi ho, aur Main ne mein se kuch Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat nahin kiya, siwae is ke ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha jab Aap peshab karna chahte the Aap deewar ki narm taraf jhuke aur peshab kiya, aur farmaya: Gai-Isra'il, jab mein se ek ko peshab lagti to use qaincii se kaatate. Abu Sa'id ne kaha: To jab tum mein se ek peshab karna chahe to apne peshab ke liye jagah talash kare"
"522","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Bakr al-Huzali ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Burdah Ibn Abi Musa se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jinhon farmaya: Jab tumhare paas teer hon to un ke kinare pakad taake kisi Musalman ko zakhmi na karo ya us ka kapda na phaaro. al-Ash'ari ne kaha: Aur yeh log mujhe hukm dete hain ke un se Musalmanon ki putaliyon ka samna karun"
"523","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tez chalti uthae jate janaze ke paas se guzre Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par sukoon ho"
"524","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tez uthae jate janaze ke paas se guzre, hilataa hua jaise mashkiizaa hilataa hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par apne janazon ke sath chalne mein etidaala lazim hai"
"525","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wali ke baghair nikah nahin"
"526","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Burdah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), jab kisi qaum ke par dua karte to farmate: Aey Allah, main tumhein un ke halaqon ke samne rakhta hun, aur un ki buraiyon se Teri panah mangta hun"
"527","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Burdah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Kaash Tum ne hamen hamare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath dekha hota jab baarish ne hamen mara tha; tum hamari khushbu ko bakriyon ki khushbu ke siwa kisi se na milate"
"528","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Asma bint Umais se mile aur kaha: Tum kitne husn log ho, agar yeh na hota ke ham tum hijrat mein aage badhe Unhon ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, jinhon farmaya: Lekin tumhari do hijaraten hain: Habsha ki zameen ki taraf hijrat, aur Madinah ki taraf hijarata."
"529","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Burdah se, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi kehta tha: Main ne tumhen talaq di; Main ne tumhen diya yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunchi, jinhon farmaya: Aadmiyon ko Kya hai jo Allah ki hudood se khelte hain? Aur Musa bin Mas'ud ne kaha — Sufyan se, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"530","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Lais Ibn Abi Sulaim se, Mujahid se, Abdullah bin sakhabaraa se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Musa ne hamen bayan kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Musalman, Yahudi ya Nasrani ka janaza tumhare paas se guzre to us ke liye khade ho; kyunke ham us ke liye nahin khade hote, lekin ham us ke sath farishton mein se un ke liye khade hote hain"
"531","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Haris bin Qudamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, Abu Bakr Ibn Abi Musa se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Firdaus ke bagh chaar hain: Sone ke do bagh, un ki khubsurat, un ke bartan aur jo mein hai; aur chandi ke do bagh, un ki khubsurat, un ke bartan aur jo mein hai un ke aur apne Parwardigar Ta'ala ko dekhne ke darmiyan sirf adana ke bagh mein us ke chehre par azmat ki chadar hai phir woh adana ke bagh mein gaddhe mein naharon se phatatii hai, phir jannat mein naharon mein bantatii hai"
"532","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jaafar bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-jaunii se, Abu Bakr Ibn Abi Musa se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat talwaron ke sae ke neeche hai"
"533","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Musa al-Ash'ari ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas apni qaum ke do aadmiyon ke sath aaya ham un ke paas pahunche jabke un ke paas miswak thi jis se woh apne dant saaf kar rahe the Unhon ne un se mulazmat mangi Aap ne farmaya: Aey Abu Musa, Kya isi ke liye tum aae ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Ya Rasulullah, main is ke liye nahin aaya, na Unhon ne mujhe khabar jo un ke dilon mein tha unhon ne kaha: To Main ne unhen apni miswak se apna oopri honth uthate dekha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, ham Ise tum mein se kisi ko nahin dete jo Ise maange. to Aap ne mujhe bheja aur unhen chhod aur Yahya bin Sa'id ne yeh hadees Qurrah se, Humaid bin Hilal se, Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa se riwayat ki"
"534","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ash'ari ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke main bin Mas'ud ko un ke gharwalon mein karta tha, un ke sath un ki neki ki wajah se aur Sufyan ne Ise Abu Ishaq se, al-Aswad se, Abu Musa se riwayat kiya"
"535","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yahya bin Kaseer aur Abu Ubaidah donon ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Safwan bin muhariza al-Mazini se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Ash'ari ne hamen Basrah ke mimbar par khutba diya aur kaha: Jo sharab Madinah mein haram ki gayi thi woh kachchi aur pakeeza khajooron ka milawat thi"
"536","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, ek aadmi se, Abu Musa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka guzarna chedane aur taoon se hai unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh chedanaa ham jante hain; taoon Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jinnion mein se tumhare dushman ka chedanaa, aur har ek mein shahadat hai aur Abu Awanah Ise Abu Balj se, Abu Bakr Ibn Abi Musa se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain"
"537","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Abu Musa se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, bhalai aur burayi qayamat ke din logon ke liye do fitaraten muqarrar hain jahan tak bhalai ki baat hai, woh apne walon ko bhalai ka wa'da deti hai aur unhen mubarak deti hai; jahan tak burayi ki baat hai, woh kehti hai: Meri taraf, meri taraf — aur woh us se cipatane ke siwa kuch nahin kar rakhta"
"538","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Muhammad bin dinar ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Aws se, misadaa Abu Yahya se, Ibn Abbas se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen sikhaya ke woh — suraj — keechad wale chashme mein duubataa hai"
"539","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ammar Ibn Abi Ammar ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Mujh par ek waqt guzra jab main kehta tha: Musalmanon ke bachche Musalmanon ke sath hain, aur mushrikon ke bachche mushrikon ke sath hain — yahan tak ke falan ne mujhe falan se bayan kiya phir main us se mila jis se Unhon ne mujhe bayan kiya tha, aur Unhon ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se un ke bare mein poocha gaya aur Aap ne farmaya: Allah behtar janta hai jo woh karte"
"540","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Musa bin Abdur Rahman ne mujhe bayan kiya, rauha se, Hammad se, Ammar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Ubayy ne mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi tarah bayan kiya"
"541","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Muhammad bin Aban ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, marfu', unhon ne kaha: Woh ladka jise Khidr, Alaihissalam ne qatl kiya kafir banaya gaya tha, aur us ke liye muhabbat us ke walidah-baap par dali gayi"
"542","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Asim bin bahadalaa ne mujhe khabar di, riwayat bin Hubaish se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne mujhe tumhen Quran padhane ka hukm diya unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne unhen padha: Jinhon kufr kiya aur unhen padha: Allah ke han deen ki qayam sunnat seedha tauheed hai, na shirk, na yahuudiyata, na iisaaiyata; aur jo neki kare use inkar nahin kiya jayega aur unhen padha: Agar Adam ke bete ke paas wadi ho to woh us ke liye doosri talash karega; aur agar use doosri di jae to woh us ke liye teesri talash karega Adam ke bete ka pet mitti ke siwa kuch nahin bharataa, aur Allah us ki taraf wapas hai jo aur"
"543","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, unhon ne kaha: Ubayy bin Ka'b ne mujh se kaha: Aey riwayat, tum Surah-Ahzab mein se kitna padhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Itni aayaten. unhon ne kaha: Woh Surah-Baqarah ke barabar hoti thi, aur ham us mein padhte the: Buddha aadmi aur budhi aurat, jab woh zina karen to unhen pakka rajm karo Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki taraf se rok ke taur par phir woh uthai gayi mein uthai gayi"
"544","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubayy se muavvizataina ke bare mein poocha, aur unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se un ke bare mein poocha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se kaha gaya, to Main ne tum kaha, to kaho Ubayy ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen farmaya, aur ham kehte hain"
"545","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jabir bin Yazid bin Rifa'ah al-ijalii ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yazid Ibn Abi Sulaiman ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne riwayat bin Hubaish ko kehte suna: Agar tumhare hakim ka dar na hota to main apne hath apne kaanon mein rakhta, phir pukarta: Lailatul-Qadr aakhri das mein hai, saat mein — us se pahle teen aur us ke baad teen us ki khabar se Jis ne mujh se jhoot nahin kaha, us ki khabar se Jis ne us se jhoot nahin farmaya Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni Ubayy bin Ka'b, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"546","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, riwayat se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, ke Jibreel, Alaihissalam Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas al-miiraa ke patthron par aae, aur Unhon ne un se kaha: Aey Jibreel, main ummiyon qaum ki taraf bheja gaya hun, mein budhi aurat, buddha aadmi, ladka, ladki, aur sakht aadmi jo kabhi Kitab nahin padha unhon ne kaha: To Jibreel ne kaha: Quran saat huruufa par nazil hua"
"547","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib bin az-Zubair se, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah Ibn Abi al-Hudhail ko Abdur Rahman bin Abza se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Khabbab ko kehte suna: Main ne Ubayy bin Ka'b ko kehte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki maujudgi mein Dajjal ka zikr hua — ya unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Dajjal ka zikr kiya — aur farmaya: Us ki ek aankh jaise hara shiishaa hai aur qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mango"
"548","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, al-ajalaha se, Zarr se, bin Abdur Rahman bin Abza se, un ke walid se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe karna sikhaya: To usi mein woh khush hon"
"549","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail aur bayan al-iyaamii se, Zarr se, bin Abdur Rahman se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) witr mein padhte the: Apne Parwardigar, buland ke naam ki tasbih kar; aur: Kaho, Aey kaafiro; aur: Kaho, woh Allah hai, ek jab salam pherte to kehte: Badshah, pak ki paki — teen martaba, teesri ke sath awaz buland karte hue al-A'mash ne Ise Talha aur bayan se, Zarr se, bin Abza se, un ke walid se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat kiya"
"550","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yunus bin Ubaid ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, utaiya as-Sa'di se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jinhon farmaya: Wuzu ke liye ek shaitan hai jise al-valahaana kehte hain, to us se bacho — ya unhon ne kaha: To us se hifazat karo"
"551","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu al-ashahaba ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, unhon ne kaha: Adam ke bete ka khana duniya ki misaal ke taur par mara gaya hai, chahe woh use namakiina kare aur masaaledaara kare Sufyan ne Ise Yunus se, al-Hasan se, utaiya se, Ubayy se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat kiya"
"552","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus se, al-Hasan se, utaiya as-Sa'di se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, hadees ko marfu' bayan karte hue, jinhon kaha: Jab maut Adam, Alaihissalam par utarii to kaha: Aey mere beton, main jannat ke phal mein se kuch chahta hun to un ke bete use talash karte nikle, aur Unhon ne farishton ko dekha, jinhon kaha: Kahan ja rahe ho, Aey Adam ke beton? Unhon ne kaha: Hamare walid jannat ke phal mein se kuch chahte hain, to ham un ke liye use talash karte nikle hain unhon ne kaha: Jao, kyunke tumhare walid ko uthane ka hukm diya gaya hai woh aae yahan tak ke Adam, Alaihissalam tak pahunche jab havvaa ne unhen dekha to unhen pahchana aur Adam se cipatiin. unhon ne kaha: Mujh se door; meri museebat tumhari taraf se aai mujhe aur mere Rabb ke farishton ko chhod do unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne un ki rooh li jabke woh dekh rahe the, unhen ghusl diya jabke woh dekh rahe the, unhen kafan diya jabke woh dekh rahe the, unhen hanuuta lagaya jabke woh dekh rahe the, aur un par namaz padhi phir woh un ki taraf mude aur kaha: Aey Adam ke beton, yahi tumhari sunnat hai apne murdon ke sath, aur yahi tumhara rasta hai"
"553","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jaafar bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sa'id al-Jurairi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Rabah al-Ansari se, Ubayy se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Abu al-Mundhir, Allah ki Kitab mein kaun-si aayat sab bade hai? Main ne kaha: Ayat-kurasii. Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ilm tumhen khush kare, Aey Abu al-munzira. us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, qayamat ke din us ki zaban hogi jo Arsh ki taang ke paas Allah ki tasbih karti hogi aur Sufyan kehte hain: Sa'id se, Abu as-saliila se, Abdullah bin Rabah se"
"554","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, Abu Usman an-Nahdi se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, unhon ne kaha: Mere qareeb rishtedaron mein ek aadmi tha jis ka ghar Madinah mein sab door ghar tha unhon ne kaha: Abu Usman ne kaha — jabke woh badon ke darmiyan bayan kar rahe the: Jo tumhare aur pul ke darmiyan hai, ya zyada duura. unhon ne kaha: Asim ne kaha: To Main ne is ka zikr Muhammad bin Sireen se kiya, jinhon kaha: Agar woh Madinah mein sab door ghar tha to woh pul se zyada door hai phir Unhon ne us ke aakhir mein kaha: Main sirf qadmon ka ajr chahta tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare liye hai jo Tum ne irada"
"555","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Salamah bin Kuhail ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Suwaid bin ghafalaa ko kehte suna: Main subah Zaid bin suhaana aur Salman bin Rabi'ah ke sath nikla, aur mujhe koraa mila aur Main ne use liya Unhon ne mujh se kaha: use phenk do main ne kaha: Nahin, lekin main us ka elan karunga; agar mujhe koi mile jo use pehchane to achcha, warna main us se nafa uthaauungaa. Main ne unhen inkar kiya jab ham apni muhim se aae to mere liye muqaddar hua ke Main ne Hajj kiya main Madinah aaya aur Ubayy bin Ka'b se mila, aur unhen kode ke mamle aur un ke kahe ki khabar di Ubayy bin Ka'b ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein sau dinar wali thaili hulla main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya Aap ne farmaya: Ek saal us ka elan karo to Main ne us ka elan kiya, aur koi na paya jo use pehchane, teen martaba Aap ne farmaya: Us ki ginti, us ki bandhan aur us ke bartan ki hifazat karo; agar us ka Malik aae to achcha, warna us se nafa chalo unhon ne kaha: To Main ne us se nafa uthe Shu'bah ne kaha: Phir main baad mein Salamah se mila aur unhon ne kaha: Mujhe nahin ma'loom teen saal ya ek saal yeh hadees mujhe pasand aai, to Main ne Abu Urwah se kaha: Aao aur use un se suno."
"556","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Abu Rafi' se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramazan ke aakhri das mein e'tikaf karte the ek saal safar kiya aur e'tikaf na kiya, to agle saal bees din e'tikaf kiya"
"557","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Ishaq ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Abdullah Ibn Abi basiira ko Ubayy bin Ka'b se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen namaz padhai aur farmaya: Kya falan hazir hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne farmaya: Yeh do namazen — ya'ni Isha aur Fajr — Munafiqon par sab bhaari hain agar woh jante jo mein hai to mein aate chahe ghisatate hue pehli saf farishton ki saf jaisi hai; agar tum us ki fazeelat jante to us ki taraf daurate. aadmi ki doosre aadmi ke sath namaz us ki akele namaz se pak hai; do aadmiyon ke sath us ki namaz ek aadmi ke sath us ki namaz se pak hai; aur jitne zyada, Allah Ta'ala ko utane mahabuuba. aur Zuhair ne Ise Abu Ishaq se, Abdullah Ibn Abi basiira se, un ke walid se, Ubayy se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat kiya"
"558","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Jamrah ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Iyas bin Qatadah ko suna, Qais bin Abbad se, unhon ne kaha: Main Madinah aaya Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba se hai mein se koi mujhe milne ke liye Ubayy bin Ka'b se zyada pasandeeda na tha main pehli saf mein khada hua, aur Umar Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ke sath nikle ek aadmi aaya, logon ke chehron ko dekha, mere siwa unhen pahchana, mujhe hataya, aur meri jagah khada hua main apni namaz na samajh saka jab Unhon ne namaz padhi to mujh se kaha: Aey jawan, Allah tumhen ghamgin na kare, kyunke Main ne jo kiya jahalat se nahin kiya; lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen farmaya: Mere thaile ki saf mein ho Main ne logon ke chehron ko dekha aur tumhare siwa unhen pahacaanaa. phir Unhon ne bayan kiya, aur Main ne aadmiyon ko kisi cheez ki taraf gardenen phailate nahin dekha jaisa Unhon ne us ki taraf phailaaiin. Main ne unhen kehte suna: Girah wale halaak hue, Ka'ba ke Rabb ki qasam — Unhon ne Ise teen martaba kaha — woh halaak hue aur halaak kiya lekin main un par ghum nahin karta, lekin main un Musalmanon par ghum karta hun jinhein woh halaak karte hain aur woh aadmi Ubayy bin Ka'b the Abu Dawud ne kaha: Girah wale: Jis par Us ne khoon bahaye aur pakda, phir da'wa kiya"
"559","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Marwan bin al-Hakam se, Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad bin Abd Yaghuth se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jinhon farmaya: Beshak kuch sheara mein hikmat hai"
"560","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Mujahid se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Bani Ghifar ke hauz par the jab Jibreel, Alaihissalam un ke paas aae aur kaha: Allah Ta'ala tumhen hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko ek harfa par Quran padhaen Aap ne farmaya: Main Allah se us ki mu'afi aur bakhshish mangta hun, kyunke meri ummat us ki taqat nahin rakhatii. phir woh doosri martaba un ke paas aae aur kaha: Allah Ta'ala tumhen hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko do huruufa par Quran padhaen Aap ne farmaya: Main Allah se us ki mu'afi aur bakhshish mangta hun, aur meri ummat us ki taqat nahin rakhatii. phir woh teesri martaba un ke paas aae aur kaha: Allah tumhen hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko teen huruufa par Quran padhaen Aap ne farmaya: Main Allah se us ki mu'afi aur bakhshish mangta hun, aur meri ummat us ki taqat nahin rakhatii. phir woh chauthi martaba aae aur kaha: Allah tumhen hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko saat huruufa par Quran parhaao; jis harfa par woh padhe woh durust hain"
"561","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Aun as-Saqafi ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne al-Haris bin Amr ko himsa walon mein Mu'az ke sahaba se riwayat karte suna — unhon ne kaha: Aur ek martaba unhon ne kaha: Mu'az se — ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az ko Yaman bheja to un se farmaya: Tum kaise faisla karoge agar koi muamla tumhare samne aae? Unhon ne kaha: Main Allah ki Kitab se faisla karunga Aap ne farmaya: Aur agar tum use Allah ki Kitab mein na pao? Unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat se faisla karunga Aap ne farmaya: Aur agar tum use Rasulullah ki sunnat mein na pao? Unhon ne kaha: Main ijtihad karunga, koi kasara na chhodte hue unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne mere seene par apna hath mara aur farmaya: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye Jis ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke elacii ko us ki taraf hidayat di jo Rasulullah ko khush karti hai"
"562","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Urwah bin an-nazzaala se — ya an-nazzaala bin Urwah — Mu'az bin Jabal se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe aise amal ki khabar do jo mujhe jannat mein dakhil kare Aap ne farmaya: Shaanadaara, shaanadaara; Tum ne bade baat ke bare mein poocha hai, lekin woh us ke liye aasan hai jis ke liye Allah use aasan kare farz namaz padho, aur farz zakat do Kya main tumhen mamle ke kinare, us ke sutoon aur us ke kuhaana ki chotiyon ki khabar na dun? Mamle ka sire Islam hai; jo Muslim hua woh mahfooz hua us ka sutoon namaz hai, aur us ke kuhaana ki chotiyon Allah ke raste mein jihad hai Kya main tumhen bhalai ke darwazon ki rehnumai na karun? Roza dhal hai; Sadqa gunah mitaataa hai; aur raat ki gaharaaii mein bande ka qiyaama. aur Aap ne padha: Un ke pahlu apne bistaron se juda hote hain — aayat ke anta tak Kya main tumhen us ki khabar na dun jo in sab ko qaboo karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Sawar — ya sawar — zahir hue, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hath se apni zaban ki taraf ishara kiya main ne kaha: Kya ham waqaee pakde jaenge jo ham apni zabanon se kehte hain? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari walidah tumhen khoye, Aey Mu'az; logon ko aag mein nathnon ke bal un ki zabanon ki kheton ke siwa Kya giraataa hai?"
"563","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Muhammad bin Rashid ne ham se bayan kiya, Makhul se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is hadees mein Mu'az se farmaya: Jab tak tum khamosh ho tum mahfooz ho; jab tum karo to woh tumhare liye hai ya tumhare khilaafa."
"564","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Muslim se, kehte hue: Main ne Abu ramalaa ko Ubaidullah Ibn Abi Muslim se, Mu'az bin Jabal se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen wale ne lazim kiya Mu'az ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aur do wala? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur do chhae unhon ne kaha: Ya'ni woh Jis ne apne teen bachchon ko apne se pahle bheja ho"
"565","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Shahr bin Haushab se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne hamen Mu'az se bayan kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo paki mein soe phir raat mein hue, woh Allah se aakhirat ya duniya ke mamle mein kuch nahin mangta magar woh use deta hai Sabit ne kaha: Woh aadmi jis se Shahr ne hamen bayan kiya hamare paas aaya aur hamen yeh hadees sunayi"
"566","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Ayyub se, Ubaidullah bin zahra se, Khalid Ibn Abi Imran se, Abu Ayyash se, Mu'az bin Jabal se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to main tumhen bataun sab pehli cheez jo Allah Ta'ala qayamat ke din mu'minon se kehta hai, aur sab pehli cheez jo woh kehte hain unhon ne kaha: Haan, Aey Allah ke farmaya Aap ne farmaya: Woh mu'minon se kehta hai: Kya tum mujh se milne se muhabbat karte the? Woh kehte hain: Haan, hamare Rabb woh kehta hai: Kyun? Woh kehte hain: Ham Teri bakhshish aur Teri rehmat ki ummeed karte the woh kehta hai: Main ne apni rehmat tumhare liye lazim ki"
"567","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah aur Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Amr bin Maimun al-Audi se, Mu'az bin Jabal se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Kya tum jante ho bandon par Allah ka haq Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain Aap ne farmaya: Bandon par Allah ka haq hai ke woh us ki ibadat karen aur us ke sath kuch Shareek na karen; aur Allah Ta'ala par un ka haq, jab woh aisa karen, hai ke woh unhen azab na de"
"568","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Laila se, Mu'az bin Jabal se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah aae aur satrah mahine baitul-Maqdis ki taraf namaz padhi phir yeh aayat un par nazil hui: Ham tumhare chehre ka aasman ki taraf phiranaa dekhte hain — aayat ke anta tak unhon ne kaha: To Allah ne unhen Kaabe ki taraf phera"
"569","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, kehte hue: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Masrooq se riwayat karte suna, ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az ko Yaman bheja to unhen hukm diya ke har baligh se ek dinar ya kapdon mein us ki qeemat len aur Shu'bah ke siwa doosron ne kaha: Abu Wa'il se, Masrooq se, Mu'az se"
"570","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr Ibn Abi Hakim se, Abdullah bin Buraidah se, Yahya bin Ya'mur se, Abu al-Aswad Woh-dil se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'az bin Jabal ke paas ek aadmi laya gaya jo Islam ke siwa par mara tha, apne bete ko Musalman chhodkar, to Mu'az ne use us se wirasat di, aur kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Islam badhega hai aur hoti nahin"
"571","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu az-Zubair ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu at-Tufail Amir bin Wasilah al-Laisi ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mu'az bin Jabal ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek muhim mein jo Aap ne ki — aur woh Tabuk ki muhim mein thi — Zuhr aur Asr ke darmiyan, aur Maghrib aur Isha ke darmiyan jama kiya unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aap ne is se Kya irada kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne irada kiya ke apni ummat par bojh na daalen."
"572","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jarir Woh-dabbii ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, Mu'az bin Jabal se, unhon ne kaha: Do aadmiyon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki maujudgi mein ek-doosre ko bura di, aur mein se ek gusse hua yahan tak ke us ki naak gusse se phat gayi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ek kalima janta hun, agar woh use kehta to us ka gussa jata: Main maraduuda shaitan se Allah ki panah mangta hun"
"573","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, al-Waleed bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Idris al-A'izi se, unhon ne kaha: Main masjid mein dakhil hua, jis mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se bees ke qareeb the mein ek aadmi tha kali aankhon wala, chamakdar aankhon wala; jab woh kisi cheez mein ikhtilaf karte to woh baat kehta aur woh us ki baat par khatm karte Main ne us ke bare mein poocha, aur woh Mu'az bin Jabal the agle din main masjid mein dakhil hua aur woh sutoon ki taraf namaz padhte khade the main un ke sath baitha, aur jab Main ne aisa kiya to Unhon ne apni namaz chhoti ki main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main tum Allah ki azmat ke liye muhabbat karta hun unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam? Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam unhon ne kaha: Jo Allah ki azmat ke liye ek-doosre se muhabbat karte hain woh Allah Ta'ala ke sae mein hain — mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Qayamat ke din — jis din us ke sae ke siwa koi saya nahin Nabi, shaheed aur nek un ki Allah se qurbat par rashk karte hain"
"574","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ya'la bin Ata ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Waleed bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Idris al-A'izi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ubadah bin as-Samit ke paas aaya, aur unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen sirf Wahy bayan karunga jo Main ne Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban par suna: Meri muhabbat un ke liye lazim hai jo mujh mein ek-doosre se muhabbat karte hain; meri muhabbat un ke liye lazim hai jo mujh mein rishte jorate hain; meri muhabbat un ke liye lazim hai jo mujh mein ek-doosre ke liye mukhalisa hain — ya unhon ne kaha: Meri muhabbat un ke liye lazim hai jo mujh mein ek-doosre ke liye kharch karte hain"
"575","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Idris al-Khaulani se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ki majlis mein tha, mein Ubadah bin as-saamita. Unhon ne witr ka zikr kiya; kuch ne kaha: Farz, doosron ne kaha: Sunnat Ubadah bin as-Samit ne kaha: Jahan tak mera miskeen hai, main gawahi deta hun ke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jibreel, Alaihissalam mere paas Allah, Tabaraka wa Ta'ala ki taraf se aae aur kaha: Aey Muhammad, Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main ne tumhari ummat par paanch namazen farz ki hain jo unhen un ke wuzu, un ke waqton, un ke ruku aur un ke sajde ke sath mile, us ke liye mere paas is se ahd hai ke main use is se jannat mein dakhil karunga jo mujh se mile us mein se kisi mein kam karte hue — ya us ke jaisi baat — us ke liye mujh se koi ahd nahin; agar main chaahun to use azab dun, aur agar main chaahun to us par raham karun"
"576","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah se milne se muhabbat kare, Allah us se milne se muhabbat karta hai; aur jo Allah se milne se nafrat kare, Allah us se milne se nafrat karta hai"
"577","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'min ka khwab nubuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se ek hissa hai"
"578","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit aur Humaid se, Anas se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikle apne sahaba ko Lailatul-Qadr ki khabar dene ka irada karte hue, jab do aadmi jhagda Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main nikla tha tumhen Lailatul-Qadr ki khabar dene ka irada karte hue, lekin do aadmi ummiyah, to woh mujh se uthai gayi use aakhri das mein talash karo: Baqi hui saatwin mein, ya baqi hui nawin mein, ya baqi hui panchwin mein"
"579","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Wahid bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata Ibn Abi Rabah se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Waleed bin Ubadah bin as-Samit ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bulaya aur kaha: Aey mere bete, Allah se daro, aur jano tum Allah se nahin daroge yahan tak ke Allah par iman lao aur taqdeer par iman lao, tamam, us ki bhalai aur buraaii. agar tum is ke siwa par mare to aag mein dakhil hoge Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sab pehli cheez jo Allah ne paida ki qalam thi Us ne farmaya: Likha. us ne kaha: Aey Rabb, main Kya likhuun? Us ne farmaya: Taqdeer likh: Jo tha, aur jo hoga, hamesha"
"580","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Rashid se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh aurat jo zacagii mein mare — us ka bachcha use qayamat ke din apni istidad ki gosht se jannat ki taraf khiincegaa."
"581","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid se, jinhon Abu Qilabah ko Abu al-Ash'as se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se bai'at li jaise Aap ne aurton se li thi: Ke ham Allah ke sath kuch Shareek na karen, chori na karen, zina na karen, apni aulaad ko qatl na karen, aur neki mein un ki nafarmani na karen tum mein se jo hadd wale mamanuua kaamon mein se koi kare aur us par hadd qayam ki jae to woh us ke liye kaffara hai; aur jise muaf kiya jae, us ka muamla Allah Ta'ala ke paas hai — agar woh chahe to use azab de, aur agar chahe to use muaf kare"
"582","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid se, jinhon Abu Qilabah ko Abu al-Ash'as se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi doosre ki chughli na kare Abu Muhammad ne kaha: Yahan chughli ka matlab cughalakhorii hai"
"583","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ar-Rabi bin Subaih ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, bin as-Samit se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chandi chandi ke badle, Sona sone ke badle, khajoor khajoor ke badle, gehn gehn ke badle, jau jau ke badle, aur namak namak ke badle, barabar barabar ke badle — ya unhon ne kaha: Wazan wazan ke badle is tarah ar-Rabi ne bayan kiya"
"584","[AI-translation] Unhon ne kaha: Abu Sufyan aur Muhammad bin al-Mughirah donon ne ham se bayan kiya, an-Nu'man se, Ibrahim bin tahamaana se, Hisham se, Muhammad se, Abu al-Ash'as se, unhon ne kaha: Ek kaliisiyaa ne Ubadah aur mujhe jama kiya, aur unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya — aur Unhon ne usi jaisi baat zikr ki Salamah bin Alqamah ne bhi Ise Muhammad bin Sireen se, Muslim bin Yasar se, Ubadah se riwayat kiya"
"585","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr bin Hafs se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne bin musabbiha ko — ya Abu musabbiha ko — Shurahbil bin as-simta se, Ubadah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdullah bin Rawahah ki iyadat ki, jo un ke liye apne bistar se hal nahin rakhte the Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum meri ummat ke shaheed kise samajhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Jo Allah ke raste mein qatl kiya jae Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waqt meri ummat ke shaheed waqaee thode honge qatl kiya jana shahadat hai, taoon shahadat hai, pet ki beemari shahadat hai, aur woh aurat jise us ka bachcha zacagii mein maar de shahiidaa hai"
"586","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe khabar di gayi ke Ubadah bin as-Samit ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Allah Ta'ala ke qaul un ke liye duniya ki zindagi aur aakhirat mein khushkhabri hai ke bare mein poocha Aap ne farmaya: Woh nek khwab hai jo Musalman dekhe ya us ke liye dekha jae"
"587","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Ubadah se Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur bin Fuzalah ne is ka zikr kiya al-Hasan se, Hittan bin Abdullah ar-Raqashi se, Ubadah se, ke jab Wahy Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par utarti to us ka asar Aap pahchana jata phir aayat, ya Allah un ke liye rasta muqarrar karta hai, nazil hui, aur jab Wahy uthi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lo, lo; Allah ne un ke liye rasta muqarrar kiya hai kunwari kunwari ke sath: Sau kode aur saal bhar ki jilawatni; shadishuda shadishuda ke sath: Sau kode aur patthron se rajma."
"588","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Muslim Ibn Abi al-vaddaaha ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Ahwas bin Hakim se, Khalid bin maadaana se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi namaz achchi tarah padhe, us ke ruku aur sajde mutawajjuh karte hue, to namaz kehti hai: Allah tumhari hifazat kare jaisa Tum ne meri hifazat ki, aur woh uthai jati hai aur jab woh namaz buri tarah padhe, us ke ruku aur sajde mutawajjuh na karte hue, to namaz kehti hai: Allah tumhen zaya kare jaisa Tum ne mujhe zaya kiya; woh lapetii jati hai jaise purana kapda tilawat jata hai, aur us ka chehra us se mara jata hai"
"589","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr bin Hafs Ibn Umar bin Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin muhairiza ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se aadmiyon se — ya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi se — jinhon kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein log honge jo sharab pienge, use doosre naam se pukarta hue yeh hadees Abu Bakr bin Hafs se, bin muhairiza se, Sabit bin as-simta se, Ubadah bin as-Samit se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bhi riwayat ki gayi"
"590","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Aban ne ham se bayan kiya, Alqamah bin Marsad se, ash-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Ubadah bin as-Samit ne Mu'awiyah ki maujudgi mein kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo badan cota pae jo khoon-baha ke aadhe tak pahunche aur muaf kare, us ke aadhe gunah mitayi jate hain; aur agar woh tihai ya chauthai ho to usi ke hisab se ek aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Kya Tum ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna? Ubadah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Main ne waqaee yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna"
"591","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aun Ibn Abi Juhaifah se, un ke walid se, al-Bara bin Azib se, Abu Ayyub se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) suraj ke nikle aur awaz suni, aur farmaya: Yahudi apni qabron mein azab diye ja rahe hain"
"592","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abu Ayyub al-Ansari ke mehmaan thehre, aur jab bhi khana khate to us ka bacha hua unhen bhejte, to Abu Ayyub Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hath ki jagah dekhte aur apna hath wahan rakhte ek din Unhon ne unhen khana bheja lekin us mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki ungliyon ka koi nishan na dekha, to woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne tumhari ungliyon ka nishan na dekha Aap ne farmaya: Us mein lahasuna tha Shu'bah ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Kya woh haram hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahin aur Hammad ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Aap ne mujhe woh bheja jo Aap ne nahin khaya Aap ne farmaya: Tum meri tarah nahin; farishta mere paas aata hai, aur tum meri tarah nahin is tarah Abu Dawud ne hamen khabar di aur gundara ne Ise Shu'bah se, Simak se, Jabir se, Abu Ayyub se riwayat kiya"
"593","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, Abdullah bin Yazid se, Abu Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muzdalifah mein Maghrib aur Isha ki namazen jama kiya"
"594","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Laila se, un ke bhai se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, Abu Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se ek chheenke to kahe: Har haal mein Allah ki tareef; aur jo use jawab de woh kahe: Allah tum par raham kare; aur woh jawab de: Allah tumhen hidayat de aur tumhare kaam sanvaare."
"595","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ata bin Yazid al-Laisi se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye halal nahin ke apne bhai ko teen din se zyada chhore; woh milte hain aur yeh munh deta hai aur yeh munh deta hai, aur donon mein behtar woh hai jo salam se shuru kare"
"596","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin budaila al-hain ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ata bin Yazid al-Laisi se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Witr ki namaz haq hai — ya farza. jo chahe saat se witr padhe, jo chahe paanch se, jo chahe teen se, aur jo chahe ek se; aur jo majboor ho woh ishare se ishara kare Yazid bin Raziyallahu ne Ise Sufyan bin Husain se, Zuhri se, Ata bin Yazid se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat kiya"
"597","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Sa'id se, Umar bin Sabit se, Abu Ayyub se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan ke roze rakhe phir us ke baad Shawwal ke chhe din rakhe, woh saal bhar ka roza hai"
"598","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Uqbah se, Bukair bin Abdullah bin al-hai se, un ke walid se, Ubaid se — jo bin tila hain — Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne janwar ko nishaane ke taur par bandhne se mana farmaya Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Agar woh murghi hoti to main use na baandhataa. Abdur Rahman — jinhon chaar mazboot ajami qatl kiye the — jab Unhon ne yeh hadees suni to chaar ghulam aazad kiye"
"599","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Quraish bin Hayyan ne ham se bayan kiya, Wasil bin Sulaim se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Ayyub al-Azdi ke paas aaya aur un se musafaha kiya, aur Unhon ne mere nakhun lamba dekhe unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Aap se poochte aaya, aur Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek mujh se aasman ki khabar poochta hai jabke apne nakhun parindon ke panjon jaise chhore hue, mein najasat aur mail jama hoti hai Abu Mas'ud ne Ise al-aqadii se, Quraish se, Sulaiman bin farruukha se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se mila — aur Unhon ne al-Azdi nahin kaha — aur Unhon ne usi jaisi baat zikr ki"
"600","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur doosron ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidah se, Ibrahim se, malik bin minajaaba se, qazaaa se, qarsa se, Abu Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas thehre, aur woh Zuhr ki namaz se pahle chaar rak'aten padhte the Main ne un se us ke bare mein poocha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Aasman ke darwaze khole jate hain aur band nahin hote yahan tak ke Zuhr ki namaz padhi jae unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya tum un ke darmiyan salam pherte ho? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, siwae un ke aakhir mein"
